<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Shanjo</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibuka lya Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibuka lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Luka aa sukulula byo bumi bwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />U bungi bo bantu na ba jeleka uku ñola no ku sukulula i bintu na bya vumbilizwa mukati ketu, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />ku ja ko bu na ba bi tu sukulwila etanzi, mi na ba ba a bampaki aba na ba bi bona no baika ba Nyambe ko ku ziga ijwi lyakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Aa se ndi la bi shakisisi no ku bi shugwilisa byonse ku zwa ku matatikilo, kale nda bona neme buti ndi ku ñolele negwe gwe muntu u kutekea Teofile ko ku bi nunga-nunga nenja, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />buti negwe u zibe no ku shugwilisa initi jo bintu na gwa zigigwa byonse.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iñiloi aa li kuluwiza Zakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mu nako jo mfumu Eloda gwelonga lya Judeya, nko ka li u mupulisiti ka kugigwa Zakaliya uju ka li go cipani co bupulisiti bwa Abija. Mukazi gwakwe Elizabesi nage kame ka li go luasi lwa Aloni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Zakaliya no mukazi gwakwe bonse ka ba lulikile mu mensho ga Nyambe, na ba kutika i milao no bilagantu byo Mfumu bu bulite u mulandu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Kono ta ka ba kwesi u mwana kakuli Elizabesi ta ka gola uku sumbala, mi bonse se ka ba kalampaite wawa.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ijuba limwinya i cipani ca Zakaliya aa ka ci li a musebezi mi Zakaliya na sebeza ko ku ba u mupulisiti gwa Nyambe, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />kebaka lyo bupulisiti kale ga shaligwa ko ku tenda iñeela uku ngina mu tempele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I tempele ni njugo inene ja Nyambe iji ka ji gwanaala bulyo mu munzi gwa Jelusalema u mu ka ba lapelelanga a Maisilaele. Ka ba zuminanga buti Nyambe mwali momo mu njugo.</char></note> jo Mfumu buti a ka tente insense. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mi inako aa na ja sika jo ku tenta insense, a balapeli bonse ka ba gwanene na ba lapelela kunze.<figure style="fig" alt="Zechariah and the altar of incense" file="lb00263b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 1:8-17" ref="1:8-17">Zakaliya a lutala lo ku tentela insense</figure><verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Cwale iñiloi lyo Mfumu kale lya bonaala kwakwe, na li zimene ku mulyo go lutala lo insense. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakaliya aa li bona, kale ga cindumuka mi kale ga joga lwini. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Kono iñiloi kale lya mu ta na lyo, “Zakaliya! U leke uku joga, intapelo jako na ja shugwigwa. U mukazi gwako Elizabesi, kuti na ku bonene u mwana go muninzana, mi kuti no mu gulike izina lya Joani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Kuti na ku jangaze no ku ku nyangulula, mi a bangi kuti na ba jangale kebaka lyo ku bonigwa kwakwe, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />kakuli ige kuti na be u munene mu mensho go Mfumu. Ta na nywe waine kampa i cinywantu conse ici ci dakwisa, mi kuti na vumbigwe ko Moya go Kucena nanga na sini uku bonigwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Kuti na sigulwile u bungi bo bantu ba Isilaele ku Mfumu Nyambe gwabo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Mi ndege na tangile uku keza u Mfumu na sini. Kuti na keze mu moya ne nguzu ja Eliya, keza ku sigulwila i myojo jo bazazi ku banabo na ba ta ba kutiki u mulao ku magano go bantu ba lulikile. Ndege na lulikize a bantu buti ba litukiseze u Mfumu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakaliya kale ga buza iñiloi nage, “Mbuti ndi gola uku zibila byebyo? Kakuli se ndi li nkosi sa kalampaite no mukazi gwangu nage se ni nkalamba.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Iñiloi kale lya mu ta na lyo, “Ndime Gabbuliele. Ndime ndi zimananga afuwi no Nyambe, mi ndi la tumigwa buti ndi keze ndi gambe negwe no ku ku lugwila gaga a majwi a malotu. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Mi cwale aano kuti no ombelele no ku kangwa uku gamba ku twala kwijuba na bi tendaale, kakuli to la zumini a majwi gangu, kono ibi ndi la gambi byonse kuti na bi tendaale mu nako jabyo iji ji botete.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mwa jejo inako, a bantu ka ba lindile Zakaliya, na ba komoketwe buti ncinzi a tagamine bulyao mu tempele. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Aa sa la anini kunze, kale ga kangwa uku gamba nabo. A bantu kale ba nangula buti ncibonwa a la ka boni mu tempele, kakuli ka zundamine uku ba julaikila kono kale ga sigala bu kangwite uku gamba.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Inako jakwe jo ku sebeza aa se ji la mani, kale ga bogola ku njugo jakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo mukazi gwakwe Elizabesi kale ga sumbala mi kale ga li bika a myezi ja 5. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Kale ga ta nage, “Nu Mfumu na ga bi ndi tendela byebi mwa ga gano a majuba na ga bonisa i cisemo cakwe no ku zwisa inshoni jangu mukati ko bantu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo ku bonigwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mu kwezi ko bu 6 ko busumba bwa Elizabesi, Nyambe kale ga tuma iñiloi li kugigwa Gabbuliele, mu munzi gwa mwilonga lya Galileya ugu ka gu kugigwa Nanzaleta, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ku mwalyansho ka kugigwa Maliya, uju ka gungilikizwe ku nkosi gwezina lya Josefa, uju ka li go luasi lwa Deviti. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Iñiloi kale lya keza kwakwe no ku mu ta na lyo, “U joje nenja! Igwe u kwesi i cisemo ko bunene! U Mfumu negwe a kele.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maliya kale ga zielea lwini mi kale ga komokwa ku majwi ka li mu zuminiza kago iñiloi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Kono iñiloi kale lya mu ta na lyo, “Maliya, U leke uku joga, kakuli u la gwani i cisemo kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Cwale ngo lole, kuti no sumbale no bone u mwana go muninzana, mi kuti no mu gulike izina lya Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ige kuti na be u munene, na kugigwe Mwana Nyambe Sakapanga, mi u Mfumu Nyambe kuti na mu we i cikalo co bumfumu bwa sukuze Deviti. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Kuti na buse a bantu bo luasi lwa Jakobo inako jonse, mi u bumfumu bwakwe ta na bu mane.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliya kale ga buza iñiloi nage, “Mbuti na bi golaalile byebyo kakuli ime ndi li naluleya?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Iñiloi kale lya mu taba na lyo, “U Moya go Kucena kuti na gu keze egulu lyako, mi inguzu ja Nyambe Sakapanga kuti na ji ku vwike. Mi go kucena uju no bone kuti na kugigwe Mwana Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nanga ndi mukwako Elizabesi kuti na be no mwana mu bukalamba bwakwe, mi ko kuno se nkwezi ko bu 6 ko busumba bwakwe, no ku ka ba tanga a bantu buti ta boni u luasi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kakuli takuli ici ta ci golaali kwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maliya kale ga ta iñiloi nage, “Ndi li muika gwa Nyambe, ibi u la gambi byonse kwangu, bi vumbilizwe.” Cwale iñiloi kale lya mu leka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya aa potela Elizabesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Momo mu majuba, Maliya kale ga litukiseza no ku welangila ku munzi gumwinya gwa ku malundu ga mwilonga lya Judeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Kale ga ka ngina mwilapa lya Zakaliya no ka zuminiza Elizabesi. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizabesi aa shugwa inzuminizo ja Maliya u mucece ka li mwivumo lyakwe kale ga ukuta. Mi Elizabesi kale ga vumba ko Moya go Kucena, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />mi kale ga jabuza Maliya lwini nage, “U li kwesi imfwijaguzi mukati ko banakazi bonse, mane no mucece no bone ngwa mfwijaguzi! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mbuti ndi la gwanini i cisemo, buti nyina ba Mfumwangu a ndi potele? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Kakuli aa ndi la shugwi bulyo ijwi lyako, u mucece gwangu mwivumo, kale ga ukuta bu jangele. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />U li kwesi imfwijaguzi kakuli na gwa zumina buti Nyambe kuti na vumbilize inkuluwizi jakwe kwako!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">U lwimbo lwa Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mi Maliya kale ga ta nage,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 1:46" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“U mojo gwangu gwa sa lumba u Mfumu Nyambe,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />mi u moya gwangu gwa sa jangala kwa Nyambe <optbreak />u Mujojesi gwangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />kakuli na ga vuluka u mukalilo go bugomba bo muika gwakwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Mi ku zwa aano i mikoga jonse ja ansi kuti na ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ndi kuge go mfwijaguzi.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kakuli Nyambe go nguzu na ga ndi tendela i bintu i binene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">mi izina lyakwe ndya kucena.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ndege a wa inse jakwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">ku bantu aba ba mu jogete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">mu mikoga-koga jo bantu.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Na ga tenda i bintu byo nguzu ko kuboko kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">na ga mwaga-mwaga a bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">aba ba litunta mu migajalo jabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />A bajendesi na ga ba susa mu bikalo byabo byo bumfumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">kono na ga nanuna a bagomba.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Na ga lela aba ka ba fwite injala ko bintu i bilotu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">kono bo lubono na ga ba bogoza uku takuli ici ba kwesi.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Na ga tusa u muika gwakwe Isilaele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">ta na ga mu zibala kakuli a li kwesi inse<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />ku tatikila kwa Abbulaama no maasi gakwe ku twala koko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">sinagwe ubu sa kuluwiliza ku basukuzetu ba ku nkulu-katanzi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliya kale ga potela Elizabesi a majuba ga sika a myezi jo tatwe mi kale ga bogwela kwabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku bonigwa kwa Joani u mukolobezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Inako ja Elizabesi jo ku bona u mucece aa se ji la siki, kale ga bona u mucece go muninzana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />A bakwakwe na ba ka ba sumpite nabo aa ba shugwa buti Nyambe na ga mu bonisa inse inene, kale ba jangala no Elizabesi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwijuba lyo bu 8, a bakwakwe ba Zakaliya kale ba twala u mucece ku mukanda. Kale ba gaja buti ba mu gulike izina lyesi Zakaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Kono nyina kale ga kana nage, “Inga! Izina lyakwe ndi Joani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />A bakwakwe kale ba kana mi kale ba mu ta nabo, “Igwe buti? Takuli uju a kwesi lelyo izina ku bakwako bonse.”<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Kale ba labiza isi buti aba lugwile izina ili ka shaka uku gulika u mucece. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakaliya kale ga ba kumbila iala, mi kale ga ñolao buti, “Izina lyakwe ndi Joani.” Mi a bantu bonse kale ba komokwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Aobulyo, kale ga tatika uku gamba mi kale ga lumba Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Aba ka sumpite nabo bonse kale ba joga lwini mi jejo intaba kale ja ba i ñambagulo jo bantu bonse aba ka ba joja mu malundu ga mwilonga lyonse lya Judeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />A bantu bonse aba ka ba shugwa bulyao kale ba bi gaja, mi kale ba li buza nabo, “Aa na kule joju u mucece, mbuti na kalile?” Kakuli ka ku li bonaaza wawa buti inguzu jo Mfumu Nyambe ka ji li kwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">U lwimbo lwa Zakaliya u muboni gwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Cwale Zakaliya isi ba Joani, kale ga vumba u Moya go Kucena mi kale ga gamba ko buboni nage,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Ku lumbigwe u Mfumu, Nyambe gwa Isilaele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">kakuli na ga keza ku bantu bakwe mi na ga ba lamwina.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Na ga tu tumina u Mujojesi go nguzu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">ku zwililila mu mukoga go muika gwakwe Deviti<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />ubu sa tu kuluwiza kale-kale ko baboni bakwe ba cenete,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />buti kuti na tu jojese kwa ba ba tu zimbite no ku tu zwisa ku nguzu jabo bonse,<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />no ku bonisa inse ku basukuzetu ba ku nkulu-katanzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">no ku vuluka inzumininano jakwe iji ji cenete,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />iji sa kuluwiza ko ku konka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73">kwa sukuzetu Abbulaama,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ko ku tu lamwina ku nguzu ja ba ba tu zimbite, buti tu gole uku mu sebeleza uku ta tu kwesi ilyoga,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />mu kucena no mu ku lulikila mu bumi bwetu bonse.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Mi igwe, gwe mwanangu, kuti no kugigwe u muboni gwa Nyambe Sakapanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ndigwe no li tangize u Mfumu na sini u keza ku mu shabwila inzila.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Ndigwe no zibise a bantu byo njojeso ko nkwatilo jo bitendantu i bimangoju byabo,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />kebaka lyonse inene ja Nyambe gwetu, uju na ga shaligwa kuti na bonaale mukati ketu na zwa kwigulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">sinagwe ndi juba li ñatula.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Kuti na we a magano ku bantu ta be zi bya Nyambe sinagwe ndituba li munika mu kansindwe no mu munzule go lufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">no ku jendesa a matende getu mu nzila jo ku joja nenja.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mi u mwanuke, ka kula no ku gongola mu moya mi ka joja mu mangusu ku twala mu nako na ga bonaala wawa ku bantu ba Isilaele.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Uku bonigwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Momo mu majuba, kale kwa zwa indagano kwa Sesale Ogasito iji ji ta buti ku baligwe a bantu bonse ba mu malonga gakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ncibalo ce tanzi se ci tendaala, Kuilino aa ka li mubusisi gwelonga lya Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />A bantu bonse ka ba janga ku minzi ji basukuzabo ku ka ñolegwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />No Josefa, kale ga nanuka ku zwa mwilonga lya Galileya mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta ku ja kwilonga lya Judeya mu munzi gwa Deviti, ugu ka gu kugigwa Bbeteleema, kakuli ka li go mukoga gwa Deviti. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Josefa kale ga ja ku ku li ñolesa no Maliya uju ka gungilikize mi a majuba gakwe go ku bona u mucece se ka ga li afuwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Inako kale ja sika jo ku bonigwa ko mucece na ba si ka li koko. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Mi kale ga bona mwane go mueli, kale ga mu vwika mu masila no ku mu lalika mu mukungu kakuli ta ka ba kwesi i cibaka mu njugo jo banyenda.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">A balisani no mañiloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mo ka ba li a balisani ka ba joja mu lugwa lwa afuwi, aba ka ba mamela i migona jabo jongu a masiku. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Iñiloi lyo Mfumu Nyambe kale lya bonaala kwabo mi impazimo jo Mfumu Nyambe kale ja ba munika ao ka ba kele, mi kale ba joga lwini. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Iñiloi kale lya ba ta na lyo, “Mu leke uku joga kakuli a majwi a malotu ndi mi lugwila aga na ga lete uku jangala u kunene ku bantu bonse. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Shunu mu la bonenwa u Mujojesi mu munzi gwa Deviti, ndi Kilesite, u Mfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ici sa ka ci ka be i cijuliko kwenu nci ceci, kuti mu ka gwane u mucece a vutwizwe mu masila na lalikitwe mu mukungu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Aobulyo a kagugi ko nguzu ko mañiloi ga kwigulu aga ga gwanene no lelyo iñiloi lyetanzi kale ga bonaala na ga lumba Nyambe nago,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Impazimo ji be kwa Nyambe gwa kwigulu lya kwigulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">mi uku joja nenja ku be ansi ku bantu aa ci kele i cisemo ca Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />A mañiloi aa se ga la bogoli kwigulu, a balisani kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Ndokweni kwa Bbeteleema tu ka bone ibi a la tu gambaguzi u Mfumu Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Kale ba zimana ku welangila kwa Bbeteleema mi kale ba ka gwana Maliya no Josefa no mucece, na lalikitwe mu mukungu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Aa na ba mu bona, kale ba ja bu gambaguza a bantu kwe bi na bya tendaala ibi na ba lugwilwa byo mucece, <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />mi aba ka ba shugwa bonse ka ba komokwa ibi ka ba ba sukulwila a balisani. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Kono Maliya ka li bikile byonse byebyo i bintu mu mojo gwakwe mi ta ka bi zibala. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />A balisani kale ba bogola bu lumba Nyambe kebaka lyo bintu na ba shugwa no ku bona ku ja ubu na bya sukulwilwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa letigwa mu tempele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mwijuba lyo bu 8, lyo ku twala u mwanuke ku mukanda, kale ga gulikigwa izina lya Jesu izina ili na lya mu gulika iñiloi na sini uku sumbaligwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Inako jo ku li cenesa ku ja ko mulao gwa Mushe aa se ji la siki, Josefa no Maliya kale ba twala u mwanuke kwa Jelusalema buti ba ka mu gungilikize ku Mfumu Nyambe <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />ku ja ko bu ku ñolelwe mu mulao go Mfumu Nyambe buti, “U mwana gense go mueli go muninzana na gungilikizwe u Mfumu Nyambe.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Lujendo 13:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kale ba ka wa i citagilo ko ku zumininana ne ci ci tegwa mu mulao go Mfumu Nyambe co, “banziba bo bile kampa u tunkwilimba-gana to bile.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Livitike 12:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Cwale nko ka li unkosi mwa Jelusalema uju ka kugigwa Simioni. Ka lulikile no ku sepaala. Ka lindile inkuluwizi ja Nyambe jo ku jojesa Isilaele. Mi u Moya go Kucena ka gu li kwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />U Moya go Kucena se gu mu ganwina buti ta na fwe na sini uku bona u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Kilesite” mu Cigelike.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Kale ga keza mu tumpetu to tempele na jendesegwa ku Moya mi Maliya no Josefa aa ba leta u mwanuke Jesu, buti ku tendaale kwakwe ku ja ko bu gu co u mulao, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simioni kale ga mu indila mu maboko gakwe mi kale ga lumba Nyambe nage,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Cwale u Mfumu Nyambe go nguzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">u ndi lukulule nenja ime nde muika gwako.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kakuli ndi la boni injojeso jako,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />iji na gwa tendela a bantu bonse buti ba ji bone,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />ituba ili li bonisa a bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">no ku ba impazimo ku bantu bako ba Isilaele.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Isi no nyina kale ba komokwa kwe bi ka bi gambilwa ku mwanuke. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Mi Simioni kale ga ba wa imfwijaguzi mi kale ga ta Maliya, nyina nage, “Joju u mwanuke a li tungulwize ku ku leta uku gwa no ku zimana ko bantu a bangi mwa Isilaele, no ku ba i cijuliko ici na ci kwagigwe, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />buti i bigajantu bya mu myojo jo bantu a bangi bi ganunwe. Mi kuti no shugwe uku shisha ku mojo gwako sinagwe nkafulo a kanene ka ku wejelele.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">U buboni bwa Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Nko ka li u muboni gwa Nyambe go mwanakazi mwa Jelusalema, mwana Fanuele, go luasi lwa Asele, izina lyakwe ka li Ana. Se ka li nkalamba wawa. Ku zwa ku bwalyansho bwakwe, sa joja mu maseswa no nkosi gwakwe i myaka ja 7, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />ku zwao, sa joja mu bumfwilwa mane na ka sika a myaka jo makumi ga 8 no jone. Ka lapela a masiku no kamwi, ko ku li nyima i bilyo no ku lapela. Mi ka zundamine uku janga ku tempele. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Nage kale ga keza kwabo momo mu nako, mi kale ga litumela kwa Nyambe no ku gambagula byo mwanuke ku bantu bonse aba ka ba lindile indamwino jo munzi gwa Jelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">U bumi bwa Jesu mwa Nanzaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Josefa no Maliya aa se ba la mani uku tenda i bintu byonse ku ja ko bu ka gu co u mulao go Mfumu Nyambe, kale ba bogola kwilonga lya Galileya mu munzi gwabo gwa Nanzaleta. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mi u mwana ka kula no ku gongola, mi ka vumbite ko magano, mi i cisemo ca Nyambe ka ci li kwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu mwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Mu mwaka mu mwaka a bazazi ba Jesu ka ba janga kwa Jelusalema ku Mukiti go Mpaseka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Jesu aa se ka kwesi i myaka je kumi no jo bile, ba Maliya no Josefa, kale ba ja ku mukiti kame ubu ka ba tendelanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />A majuba go mukiti aa se ga la mani, a bazazi ba Jesu kale ba bogola ku munzi gwabo, kono Jesu kale ga sigala mwa Jelusalema a bazazi bakwe uku ta be zi. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Kale ba jenda bulyao lelyo ijuba na ba gaja buti nage ba jenda mukati ko bantu. Mi kale ba tatika uku mu shaka mukati ko bakwabo no basele babo.<verse eid="LUK 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Aa se ba la kangwi uku mu gwana, kale ba bogola kwa Jelusalema bu mu shaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Aa na kwa mana a majuba go tatwe, kale ba ka mu gwana mu tumpetu to tempele, na kele mukati ko bazigi, na ba tegeleze no ku ba buzagula a mabuzi. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Mi aba ka ba mu shugwa bonse ka ba komokwa ko nshugwiliso no ku matabo gakwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />A bazazi bakwe aa ba mu bona, kale ba komokwa mi nyina kale ga mu ta nage, “Mwanangu, ncinzi aa na gwa tu tenda bulyao? Ngolole, isho neme se tu li tongaukite muno tu ja bu ku shaka.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ige kale ga ba buza nage, “Mbinzi ka mu ndi shakila? Ta ka mwizi buti ndi li botele uku kala mu njugo ja Tata?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kono abo ta na ba shugwilisa ibi ka ba tela.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Abo kale ba nanuka mi kale ba inda Jesu, no ku bogola nage kwa Nanzaleta. Jesu ta ka shwauza a bazazi bakwe, mi nyina ka li bikile byonse byebyo i bintu mu mojo gwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Jesu ka kula mu magano no mubili, mi ka jangaza Nyambe no bantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Joani aa kolobeza a bantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Male 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joa 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu mwaka go bu 15 go ku busa kwa Tibbeliasi Sesale, Ponso Pilato aa ka li mubusisi gwelonga lya Judeya, Eloda na li mfumu gwelonga lya Galileya, mukulwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I bibele lyo cilwizi no mabibele go mishobo jimwinya mbuti ga co buti Filipi ka li mutompo kwa Eloda.</char></note> Filipi na li mfumu gwelonga lya Ituleya no gwelonga lya Tilakonita, Lisaniasi ka li mfumu gwelonga lya Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ana no Kayafa na ba li mapulisiti a bakulu, ijwi lya Nyambe kale lya keza kwa Joani mwana Zakaliya na li mu mangusu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Kale ga ja mwilonga lyonse ili li bambene no Lwizi lwa Joodani na ja bu tandaza a bantu byo nkolobezo jo nsiguluko no nkwatilo jo bitendantu i bimangoju. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Sinagwe ubu ku ñolelwe mwibuka lyo majwi go muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Ijwi lyo ju a kugiliza mu mangusu li ta buti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mu shabule inzila jo Mfumu, mu mu golwele a mazila.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />A malindi gonse kuti na ga lailigwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mi a malundu gonse no malundu-gana kuti na ga selezwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">A mazila go ku eta kuti na ga gololwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">a mazila go madulu-dulu ga tendigwe nenja. <verse eid="LUK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Mi a bantu bonse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">kuti na ba bone injojeso ja Nyambe.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isaya 40:3-5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Joani ka kwesi uku gambaguza a bantu a bangi aba ka ba keza ku ku kolobezigwa kwakwe nage, “Inwe mwe bana bo bili! Ndini na ga mi nanguza uku anda ku bukali ubu bu keza? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mu ake i biyango ibi bi jendelela no nsiguluko. Mi mu leke uku tatika uku li ta mwebeni buti, ‘Isetu ndi Abbulaama.’ Kakuli nda sa mi lugwila buti Nyambe a la gola uku tendela Abbulaama a bana a gaga mabwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />A katemu se ka li kambikitwe a muisi go bishamu, mi i cishamu conse ici ta ci aki i biyango i bilotu, kuti na ci temigwe, no ku shonjigwa mu mulilo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />U bungi bo bantu kale ba mu buza nabo, “Cwale mbinzi tu botele uku tenda?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Kale ga ba taba nage, “Uju a kwesi i bizwato byo bile, a weko uju ta kwesi, no jwa kwesi i bilyo a tende bulyao.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />A batentesi nabo kale ba keza ku ku kolobezigwa mi kale ba mu buza buti, “Muzigi, mbinzi tu botele uku tenda?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu leke uku tentekisanga ku itiliza ubu mu botelele.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Cwale a masole bamwinya kale ba mu buza nabo, “Mbinzi tu botele uku tenda?” Kale ga ba taba nage, “Mu leke ku indanga a masheleñi ko ku tapanga no ku shangezanga a bantu byo manya, mu logwe a masheleñi aga mu ola.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />A bantu ka ba lindile bu zilwize mi bonse ka ba kwesi uku li buza mu myojo jabo buti bunga Joani nde Mushaligwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Joani kale ga ba taba bonse nage, “Ime kame ndi mi kolobeza mu menzi, kono jumwinya a la keza uju a ndi ita ku nguzu, buti mane ta ndi botele uku shumununa u tushuminiso to nshangu jakwe. Ndege na mi kolobeze ko Moya go Kucena no ko mulilo. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />I civuluso mu maganja gakwe ci li mi kuti na vulule a maila gakwe a cindanda, na tule u bweke mu mayongo gakwe, u luungu kuti na lu tente mu mulilo ta gu zimi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani mu ntolongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Mi ko majwi a mangi gamwinya Joani kale ga indikiza a bantu no ku ba tandaza a majwi a malotu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Kono Joani aa sa la jukukili u mfumu Eloda kebaka lyo maseswa gakwe kwa Elodiasi muka mukulwe, mane no bintu bimwinya i bimangoju ibi sa tenda, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Eloda kale ga nunga ku bitendantu i bimangoju byakwe ko ku shumina no ku tula Joani mu ntolongo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kolobezigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Male 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />A bantu bonse aa ka ba kwesi uku kolobezigwa, Jesu nage kale ga kolobezigwa. Mi aa ka kwesi uku lapela, igulu kale lya galulwa <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />mi u Moya go Kucena kale gwa sezumukila akwe mu cibumbo co mubili go nziba. Mi kale kwa zwa ijwi kwigulu li ta buti, “Ndigwe Mwanangu, uju ndi shaka mi u la ndi jangaza.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mukoga gwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Jesu se ka shaka uku ba go myaka jo makumi go tatwe aa na ga tatika u musebezi gwakwe. A bantu kame ka ba mu gaja buti ndi mwana Josefa,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:23" />
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:23">mwana Eli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />mwana Matati, mwana Livi, mwana Meleki, mwana Janai, mwana Josefa,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwana Matatia, mwana Amosi, mwana Naumi, mwana Esilia, mwana Nagai,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />mwana Maate, mwana Matatia, mwana Semeini, mwana Joseke, mwana Joda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />mwana Joanani, mwana Lesa, mwana Zelubabele, mwana Sheyalutiyele, mwana Neli,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwana Meleki, mwana Adi, mwana Kasama, mwana Elimadama, mwana Ele<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />mwana Joshuwa, mwana Eliezele, mwana Jolimi, mwana Matati, mwana Livi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />mwana Simioni, mwana Juda, mwana Josefa, mwana Jonami, mwana Eliyakimi,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />mwana Melea, mwana Mena, mwana Matata, mwana Natani, mwana Deviti,<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />mwana Jese, mwana Obbedi, mwana Bboazi, mwana Salumoni, mwana Nashoni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />mwana Aminadabi, mwana Adamina, mwana Alani, mwana Ezilomi, mwana Falensi, mwana Juda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />mwana Jakobo, mwana Isaka, mwana Abbulaama, mwana Tela, mwana Naoli,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />mwana Selugi, mwana Lagau, mwana Faleki, mwana Ebele, mwana Sala,<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwana Kainani, mwana Alifakasadi, mwana Sema, mwana Nuwe, mwana Lameki,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mwana Metusela, mwana Inoki, mwana Jaledi, mwana Maalalele, mwana Kenani,<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />mwana Enosi, mwana Seta, mwana Adama, mwana Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Satani aa jeleka Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Male 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Jesu kale ga zwa ku Lwizi lwa Joodani na vumbite ko Moya go Kucena, mi u Moya kale gwa mu twala mu mangusu, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />u mu na ga ka jelekigwa kwa Satani mu majuba go makumi gone. Takuli ici na ga lya mwa gago majuba, mi aa se ga la mani, Jesu se ka fwite injala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Satani kale ga mu ta nage, “Ati ndigwe Mwana Nyambe, u lugwile lelyo ibwe li zoke u buobe.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ku li ñoletwe buti, ‘U muntu ta na joje a buobe bulyo.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Mulao 8:3</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Satani kale ga ka ja nage ku cibaka ci kambamite no ka mu sunda wangu-wangu i mibuso jonse ja mwilonga. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Kale ga mu ta nage, “Kuti na ndi ku we inguzu jonse no bulotu bwajo, kakuli na nda bi wegwa mi ndi la gola uku bi wa gense uju ndi shaka. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Cwale ati no ndi lapela, byonse kuti na bi be byako.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ku li ñoletwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 4:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">‘U lapele u Mfumu gwako Nyambe mi u mu sebeleze genke bulyo.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Mulao 6:13</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Satani kale ga mu twala mwa Jelusalema no ka mu lijika a bule wawa bo tempele, no ku ta buti, “Ati u li Mwana Nyambe, u li shonje gwemini ansi ku zwa aano. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kakuli ku li ñoletwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 4:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Kuti na lugwile a mañiloi gakwe kebaka lyako buti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">ga ku mamele nenja,<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />kuti na ga ku nanwine mwigulu mu maganja gago, <optbreak />buti itende lyako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">na li leke ka li gantula ebwe.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Nimbo 91:11-12</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Se ku gambigwa buti, ‘U leke uku jeleka u Mfumu Nyambe gwako.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Mulao 6:16</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Satani aa sa la mani jeji i mijeleko jonse, kale ga mu leka ku twala ku kaito ko nako jimwinya.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu mwa Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Male 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Jesu kale ga bogola kwa Galileya ku zwa mu mangusu u mu ka ka li mu nguzu jo Moya go Kucena, mi i ñambagulo jakwe ka ji jandulukila mwilonga lyonse. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Ka kwesi uku ziga mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A majugo go malapelelo go Majuda, majugo u mu ka ba gwananinanga a Majuda, ku bala a mabuka ga Mushe no ku kumbila i bintu kwa Nyambe. Mu Cigelike ka ba ga kuganga buti Masinagoge.</char></note> mi u muntu gense ka mu lumba.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Jesu kale ga ja kwa Nanzaleta uku na ga kulila, lyo Nsabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">U bungi bo mabuka na ga litusisa ijwi lyo Ciebelu lyo “Nsabata” ku toloka ijuba lyo ku wisa.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijuba lyo bu 7 mu nsunda, ili ta ka ba sebezanga a Majuda na ba lapela Nyambe mi mu Cishanjo ndya Mukibelo kampa ijuba lyo ku wisa.</char></note> kale ga ka ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, ko bu ka tendelanga. Kale ga zimana buti a bale, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />kale ba mu tambika ibuka lyo muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya, mi kale ga li vwikula no ku gwana aa ku ñoletwe buti,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“U moya go Mfumu Nyambe mpangu gu li,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">kakuli na ga ndi shala</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">buti ndi lugwile a bampale a majwi a malotu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Na ga ndi tuma buti ndi lugule intukuluo ku bantu ba li mu ntolongo, no ku bonesa a baofu, no ku lukulula aba ba pengisigwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />no ku lugula u mwaka go cisemo co Mfumu Nyambe.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isaya 61:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Cwale kale ga vwika ibuka, no ku li bogoza ku mumameli mi kale ga kala ansi. A bantu bonse mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda kale ba mu lolelela lwini.<verse eid="LUK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Jesu kale ga tatika ko ku ba lugwila buti, “Leli Iñolo mu zwa uku shugwa li la vumbilizwa shunu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bonse ka ba mu gamba nenja, mi ka ba komoketwe ku majwi go cisemo aga ka ga zwa mu kanwa kakwe. Kale ba buza nabo, “Ta li nde mwana Josefa joju?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ige kale ga ba ta nage, “Wawa kuti na mu ndi gambile gogu u mulya gu ta buti, ‘Muangi, li oze gwemwini!’ Mi kuti na mu ndi te buti, ‘U tende mo muno mu munzi gwako ibi na twa shugwa na gwa ka tenda mu munzi gwa Kapenauma.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Jesu kale ga nungako nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, takuli u muboni gwa Nyambe a tambulwa mu munzi gwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Mbyaconse buti nko ka ba li a banakazi bo bamfwilwa a bangi mwa Isilaele mu nako jo muboni gwa Nyambe Eliya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eliya, muboni gwa Nyambe sa joja ku kale-kale koko. Ku zwa kwakwe keza ku ku bonigwa kwa Jesu se ku ita i myaka ja 700. Ka li muboni, mugambi no mutendi go mamakazo.</char></note> aa na kwa ba ne lungu ili na lya inda i myaka jo tatwe ne myezi ja 6, mi na kwa ba ne njala inene mwilonga lyonse. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Kono kwa babo a banakazi bo bamfwilwa takuli uku sa tuminwa Eliya mbwita ku mwanakazi go mfwilwa gwa mu munzi gwa Salepita mwilonga lya Sidoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sidoni, ilonga lya Sidoni, ntaka li li mwilonga lya Isilaele.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kame nko ka ba li a balwele bo cisenda a bangi mwilonga lya Isilaele mu nako jo muboni gwa Nyambe Elisha kono takuli nanga genke gwabo uju na ga ozwa, mbwita Naamani gwa kwilonga lya Siliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />A bantu bonse aba ka ba li mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, kale ba nyegela aa ba shugwa bulyao. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Kale ba nanuka no ku mu timba-timbila kunze jo munzi ku nsezumusi jelundu aa ka gu jakitwe u munzi gwabo, buti ba ka mu shonjele a cikonkomwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kono Jesu kale ga li itila mukati ko bantu a bangi na ka li jila.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza u muntu ka kwesi u moya u mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Male 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Lyo Nsabata Jesu kale ga ja ku munzi gwa mwilonga lya Galileya ugu ka gu kugigwa Kapenauma mi kale ga ka ziga a bantu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Kale ba komokwa ku nzigo jakwe, kakuli a majwi gakwe ka ga kwesi inguzu.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Momo mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, mo ka li unkosi ka munitwe kwiyauma, u moya ta gu cenete. Kale ga kugiliza keejwi ku gongoza nage, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ka je koko! Ncinzi u shaka kwetu, Jesu gwa kwa Nanzaleta? Kame u la kezi ku tu jona? Ndi li kwizi buti ndigweni, ndigwe u Cenete gwa Nyambe!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Jesu kale ga gu jukukila nage, “Ombelela! U zwe mwakwe!” U moya u mubi kale gwa mu gwisikiza ansi akati ko bantu no ku zwa mwakwe, uku ta gu la mu kubazi.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />A bantu bonse kale ba komokwa mi kale ba li gambaguza nabo, “Majwi ga buti gaga! Buti ko nguzu no bumfumu ga sa jukukila i myoya iji ta ji cenete mi se ji la zwamo!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Mi i ñambagulo ja Jesu kale ja jandulukila momo mwilonga lyonse.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza mukwe gwa Simoni go mwanakazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Male 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Jesu aa zwa mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, kale ga ja ku njugo ja Simoni. Mukwe gwa Simoni go mwanakazi, ka li mulwele gwe elenge imbi, kale ba kumbila Jesu buti a mu tuse. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Jesu kale ga mu sungamina no ku jukukila ielenge, mi ielenge kale lya mu leka. Kale ga zimana wangu no ku tatika uku ba sebeleza.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza a bantu a bangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ijuba aa se li ka gwa, a bantu bonse aba ka ba lwala malwele ga andene-andene kale ba ba leta kwa Jesu, mi kale ga tula a maganja gakwe a muntu no muntu no ku ba oza. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Kame, a mayauma a mangi ka ga zwa ku bantu a bangi, na ga kumbagana nago, “Ndigwe Mwana Nyambe!” Kono Jesu kale ga ga jukukila mi ta ka ga zuminina uku mu zibaaza buti nde Mushaligwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ijuba aa se li ñatula, Jesu kale ga ja mu lugole. A bantu kale ba ja bu mu shaka, mi aa ba ka sika uku ka li, kale ba jeleka uku mu binda uku ba lekanga. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kono kale ga ta nage, “Ndi li botele uku gamba a majwi a malotu go mubuso gwa Nyambe mu minzi jimwinya kame, kakuli mbebyo na nda tuminwa.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Mi ka zundamine uku tandaza mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda ga mwilonga lya Judeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesu no Pitolosi ekamba lyeziba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Male 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ijuba limwinya Jesu aa ka zimene ekamba lyeziba inene lya Genenzaleta, a bantu a bangi kale ba mu bunganina no ku tegeleza kwijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Jesu kale ga bona a mato go bile ekamba, aga na ba lekao a mandui, aba ka ba sanza u tunyandi twabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ngina mwa bumwinya, ubu ka bu li bwa Simoni, no ku mu kumbila buti a bu fugule kace ku bu zwisa kwikamba. Mi kale ga kala ansi no ku ziga a bantu na kele mu bwato.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku gambagula, kale ga ta Simoni nage, “Twala u bwato ku bunokele bo menzi, mi u bombeke u tunyandi u ka kwate inswi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni kale ga taba nage, “Mfumwangu, mpo tu la shandi a masiku gonse kono takuli ibi tu la kwati. Kono kebaka lyo ku ta buti u la gambi bulyao, kuti ndi bombeke u tunyandi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Aa se ba la tendi bulyao, kale ba kwata inswi iningi buti mane u tunyandi twabo se ka tu tatika uku ñatuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Cwale kale ba labiza bagenzabo aba ka ba li mu bwato bumwinya buti ba keze ba ba tuse, mi kale ba keza no ku vumba a mato go bile buti mane se ka ga tatika uku lobela.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Pitolosi aa bona bulyao, kale ga gwila afuwi no mazwi ga Jesu no ku ta nage, “Mfumwangu, u zwe kwangu, ndi li muntu go bitendantu i bimangoju.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Kakuli Pitolosi no bagenze se ka ba komoketwe kebaka lyo bungi boonswi na ba kwata, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />mane no ba Jakobo no Joani bana ba Zebedeya bagenze ba Simoni kale ba komokwa nabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Cwale Jesu kale ga ta Simoni nage, “U leke ku joga, ku zwa aano, kuti no yambe a bantu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Kale ba kokela a mato gabo ekamba, mi kale ba leka i bintu byonse no ku mu umpilila.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu no nkosi ka lwala i cisenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Male 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Jesu aa ka li mu munzi gumwinya, kale kwa keza kame unkosi ka lwala i cisenda. Aa bona Jesu, kale ga gwila ansi no ka sikisa inkumo jakwe ansi no ku mu kumbila nage, “Mfumwangu, ati u la shaka u ndi oze.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Jesu kale ga golola iganja lyakwe no ku kwata jojo unkosi. Mi kale ga ta nage, “Ndi la shaka,” “U lwaluke!” Aobulyo i cisenda kale ca mu leka.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Cwale Jesu kale ga mu ta buti, “U leke uku lugwila u muntu gense, kono u jende u ka li bonise gwemwini ku mupulisiti mi u ka we i bitagilo byo ku cenesegwa kwako ko bu na ga lagila Mushe, ko ku ba u bupaki kwabo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kono i ñambagulo ja Jesu kale ja janduluka no ku ita, buti u bungi bo bantu se ka ba keza ku mu tegeleza no ku ozwa ku malwele gabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Kono Jesu ka janga ku bibaka bi ombelele mu bungi bo nako no ka lapela.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi go ku golomena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Male 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ijuba limwinya Jesu aa ka kwesi uku ziga, a Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao mpo ka ba li. Ka ba zwa mu minzi jonse ja mwilonga lya Galileya, no ja mwilonga lya Judeya no mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. Mi inguzu jo Mfumu Nyambe jo ku oza a balwele ka ji li kwa Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kale kwa keza a bankosi bamwinya aba ka ba indile unkosi e shasha uju ka golomene mi ka ba jeleka uku mu nginika mu njugo buti ba ka mu lalike afuwi no Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Aa se ba la kangwi uku gwana inzila jo ku tenda bulyao kebaka lyo bungi bo bantu, kale ba lija a cituwa no ku jajula iompo mi kale ba mu sezumwinamo ne shasha lyakwe mukati ko bantu a bangi afuwi no Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Jesu aa bona inzumino jabo kale ga ta nage, “Musele, i bitendantu i bimangoju byako bi la kwatilwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />A Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao kale ba tatika uku gaja mwalyabo nabo, “Ndini joju gweshwau bulyaa? Uju a gola uku kwatila i bitendantu i bimangoju ndini, ta li mbwita Nyambe genke?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Jesu kale ga ziba ibi ka ba gaja, kale ga buza nage, “Ncinzi aa mu gaja byebi i bintu mu myojo jenu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />I cintu i citole ncibo, no ku ta buti, ‘I bitendantu i bimangoju byako bi la kwatilwa,’ kampa uku ta buti, ‘Zimana u jende’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Cwale buti mu zibe buti ime nde Mwana Muntu ndi li kwesi inguzu jo ku kwatila i bitendantu i bimangoju aano ansi.” Cwale kale ga ta unkosi ka golomene nage, “Nda sa ku lugwila, zimana, u inde ishasha lyako u jende kwenu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Aobulyo kale ga zimana mukati kabo, no ku inda aa ka lalanga na ka li jila kwabo bu lumba Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />A bantu bonse kale ba komokwa mi kale ba lumba Nyambe. Kale ba joga lwini mi kale ba ta nabo, “Shunu tu la boni i bintu ibi ta bi golaali uku tansululwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Livi aa kugigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Male 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Bebyo aa se bi la mani, Jesu kale ga zwamo mi kale ga bona u mutentesi gwezina lya Livi na kele a kajugo kakwe ko mutenteko. Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U ndi umpilile!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Mi Livi kale ga zimana, no ku leka i bintu byonse no ku mu umpilila.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Mi Livi kale ga tendela Jesu u mukiti u munene mu njugo jakwe, mi a batentesi a bangi no bantu bamwinya ka ba kwesi uku lya nabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Kono a Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao, aba ka ba li bo kagugi kabo kale ba tongaukila ku bazigigwa bakwe nabo, “Ncinzi aa mu lya no ku nywa no batentesi mane no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “A ba ta ba lwali ta ba zundi u muangi, kono a balwele mbabo ba mu zunda. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ta na nda keza ku kuga aba ba lulikile, kono mbantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju buti ba siguluke.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo ku li nyima i bilyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Male 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Kale ba mu ta nabo, “A bazigigwa ba Joani ba la ku linyimanga i bilyo no ku lapela inako jonse, mane no bazigigwa bo Bafalisi bulyao, kono bako mbulyo ba lilila no ku li nywina.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Izo mu la gola uku tenda a basele bo musesi buti ba linyime i bilyo na si kele nabo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Kono inako ji la keza u musesi aa na indigwe kwabo, mi mwa gago a majuba kuti na ba linyime i bilyo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Kale ga ba lugwila jeji inguli nage, “Takuli u muntu a ñatula a kaempela a cizwato i ciya no ku ka tula a cizwato co kale. Ka li na ba la tendi bulyao na ba la ñatuli i cizwato i ciya, mi i cikamba ci zwa a cizwato i ciya ta ka ci jelekelela no cizwato co kale. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Takuli u muntu uju a sintila waine u muya mu biteko byo kale byo mikumba. Aa ku tendaala bulyao, waine u muya kuti a ñatule i biteko, mi waine kuti a kumpe ku zwamo i biteko ibyo bi joneke. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Inga, waine u muya a li botele uku sintilwa mu biteko byo mikumba i miya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Takuli u muntu uju sa ka shake waine u muya uku na la mani uku nywa waine go kale, kakuli kuti a te buti, ‘Waine go kale mulotu.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jesu sa lugula jeji inguli ku bonisa ibi bi gola uku tendaala ati inzigo jakwe na ji gwanikigwa no nzigo jo kale.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">A bazigigwa ba Jesu ne juba lyo Nsabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Male 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lyo Nsabata limwinya Jesu kame ka jenda mukati ko lugwa lo lukau, mi a bazigigwa bakwe kale ba tatika uku cola i mikunku jimwinya jo bweke, no ku ji bukusha mu maganja gabo no ku lya u bweke. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />A Bafalisi bamwinya kale ba buza nabo, “Ncinzi aa mu tenda i cintu lyo Nsabata ici ta ci jendeleli no mulao?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Ka mu sini uku bala ici sa tenda Deviti ige na ba ka jenda nabo aa ka ba fwite injala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Kale ga ngina mu njugo ja Nyambe, no ku inda i binkwa bi cenete, no ku lya ici ka ci zumininwa bulyo ku mulao uku ligwa ku mapulisiti. Mi kale ga wako na ba ka jenda nabo kame.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Cwale kale ga ba ta nage, “Ime nde Mwana Muntu ndi li Mfumu gwejuba lyo Nsabata.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aa ku ozwa u muntu go ku juminina iganja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Male 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Lyo Nsabata limwinya Jesu kale ga ngina mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda mi ka kwesi uku ziga, mo ka li unkosi momo uju ka juminine iganja lyo mulyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />A Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao ka ba lolelele buti ba gwane ibaka lyo ku shangeza Jesu, kale ba mu lolelela lwini buti ba bone buti kuti a oze lyo Nsabata. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Kono Jesu kale ga ziba ibi ka ba gaja mi kale ga ta jojo unkosi ka juminine iganja nage, “Nanuka mi u zimane afuwi no bantu bonse.” Mi kale ga nanuka no ku zimana.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Nda sa mi buza, ici ci jendelela no mulao lyo Nsabata ncibo, nku tenda u bulotu kampa nku tenda u bubi, nku jojesa u bumi kampa nku bu jona?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Jesu kale ga ba logolosa bonse, mi kale ga ta jojo unkosi nage, “Golola iganja lyako.” Kale ga tenda bulyao, mi iganja lyakwe kale lya lwaluka. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Kono a Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao kale ba lunguka mi kale ba tatika uku li gambaguza mwalyabo ici ba botele uku tenda kwa Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa shala a batumigwa bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Male 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Limwinya lya gago a majuba Jesu kale ga ja kumbali lye lundu ku ka lapela, kale ga ka kalako a masiku gonse na lapela kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Aa se bulaci, Jesu kale ga kuga a bazigigwa bakwe mi kale ga shala kwabo be kumi no bo bile no ku ba kuganga buti mbatumigwa mi mba, <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni (uju sa gulika izina lya Pitolosi) no mwancegwe Andileya. Jakobo no Joani, Filipi no Bbatolome. <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mateu no Tomasi, Jakobo (mwana Alufeyasi) no Simoni (uju ka kugigwa Ziloti), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Judasi mwana Jakobo no Judasi Isikaliota uju na ga ba u mulegezi.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imfwijaguzi no bumpai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Jesu kale ga sezumuka nabo no keza ku zimana a cibaka aa ku patamite. A bazigigwa bakwe a bangi nko ka ba li koko no mpalo inene jo bantu aba ka ba zwa mwilonga lyonse lya Judeya, no Jelusalema, na ba ka ba zwa mwilonga lya afuwi ne kamba lyewate lya Taya no Sidoni, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />aba na ba keza ku mu tegeleza no ku ozwa ku malwele gabo. A ba ka ba tembekigwa ku myoya i mibi ka ba ozwa, <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />mi a bantu bonse ka ba jeleka uku mu kwata, kakuli inguzu ka ji zwa kwakwe no ku ba oza bonse.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imfwijaguzi inene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Jesu kale ga lola a bazigigwa bakwe no ku ta nage,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 6:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Imfwijaguzi njenu mwe bampale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">kakuli u mubuso gwa Nyambe ngwenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Imfwijaguzi njenu inwe mu fwa injala aano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kakuli kuti na mu kute.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Imfwijaguzi njenu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">inwe mu lila aano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">kakuli kuti na mu seke.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Imfwijaguzi njenu a bantu aa ba mi zimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">naa ba mi sengauka no ku mi tukagula no ku kana a mazina genu sinagwe mabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">kebaka lya Mwana Muntu.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />“Na mu jangale mwa lelyo ijuba no ku shotauka mu jangalo, kakuli u mupuzo gwenu munene mwigulu. Kakuli no basukuzabo mbobo ka ba tendelanga ku baboni ba Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />U bumpai mbwenu inwe mu kwesi u lubono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">kakuli na mwa tambula kale u bukalo u bulotu bwenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />U bumpai mbwenu inwe mu leligwa nenja aano, kakuli kuti na mu fwe injala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">U bumpai mbwenu inwe mu seka aano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kakuli kuti na mu tompe no ku lila.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />U bumpai mbwenu a bantu bonse aa ba mi gamba nenja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">kakuli basukuzabo mbobo ka ba tendelanga ku baboni bo manya.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku shaka aba ba mi zimbite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Kono nda sa mi lugwila inwe mu tegeleze buti, mu shake aba ba mi zimbite, mu ba tende nenja, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />mu we mfwijaguzi aba ba mi kuta, mu lapelele aba ba mi talula. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ati u muntu na ku kaba u luaka kwitama limwinya, u mu zolele no limwinya bulyao. Ati u muntu jumwinya na inda u mukanjo gwako, u leke ku mu binda aa inda no cijabalo cako. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Uju a ku kumbila gense, u mu we, mi ati u muntu gense na inda cako, u leke ka ci bogoza. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />U tendele bamwinya ubu ko shakila nabo uku ku tendela.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Ati no shaka aba ba ku shaka, mpa cinzi no lumbilwe? Nanga mbatendi bo bitendantu i bimangoju mba ku shaka aba ba ba shaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Mi ati no tenda nenja kwa ba ba ku tendite nenja, mpa cinzi u lumbilwa? Kakuli nanga mbatendi bo bitendantu i bimangoju mbobo ba tendela. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Mi ati na mu li kalimisa na ba mu zilwize buti ba la gola uku mi bogolekeza, mpa cinzi mu lumbilwa? Kakuli no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju mba ku li kalimisanga mwalyabo na ba zilwize uku bogolekezwa bu vumbite.<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />“Kono mu shake aba ba mi zimbite, mu ba tende nenja, mi mu ba kolotise uku ta mu zilwize uku bogolekezwa cimwinya. Mi u mupuzo gwenu kuti na gu be u munene, mi kuti na mu be bana Nyambe Sakapanga, kakuli ngwa cisemo ku bantu aba ta ba litumeli no babi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mu be nonse sinagwe ndi Senu aa kwesi inse.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gambagula byo ku atula bamwinya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Mu leke uku atula, mi ta na mu atuligwe. Mu leke uku shwaula, mi ta na mu shwaulwe. Mu kwatile, mi kuti na mu kwatilwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mu we, mi kuti na mu wegwe nenwe. U mujelekelezo u mulotu, ugu gu nyetezwe wawa, ugu gu ukuswa antu-onke mane no ku juwaukila a bibelo byenu. Kakuli u mujelekelezo ugu mu litusisa, kuti na gu jelekelezwe kwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Kame kale ga ba lugwila jeji inguli nage, “I ciofu ta ci goli uku jendesa i ciofu mugenzaco kakuli byonse ka bi mana ka gwila mwilambo. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />U muzigigwa ta iti u muzigi gwakwe kono u muntu gense uju na ga zigigwa nenja kuti na be sinagwe muzigi gwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Ncinzi aa u lolelele a kasasa aka ka la ngini mu linsho lya mugenzo no ku zwisa ingana kwiala li li mu linsho lyako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Kakuli mbuti u gola uku ta u mukwako buti, ‘Mukwangu, ngo leke ndi ku inde a kasasa aka ka li mu linsho lyako,’ ati igwe gwemwini no kangwa uku bona iala li li mu linsho lyako? Igwe gwe muntu go mantu, u inde tanzi iala mu linsho lyako, mi cwale kuti u bone nenja buti u zwise a kasasa aka ka li mu linsho lyo mukwako.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cishamu no biyango byaco</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Takuli i cishamu i cilotu ci aka i biyango i bimangoju, kame no cishamu i cimangoju ta ci goli uku aka i biyango i bilotu. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />I cishamu conse mpa biyango byaco ba ci zibilanga. A bantu ta ba goli uku yanga u mulya-nshwi ku lwege kampa ku yanga incinga ku makona. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />U muntu u mulotu, mbintu i bilotu a zwisa ku zwa ku bulotu ubu bu li mu mojo gwakwe, mi u muntu u mubi mbintu i bibi a zwisa ku zwa ku bubi ubu bu li mu mojo gwakwe. Kakuli a kanwa ka sa gambagulanga i bintu bi vumbite mu mojo.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo ku shugwa no ku tenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Ncinzi aa mu ndi kuga buti, ‘Mfumu, Mfumu,’ mi ta mu tendi ibi ndi gamba? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />U muntu gense uju a keza kwangu no ku shugwa a majwi gangu no ku tenda ubu ga co, kuti ndi mi sunde uju a kozete. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ngwa ku koza u muntu a jaka injugo, uju a sa ku nokesa no ku sumpa insumpo evu li gongwele. Mi u bulobe aa na bwa keza, i mikukile kale ja kaba jejo injugo kono kale ja kangwa uku ji ukusa kakuli ka ji jakitwe nenja. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Kono uju a shugwa a majwi gangu no ku sa tenda ubu ga co, ngwa ku koza u muntu uju a jaka injugo uku ta nokesi a malambo, a menzi aa ga keza ku kaba jejo injugo, ja sa zeguka mi injoneko jajo kale ja ba inene.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Inzumino jo mubusisi gwa mwa Kapenauma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku gambagula byebyo i bintu ku bantu kale ga ngina mu munzi gwa Kapenauma. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mi u muika go mujendesi go masole gwa mu munzi gwa Kapenauma ka li mulwele mane se ka tandila. Mi mfumwe ka mu shaka lwini. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Jojo u mujendesi kale ga shugwa bya Jesu mi kale ga tuma a bakulu bo Majuda ka mu kumbila buti a keze a oze u muika gwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Babo aa se ba la kezi kwa Jesu, kale ba mu kumbila lwini nabo, “Joju unkosi a li botelelwe buti u tende bulyao, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kakuli a la shaka ilonga lyetu mi na ga tu jakila injugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Mi Jesu kale ga ka ja nabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Aa se ka li afuwi ne njugo, u mujendesi go masole kale ga mu tumina a basele ka mu ta buti, “Mfumwangu, u leke ku li yaza gwemuni kakuli ta ndi botele buti no la kezi mu njugo jangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Mpaa ta ndi la li gaji buti ndi li botelele nanga nkeza kwako ime wawa. Kono u gambe ijwi, mi u muika gwangu kuti a lwaluke. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kakuli ime wawa ndi li nkosi uju a li mwinsi lyo nguzu jo bujendesi, no masole mwinsi lyo bujendesi bwangu ba li. Aa ndi ta jumwinya buti, ‘Jenda,’ mi sa la kaja, no kwa jumwinya aa ndi ta buti, ‘Keza,’ mi sa la keza. Aa ndi ta u muika gwangu buti, ‘Ngo tende ici,’ mi sa la ci tenda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Jesu aa sa la shugwi byebyo, kale ga mu komokwa mi kale ga sigulukila ku bungi bo bantu aba ka ba mu umpilile no ku ta nage, “Nda sa mi lugwila buti, ka ndi sini uku gwana inzumino inene ja bulyao nanga mwilonga lya Isilaele.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Cwale a bankosi aba na ba tumigwa kale ba bogola ku njugo mi kale ba ka gwana u muika a lwalukite.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa jojesa mwana mfwilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Bebyo aa se bi la mani, Jesu kale ga ja mu munzi gu kugigwa Naine, mi a bazigigwa bakwe no bantu a bangi kale ba ka ja nage. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Aa se ka kokelele a manginino go munzi, kale ga shangana a bantu ka ba indite u muntu a fwite, mi mbobo ka mu kwatile nyina genke jojo u muninzana. Mi jojo u mwanakazi ka li mfwilwa. A bantu a bangi aba ka ba zwa mu munzi ka ba kele nage. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />U Mfumu Jesu aa bona jojo u mwanakazi, kale ga mu fwila inse, mi kale ga mu ta nage, “U leke uku lila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Kale ga senena no ka kwata ku musimba-sala aa ka ba mu indile, mi a baindi kale ba zimana. Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Nkosana, nda sa ku lugwila, buka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />U mufu kale ga buka no ku tatika uku gamba, Jesu kale ga mu bogoza kwa nyina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />A bantu bonse kale ba joga lwini, kale ba lumba Nyambe nabo, “U muboni gwa Nyambe u munene a la li bonaazi mukati ketu, Nyambe a la kezi ku tusa a bantu bakwe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Jeji i ñambagulo ja Jesu kale ja jandulukila mwilonga lyonse lya Judeya no bibaka byonse byelonga.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani aa tuma a bantu kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />A bazigigwa ba Joani kale ba mu gambaguza byonse byebi i bintu. Joani kale ga kuga bo bile ku bazigigwa bakwe, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />kale ga ba tuma ku Mfumu Jesu buti ba ka mu buze buti, “Ndigwe ko tegwa buti kuti no keze, kampa tu lindila jumwinya kame?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Babo a bankosi aa se ba la kezi kwa Jesu, kale ba ta nabo, “Joani u mukolobezi a la ka tu tumi kwako buti tu keze tu buze buti, ‘Ndigwe ko tegwa buti kuti no keze, kampa tu li botele uku lindila jumwinya?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mwa jejo inako, Jesu kale ga oza a bantu a bangi aba ka ba kwesi a malwele ga andene-andene no myoya i mibi no ku wa inguzu jo ku bona ku bantu a bangi aba ka ba li baofu. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Mi kale ga taba aba na ba tumigwa nage, “Mu bogole muka lugule kwa Joani ibi mu la boni no ku shugwa buti, aba ka ba li baofu na ba tambula inguzu jo ku bona, aba ta ka ba gola uku jenda se ba la jenda, bo cisenda se ba li lwalukite, a baulu se ba la shugwa, aba se ka ba fwite na ba busigwa, mi a majwi a malotu se ga la gambigwa ku bampale. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ngwa mfwijaguzi u muntu uju ta sitagali kebaka lyangu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />A bantu aba na ga tuma Joani aa se ba la bogoli, Jesu kale ga tatika uku gambagula bya Joani ku bantu a bangi nage, “Ncinzi na mwa ka bona aa na mwa ja mu mangusu? Ndutaka ka lu ungisigwa ku nkuli? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ati ta li mbobo, ncinzi elu na mwa jila ka bona? Muntu ka zwesi i bizwato i bilotu wawa? Inga, a bantu ba zwata i bizwato bi tula no ku ba mu minyakulo mu majugo go bamfumu ba kala. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Kono ncinzi na mwa jila ka bona? Muboni gwa Nyambe? Ee, Nda sa mi lugwila, a la ita u muboni gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Joju ndege sa ñolegwa byakwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 7:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Kuti na ndi tume u mutumigwa gwangu igwe no sini u keza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">uju na ku shabwile inzila no sini u keza.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaki 3:1</ref>.</char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Nda sa mi lugwila buti ku bantu aba na ba bonigwa ku banakazi takuli u munene ku ita Joani, kono u mushwauki mu mubuso gwa Nyambe munene ku mu ita.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />A bantu bonse, mane no batentesi, aa se ba la shugwi a majwi ga Jesu, kale ba ziba buti inzila ja Nyambe ji li lulikile, kakuli se ba kolobezigwa kwa Joani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Kono a bafalisi na ba ka ba zekelele u mulao kale ba li kanina u mugajalo gwa Nyambe abo a beni, kakuli ta na ba kolobezigwa kwa Joani.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Jesu kale ga ba ta kame nage, “A bantu ba lo luno u luasi ncinzi sa ka ndi ba kozanise kwaco? Ncinzi ba kozete? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Mba ku koza a banuke ba kele a nkanza na ba li kuga-kuga mwalyabo nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 7:32" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Tu la mi sibili insengo kono ta mu la nengi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">tu la mi zimbili inimbo jo mafu kono ta mu la lili.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kakuli Joani u mukolobezi sa keza uku ta li u buobe no ku nywa waine, mi mwa sa ta buti, ‘A li kwesi iyauma.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Ime nde Mwana Muntu na nda keza mi ndi la lilila no ku li nywina, mi mwa sa ta buti, ‘Uju ndo muntu go malyabi no cidakwa, u musele go batentesi no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />A magano ga Nyambe ga sa bonaazwa uku lulikila ka bane bonse.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu mu njugo jo Mufalisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Cwale jumwinya go Bafalisi kale ga kuga Jesu buti aka lye nage i bilyo, Jesu kale ga ka ja ku njugo jo Mufalisi mi kale ga kala ku ntafule. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />U mwanakazi gwa momo mu munzi uju ka joja mu bitendantu i bimangoju kale ga ziba buti Jesu mu njugo jo Mufalisi a li. Kale ga keza ne botela lya alabbasitela lyo mafuta ga nunka nenja, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />kale ga zimana ku mashule afuwi no matende ga Jesu na lila, mi kale ga tatika uku bombisa a matende ga Jesu ko minsozi jakwe. Kale ga ga singula no nshuki jakwe mi kale ga sonsona a matende ga Jesu no ku sintila a mafuta ga nunka nenja a matende ga Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />U Mufalisi uju na ga kuga Jesu aa bona bulyao, kale ga li ta gemwini nage, “Joju unkosi ka li na muboni gwa Nyambe, na la zibi buti ndini a mu kwata-kwata mi mwanakazi gwa buti kakuli ngwa bitendantu i bimangoju.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Simoni, nko bi li ibi ndi shaka uku ku lugwila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni nage, “Ndi lugwile muzigi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “A bantu bo bile se ba kolota a masheleñi ku mukolotisi go masheleñi jumwinya. Gwe tanzi kale ga kolota a masheleñi ga 500 mi gwa bili kale ga kolota go makumi ga 5. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Bonse bo bile bulyao ta ka ba kwesi a masheleñi go ku lifa, mi kale ga kwatila i bikoloti byabo bo bile bulyao. Kwa babo bantu, ndini ka mu shaka lwini?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni kale ga taba nage, “Kame ndi gaja buti jojo go cikoloti i cinene ici na ca kwatilwa.” Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U la atuli nenja.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Cwale Jesu kale ga sigulukila kwa jojo mwanakazi no ku ta Simoni nage, “U li mu wene joju u mwanakazi, ndi la kezi mu njugo jako kono igwe to la ndi wi a menzi go ku shamba ku matende gangu, kono ige a la bombisi a matende gangu ko minsozi jakwe no ku ga singula ko nshuki jakwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Igwe to la ndi zuminizi ko ku ndi sonsona, kono joju u mwanakazi, nda li ku ngininamo muno mu njugo, ta la leki uku sonsona-sonsona a matende gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />To la sintili oili a mutwi gwangu, kono ige a la sintili a mafuta ga nunka nenja a matende gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Cwale, nda sa ku lugwila buti ko lushako lwakwe u lunene a la bonisi, i bitendantu i bimangoju byakwe i bingi bi la kwatilwa. Kono u muntu gense uju sa kwatilwa i bice ga sa shaka ko buce.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ta jojo u mwanakazi nage, “I bitendantu i bimangoju byako bi la kwatilwa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />A ba ka ba kele nage kale ba tatika uku li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Ndini joju uju a kwatila i bitendantu i bimangoju?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Jesu kale ga ta ku mwanakazi nage, “Inzumino jako ji la ku jojesi, u jende nenja.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">A banakazi aba ka ba tusa Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Aa na kwa mana byebyo, Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe be kumi no bo bile, kale ba ja bu zimbuluka mu minzi no mu twinzi-gana, na ba ja bu lugwila a bantu a majwi a malotu go mubuso gwa Nyambe, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />no banakazi bamwinya aba se ba ozwa ku myoya i mibi no malwele. A mazina gabo mba Maliya Magadalena uju na ga lukululwa ku myoya i mibi ja 7. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />No Joana mukazi gwa Kuza, uju ka li mubabaleli go luasi lo mfumu Eloda no Suzana no bamwinya a bangi. Baba a banakazi ka ba ba tusa ko bintu ka ba kwesi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo mubyali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Male 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />A bantu a bangi aa ka ba kwesi uku gwanana no keza kwa Jesu na ba zwa mu minzi i mingi, Jesu kale ga ba lugwila jeji inguli nage, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“U mubyali sa ja ku ka byala i mbuto jakwe. Aa ka kwesi uku mwaga i mbuto bulyao, jimwinya kale ja gwila mu nzila, mi kale ja lyatagulwa, mi i bijuni kale bya ji lya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Jimwinya kale ja gwila evu lyo mabwe, mi aa se ji la meni, u bunshansha kale bwa boba kebaka lyo ku bula u mutamfu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Jimwinya kale ja gwila mukati ko miga, iji na ja kulilila antu-onke najo no ku funkuntisa u bunshansha. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Kame jimwinya i mbuto kale ja gwila evu ilotu. Kale ja mena no ku aka u lukau, makumi ge kumi ku ita ubu na ja byalilwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Aa sa la ti bulyao, kale ga kugiliza nage, “Uju a kwesi a matwi go ku shugwisa, a shugwe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mugajalo go nguli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Male 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu buza ici ka ji toloka jeji inguli. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Inzibo jo buzinda bo mubuso gwa Nyambe na mwa ji wegwa, kono ku bantu bamwinya nda sa gamba mu manguli, buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 8:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">‘nanga na ba bona, ba leke ku bonisisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">nanga na ba shugwa, ba leke ku shugwilisa.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isaya 6:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Intoloko jo nguli jo mubyali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Male 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Intoloko jo nguli nji jeji, imbuto ndijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ja mu nzila mbantu ba shugwa, mi Satani sa la keza ku zwisa mu myojo jabo ijwi, buti ba leke uku zumina no ku jojeswa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Jejo ja evu lyo mabwe mbantu ba tambula ijwi bu jangele aa ba li shugwa, kono ta ba kwesi u muisi. Mba ku zumina mu nako imfuwi, kono mu nako jo mijeleko se ba la gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Imbuto na ja gwila mukati ko miga ja sa zimanina a bantu ba shugwa, kono aa ba ja bu joja bulyaa mu bumi se ba la funkutiswa ku nkengejezi jo bumi, u lubono no minyakulo, mi ta ba aki i biyango. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Kono i mbuto ja evu ilotu ja sa zimanina a bantu-awa no bo myojo i milotu, aba ba shugwa ijwi, no ku li gunzilila, ko ku zundamina ba sa leta i biyango.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">A majwi ga Jesu nga ku koza lambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Male 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Takuli u muntu a jakiza lambi no ku mu bika mu kazunga kampa ku mu bika mwinsi lyo bulo. Kono lambi mpa ntafule ba mu tulanga, buti a bantu ba ngina ba bone ituba. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kakuli takuli ici ci bikamite ici ta na ci bikululwe, mi takuli ici ci zinditwe ici ta na ci zibigwe kampa uku letigwa aa ku bonaala. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Cwale mu gajisise nenja ubu mu tegeleleza. U muntu gense uju a kwesi kuti na wegwe i bingi, mi uju ta kwesi, kuti na tapigwe nanga ibi a gaja buti a li bi kwesi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina ba Jesu no bancegwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Male 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Cwale nyina no bancegwe ba Jesu kale ba keza ku mu bona, kono ta ka ba gola uku keza afuwi nage kebaka lyo bantu a bangi. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />U muntu jumwinya kale ga mu lugwila buti, “Nyoko no bancego mpanze ba zimene, na ba shakite uku ku bona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Maa no bancegwangu mba babo ba shugwa ijwi lya Nyambe no ku tenda ubu li co.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ombeleza ikuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Male 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ijuba limwinya Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Ndokweni tu shatukile mwisilya limwinya lyeziba.” Cwale kale ba ngina mu bwato no ku fugula. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Aa ka ba kwesi uku zuga, Jesu kale ga lala. Mi kale kwa fukuka ikuli inene ku ukusa iziba, buti u bwato se ka bu shaka uku lobela, mi se ka ba li mu bujoge u bunene.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />A bazigigwa kale ba ja kwa Jesu no ka mu busa nabo, “Mfumwetu, Mfumwetu, se tu la lobela!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Kale ga zimana no ku jukukila ikuli no makupezi, mi ikuli kale lya tulangiza, mi byonse kale bya ombelela. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Jesu kale ga buza a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Inzumino jenu kwibo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">A bazigigwa kale ba li buzagula mwalyabo bu jogete no ku komokwa nabo, “Ndini joju? Ga sa gambila nanga ndikuli no menzi, mi se bi la mu kutika.”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi ka munitwe ku mayauma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Male 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Kale ba ka fugikila mwilonga lyo Magelaseni, esilya lyeziba lya Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Jesu aa sa la kantukili ekamba, kale ga li gwana no nkosi uju ka munitwe ku mayauma uju ka zwa mu munzi. A nako inde joju unkosi ta ka zwatanga i bizwato kampa uku joja mu njugo, kono mpa mabita ka kalanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Aa sa la boni Jesu, kale ga lila no ku gwila ku matende ga Jesu, no ku kumba keejwi inene nage, “Ncinzi u shaka kwangu, Jesu, Mwana Nyambe Sakapanga? Nda sa ku kumbila, u leke uku ndi bangisa!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kakuli Jesu na ga jukukila gogo u moya ugu ta gu cenete buti gu zwe kwa jojo unkosi. Mu bungi bo nako aa ka gu mu asukilanga, no ku ka shuminigwanga ko mawenge ku maganja no ku matende no ku mameligwa, ka colanga a mawenge gakwe mi iyauma ka li mu twalanga mu cibaka ci ombelele.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Izina lyako ndigweni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Ige kale ga mu taba nage, “Ndime Bangi.” Kakuli mayauma a mangi na ga ngina mwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />A mayauma kale ga kumbila Jesu ko ku bogwela-bogwela buti a leke uku ga zuminina uku ngina mwilambo lyo kasula-muzumbi.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />U mugona u munene go banjili ka gu yangila koko kumbali jelundu. A mayauma kale ga kumbila Jesu buti aga zuminine uku ngina momo mu banjili, mi kale ga ga zuminina. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />A mayauma aa se ga la zwi kwa jojo unkosi, kale ga ka ngina mu banjili, mi u mugona kale gwa tiga ku zwa a nsezumusi no ka ngina mwiziba no ka fwa ku menzi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />A ba ka ba lisa a banjili aa ba bona ibi bi la tendaali, kale ba tiga no ka bi lugula mu munzi no mwilonga, <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />mi a bantu kale ba ka ja buti ba ka bone ibi bi la tendaali. Aa se ba la kezi kwa Jesu, kale ba gwana unkosi uju na kwa zwa a mayauma kwakwe, na kele ku matende ga Jesu, bu zwesi no ku kala nenja mu ngana jakwe, mi kale ba joga. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Babo na ba bona byebyo kale ba gambaguza a bantu ubu na ga ozekezwa unkosi uju ka munitwe ku mayauma. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Cwale a bantu bonse belonga lyo Magelaseni kale ba kumbila Jesu buti aba leke, kakuli se ka ba jogete lwini. Mi kale ga ngina mu bwato no ku funduka.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Unkosi uju na kwa zwa a mayauma kwakwe kale ga kumbila buti a ka je nage, kono Jesu kale ga mu ta buti a ka li jile, no ku mu ta buti, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“U bogole ku munzi u ka gambagule u bunene bwe bi a la ku tendeli Nyambe.” Cwale unkosi kale ga ka li jila no ka gambaguza a bantu bonse ba mu munzi u bunene bwe bi na ga mu tendela Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa jojesa u mukazana no ku oza u mwanakazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Male 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Cwale Jesu aa sa la ka bogoli a bantu a bangi kale ba ka mu tambula, kakuli bonse ka ba mu shiamine. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Cwale unkosi gwezina lya Jailusi, uju ka li mujendesi go njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, kale ga keza ku gwila ku matende ga Jesu, no ku mu kumbila buti a ka je ku njugo jakwe <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kakuli mwane genke go mukazana, uju se ka shaka uku ba go myaka je kumi no jo bile, se ka li afuwi no ku fwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Jesu aa ka li mu nzila bulyao, a bantu a bangi ka ba ja bu mu sundanisa. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mi u mwanakazi mo ka li momo uju ka lwala u bulwele bwelowa a myaka je kumi no jo bile, kono takuli uju ka gola uku mu oza. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Kale ga kezela Jesu ku mushana no ku kwata ku mungundo go mukanjo gwakwe, mi aobulyo ilowa kale lya zimana.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Jesu kale ga buza nage, “Ndini a la ndi kwati?” Bonse aa se ba la shampuli, Pitolosi kale ga ta nage, “Mfumwangu, a bantu a bangi ba li ku sundanise no ku ku kumagula.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Kono Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Nkwali uju a la ndi kwati. Ndi li zi buti inguzu ji la zwi kwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Cwale u mwanakazi aa sa la boni buti ta goli uku bikama, kale ga keza bu tutuma no keza ku gwila ku matende ga Jesu. A bantu bonse na ba lolelele, kale ga lugula ici na ca leta buti a mu kwate no bu na ga lwalukila wangu-wangu. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Mi Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Mwanangu, inzumino jako ji la ku ozi. U jende nenja.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Aa ka si kwesi uku gambagula, u muntu kale ga zwa ku njugo ja Jailusi, u mujendesi go njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda no keza ku ta nage, “Mwano a la fwi, u leke ku tembeka u muzigi kame.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Jesu aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga ta Jailusi nage, “U leke ku joga, u zumine bulyo, mi kuti a ozwe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Aa ka sika ku njugo ja Jailusi, Jesu kale ga binda a bantu uku nginamo mbwita Pitolosi, Joani no Jakobo, nesi no nyina bo mwanuke. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Momo mu nako a bantu bonse se ka ba shambalagana no ku mu lila. Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mu leke uku shambalagana ta fwite kono mbulyo a lele.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Kale ba mu sekelela, na be zi buti jojo u mukazana se ka fwite. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Kono Jesu kale ga mu kwata kwiganja no ku ta nage, “Mwanangu, zimana!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />U moya gwakwe kale gwa ka bogola, mi aobulyo kale ga zimana. Cwale Jesu kale ga ba lugwila buti ba mu we i cintu cimwinya co ku lya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />A bazazi bakwe kale ba komokwa, kono Jesu kale ga ba kanisa uku gambaguza u muntu gense ibi na bya tendaala.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa tuma a batumigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Male 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Jesu aa sa la kugili a bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile antu-onke, kale ga ba wa inguzu no nzuminino jo ku tanda a mayauma gonse no ku oza a malwele, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />mi kale ga ba tuma buti ba je bu tandaza u mubuso gwa Nyambe no ku oza a balwele. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Kale ga ba ta buti, “Mu leke ku inda cimwinya mu lujendo, u lutaga, u mukotana, i bilyo, a masheleñi, no cijabalo cimwinya. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Mu njugo jonse iji na mu ngine, na mu kalemo ku twala aa na mu zwe momo mu munzi. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ati a bantu ta ba mi tambuli, mu zwe mu munzi gwabo mi mu kunkumune isukwe ku matende genu ko ku ba u bupaki ku ba inanguzo kwabo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Cwale kale ba funduka no ku ja mu minzi jonse, na ba ja bu tandaza a majwi a malotu no ku oza a bantu mu bibaka byonse.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eloda aa shugwa bya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Male 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Cwale Eloda u mubusisi gwelonga lya Galileya kale ga shugwa byonse ibi ka bi tendaala. Mi kale ga komokwa kakuli bamwinya mbuti ka ba co buti Joani na ga busigwa ku zwa ku bafu, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />bamwinya nabo ndi Eliya na ga bonaala, mi bamwinya nabo njumwinya go baboni ba Nyambe ba ku kale na ga ka bogola ku bumi. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Kono Eloda kale ga ta nage, “Joani na nda mu koshola u mutwi. Cwale, ndini joju ndi shugwile byakwe?” Mi kale ga jeleka buti a mu bone.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa wa i bilyo ku bantu ba 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Male 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joa 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />A batumigwa aa se ba la ka bogoli, kale ba keza ku lugula kwa Jesu ibi na ba ka tenda. Cwale kale ga ba li kugila mi kale ba li inda no ku ja ku munzi gu kugigwa Bbesaida, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />kono a bantu a bangi kale ba ziba bulyao mi kale ba mu umpilila. Kale ga ba tambula no ku gamba nabo byo mubuso gwa Nyambe, mi kale ga oza aba ka ba zunda uku ozwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ijuba aa se ka li ja bu tenguwa, a bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile kale ba keza kwakwe no ku ta nabo, “U lugwile a bantu a bangi ba ka li jile ku minzi ja afuwi no minzi jimwinya buti ba ka gwane i bilyo no malalo, kakuli mo muno tu li mu lugole.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mu ba we i bilyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Abo kale ba taba nabo, “Makoto ga 5 go buobe bulyo tu kwesi nonswi jo bile, mbwita sa ka tu ka je ka ba gulila bonse baba a bantu a bangi i bilyo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Kakuli a bankosi ka ba shaka uku sika a 5,000 aba ka ba lio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Kono Jesu kale ga lugwila a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu ba kalike ansi mu tugugi utu tu shaka uku sika a makumi ga 5 a kagugi no kagugi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />A bazigigwa kale ba tenda bulyao mi a bantu bonse kale ba kala ansi.<verse eid="LUK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Jesu kale ga inda a makoto ga 5 nenswi jo bile, mi kale ga lolelela kwigulu, no ku litumela no ku bi komagula. Mi kale ga bi wa ku bazigigwa buti ba taile a bantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />A bantu bonse kale ba lya no ku kuta, mi a bazigigwa kale ba inda i bitundu bye kumi no byo bile byo bukomaukile ubu na bwa sigala.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa gamba buti Jesu nde Mushaligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Male 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ijuba limwinya, Jesu aa ka lapela mu buzinda mi a bazigigwa bakwe na ba kele nage, kale ga ba buza nage, “A bantu a bangi mbuti ba ndi tela izo ndimeni?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Kale ba taba nabo, “Bamwinya mbuti ba tela buti ndi Joani u mukolobezi, bamwinya nabo ndi Eliya, mi bamwinya kame nabo njumwinya go baboni ba Nyambe ba ku kale sa ka bogola ku bumi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Jesu kale ga buza nage, “Ingenwe, mbuti mu ndi tela buti ndimeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Ndigwe Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gamba byo lufu lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Male 8:30–9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Kono Jesu kale ga ba nanguza wawa uku sa gambaguza u muntu gense bulyao. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Mi kale ga ta nage, “Kakuli ime nde Mwana Muntu ndi li botele uku penga i bintu i bingi no ku kanigwa ku manduna, no mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao, kuti na ndi yagigwe mi mwijuba lya tatu kuti na ndi busizwe ku bumi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ba ta bonse nage, “U muntu gense uju a shaka uku ba u muzigigwa gwangu, a li botele uku li shampula gemwini, a inde i cifapaano cakwe mwijuba-mwijuba no ku ndi umpilila. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kakuli u muntu gense uju a shaka uku jojesa u bumi bwakwe kuti na bu jonekelwe, kono u muntu gense uju a jonekelwa u bumi bwakwe kebaka lyangu kuti na bu jojese. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Kakuli mbulotunzi ku muntu uku muna ilonga lyonse, no ku jonekelwa kampa uku li jagwisa gemwini? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />U muntu gense uju a ndi fwila inshoni no majwi gangu, neme nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi mu fwile inshoni aa na ndi keze mu mpazimo jangu no mu mpazimo ja Tata no jo mañiloi ga cenete. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, bamwinya kwa ba ba zimene aano ta na ba lase u lufu na ba sini uku bona u mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa zoka ko mpazimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Male 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba ga 8 ku zwa Jesu aa sa gambila bulyao, kale ga inda Pitolosi, no Joani no Jakobo no ka ja nabo elundu ka lapela. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Aa ka kwesi uku lapela, u mubonaalilo go nkumo jakwe kale gwa zoka, no bizwato byakwe kale bya tuba sinagwe mutubilo go lumuni lo mvula. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />A bankosi bo bile, ba Mushe no Eliya kale ba bonaala na ba gambagula no Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Kale ba bonaala mu bulotu bu pazima na ba gambagula byo mfunduko jakwe jo ku zwa mwilonga, iji se ka ji li afuwi no ka vumbilizwa mwa Jelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Pitolosi no bagenze se ka ba sukula lwini, kono aa se ba la buki, kale ba bona impazimo jakwe no bankosi bo bile ba zimene nage. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Babo a bankosi aa se ka ba leka Jesu, Pitolosi kale ga mu ta nage, “Mfumwangu, mbulotu kwetu uku kala aano. U tu zuminine uku jaka i bikutu byo tatwe, conke cako, cimwinya ca Mushe no cimwinya ca Eliya.” Ta kezi ibi ka gamba.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Aa ka si gamba byebyo, kale kwa bonaala ijoba no ku ba vwika, mi kale ba joga aa ka ba vwikigwa kwijoba.<verse eid="LUK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Kale kwa zwa ijwi mwijoba li ta buti, “Joju ndi Mwanangu, uju na nda shala, mu mu shugwe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ijwi aa se li la ti bulyao, kale ba gwana buti Jesu sa li sigele genke. A bazigigwa kale ba bi li bikila mi ta na ba gambaguza u muntu gense momo mu nako ibi na ba bona.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza u muninzana uju ka munitwe kwiyauma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Male 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ijuba na lya nungako, aa se ba la sezumuki ku zwa elundu, a bantu a bangi kale ba gwanana no Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Unkosi mukati ko bantu a bangi kale ga kugiliza nage, “Muzigi, nda sa ku kumbila uku lola kwa mwanangu, nde mwanangu genke bulyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Moya u mubi gu mu kwatanga mi sa la takuma wangu-wangu. Gwa sa mu gwisikizanga ansi na nyakagula buti mane sa la tufula ifulo ku kanwa. Ta gu mu lekangi wangu mi nku jona gu mu jona. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Na nda kumbila a bazigigwa bako uku gu tanda kwakwe, kono na ba kangwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mwe luasi ta lu zumine no lunyono! Ni nako ji sika kwibo na ndi kale nenwe mi ndusiku nzi na mu ndi zumine? Leta kuno mwano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Nanga aa ka si keza jojo muninzana, iyauma kale lya mu gwisikiza ansi mi kale lya mu nyakagulisa lwini. Kono Jesu kale ga jukukila u moya ta gu cenete, kale ga oza u muninzana no ku mu bogoza kwesi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Mi a bantu bonse kale ba komokwa ku bunene bwa Nyambe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jesu aa ganuna lyabili byo lufu lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Male 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">A bantu bonse aa ka ba si komoketwe ku bintu byonse ka tenda Jesu, kale ga ta ku bazigigwa bakwe nage, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mu tegeleze nenja i bintu ndi shaka ku mi lugwila buti, ime nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi wegwe mu maganja go bantu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Kono ta na ba shugwilisa ibi ka bi tolokigwa. Ka bi bikitwe kwabo, buti ba leke ku bi shugwilisa, mi ka ba jogete uku bi mu buzagula.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">U munene mu mubuso gwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Male 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Inkani kale ja asuka mukati ko bazigigwa jo ku ziba buti ndini gwabo uju ka botele uku ba u munene. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Jesu ko ku ziba i migajalo jabo, kale ga inda u mwanuke-gana no ku mu zimika kumbali nage. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Mi kale ga ba ta nage, “U muntu gense uju a tambula joju u mwanuke-gana mwizina lyangu ndime a tambula, mi u muntu gense uju a ndi tambula ga sa tambula noju na ga ndi tuma. Kakuli uju a li mununu mukati kenu mwense nde munene.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo ku litusisa izina lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Male 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Joani kale ga ta nage, “Mfumwetu, na twa bona u muntu jumwinya na tanda a mayauma mwizina lyako mi kale twa jeleka uku mu binda, kakuli ta li njumwina gwetu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mu leke uku mu binda kakuli u muntu gense uju ta mi lwisi nkwenu a li.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu no Masamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Inako aa se ka ji ja bu senena jakwe jo ku indilwa kwigulu, Jesu kale ga indikila uku ja ku munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Mi kale ga tuma a batwali bo ndagano ku li tangiza, aba na ba ja mu munzi go Masamaliya ka mu lukiseza i bintu, <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />kono a bantu momo ta na ba mu tambula, kakuli nkwa Jelusalema ka tungulwize.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A Majuda no Masamaliya ta ka ba shugwana kebaka lyo tempele na ga jakila Solomoni mwa Jelusalema abo na ba gaja buti ta ka ku botele bulyao kakuli Joshuwa sa ta buti i cibaka co malapelelo ci be Elundu lya Gelizimi ili ka li li mwilonga lyo masamaliya mi momo ka ba lapelelanga mu nako jo bamfumu. Joani 4:21-22.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Cwale a bazigigwa ba Jakobo no Joani aa ba bona bulyao, kale ba buza nabo, “Mfumwetu, u la shaka buti tu kuge u mulilo gu zwe kwigulu gu ba tente<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gamwinya a mabuka ga sa nungako intimana ja 54 ku ta buti, sinagwe ubu na ga tendela Eliya.</char></note>?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Jesu kale ga zoka no ku ba jukukila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go kale ga sa nungako, “kale ga ba ta nage kanti i myojo jenu mbuti ji kalile, ime ta na nda keza ku yaga a bantu kono nku ku jojesa a bantu na nda keza.”</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Cwale Jesu no ba bazigigwa bakwe kale ba ja mu munzi gumwinya.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku umpilila Jesu ku la tula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Aa ka ba kwesi uku jenda mu nzila, u muntu jumwinya kale ga mu ta buti, “Kuti ndi ku umpagizange konse uku so ko jange.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “A basibwe ba li kwesi a malambo no bijuni bi li kwesi i bijakilo, kono ime nde Mwana Muntu, ta ndi kwesi i cibaka o ku lalika u mutwi gwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Jesu kale ga ta u muntu jumwinya nage, “Ndi umpilile.” Kono kale ga taba nage, “Mfumwangu, tanzila u ndi leke ndi jende ndi ka zike tata.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U leke a bafu ba zike a bafu babo, kono igwe u ka je no ka gambagula byo mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Jumwinya kame kale ga ta nage, “Kuti ndi ku umpilile Mfumwangu, kono tanzila u ndi leke ndi bogole ndi ka lagane u luasi lwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Takuli u muntu uju a kwata ku cikekele no ku lola mwishule uju a botelele insebelezo mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa tuma bo makumi ga 7 no bo bile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Mwishule lya byebo, u Mfumu Jesu kale ga shala a bazigigwa bamwinya bo makumi ga 7 no bo bile no ku ba tuma bo bile-bo bile buti ba li tangize ku ja mu minzi jonse no bibaka u mu ka gajite uku ja. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Kale ga ba lugwila nage, “U muzimbu mungi, kono a babeleki mbace. Mu kumbile u mfumu go muzimbu, buti, a tume a babeleki mwigwa lyakwe ili li zimbuligwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Mu jende! Kame ndi mi tuma sinagwe ni ngu-gana mukati ko bambogela. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mu leke uku inda i cikwama kampa u mukotana kampa inshangu, mi mu leke uku zuminiza u muntu gense mu nzila.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />“Aa mu ngina mu njugo, mu te tanzi buti, ‘Uku joja nenja ku be kwa jeji injugo.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ati momo mwa li ujwa a shaka uku joja nenja, imfwijaguzi jenu kuti ji je kwakwe, aa ta mu li uju a shaka uku joja nenja, imfwijaguzi jenu kuti ji bogole kwenu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mu kalemo momo, na mu lya no ku nywa ibi ba mi wa byonse, kakuli u mubeleki a li botelelwe u mupuzo gwakwe. Mu zwe kwi kuntana na mu ngina-ngina mu majugo.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />“Aa mu ngina mu munzi, mi na ba mi tambula, mu lye ibi mu wegwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mu oze a balwele aba ba limo mi mu ba gambaguze buti, ‘U mubuso gwa Nyambe na gwa keza afuwi nenwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Kono aa mu ngina mu munzi mi ta ba mi tambuli, mu je mu mazila go munzi no ku ta buti, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Ne sukwe lyo munzi gwenu twa sa li kunkumuna ku matende getu ko ku ba inanguzo kwenu. Mi mu zibe buti, u mubuso gwa Nyambe na gwa keza afuwi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nda sa mi lugwila buti, kuti na ku be nenja mwa lelyo ijuba ku munzi gwa Sodoma ku ita gogo u munzi.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">I minzi na ja kana uku zumina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“U bumpai mbwenu, mwe bantu mu joja mu munzi gwa Kolazini mane nenwe mu joja mu munzi gwa Bbesaida! Kakuli ka li a mamakazo na ga tendigwa momo mwenu na ga la tendigwa ku bantu ba mu minzi ja Taya no Sidoni, nkale na ba la siguluki, ko ku jabala a masaka no ku kala mwitwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Kono kuti na ku be nenja wawa ku bantu bo minzi ja Taya no Sidoni mwijuba lyo nkatulo ku ita kwenu. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nenwe, mwe bantu ba mu munzi gwa Kapenauma, buti kuti na mu nanwinwe mwigulu? Inga, kuti na mu je kwinsi ku cibaka co bafu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />“U muntu gense uju a mi shugwa ndime a la shugwi, mi uju a mi kana ndime a la kani, kono u muntu gense uju a ndi kana a la kani uju na ga ndi tuma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">U bupaki bo batumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Bo makumi ga 7 no bo bile kale ba ka bogola bu jangele, no ku ta nabo, “Mfumwetu, mane no mayauma ga la li tula kwinsi lyetu mwizina lyako.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Na nda bona Satani a gwa kwigulu sinagwe ndumuni. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Na nda mi wa inguzu jo ku lyata a majoka no mage no jo ku gola inguzu jonse jo muntu go cizimbo, mi takuli ici na ci mi kubaze. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Nanganceciba, mu leke uku jangala buti a mayauma ga la li tula kwinsi lyenu, kono mu jangale kakuli a mazina genu ga li ñoletwe mwigulu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa jangala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mu nako jejo, Jesu kale ga jangala lwini ko Moya go Kucena mi kale ga ta nage, “Nda sa ku lumba Tata, u Mfumu gwegulu nelonga kakuli byebi i bintu na gwa bi zindila a bantu bo magano na ba ba lizigite, mi na gwa bi ganwina ku banuke-gana. Ee, Tata, kakuli mbobo ko shakile uku tendela.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tata na ga ndi wa i bintu byonse. Takuli uju a ndi zi ime nde Mwana buti ndimeni mbwita Tata, mi takuli uju e zi buti Tata ndini mbwita ime nde Mwana na ba na nda li shalila uku mu ganuna kwabo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Mi kale ga zokela ku bazigigwa bakwe no ku ba lugwila mu buzinda nage, “Nga mfwijaguzi a mensho ga bona ibi mu wene. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Kakuli nda sa mi lugwila buti, a baboni ba Nyambe a bangi no bamfumu ka ba shakite uku bona ibi mu wene kono ta na ba bi bona, no ku shugwa ibi mu shugwa kono ta na ba bi shugwa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo Musamaliya u mulotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Inako jimwinya, u muntu ka zekelele u mulao kale ga zimana ku jeleka Jesu. Kale ga buza nage, “Muzigi, mbinzi ndi botele uku tenda buti ndi jobole u bumi ta bu mani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mbinzi bi ñoletwe mu mulao, mi mbinzi u balamo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Ige kale ga taba nage, “U shake u Mfumu Nyambe gwako ko mojo gwako gonse no moya gwako gonse, no ko nguzu jako jonse, no ko nshugwiliso jako jonse,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Mulao 6:5</ref>.</char></note> mi u shake uju u bambene nage sinagwe ubu u li shakila.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Livitike 19:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “U la tabi nenja, u tende bulyao mi kuti no joje.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kono ige ko ku shaka uku li lulikiza gemwini, kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Mi uju ndi bambene nage ndini?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Mu ntabo Jesu kale ga ta nage, “U muntu ka sezumuka ku zwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema ku ja mu munzi gwa Jeliko, kale ga shangana a basa aba na ba mu zoganisa. Kale ba mu zula i bizwato byakwe, ku mu kaba na ba ka li jila ku mu leka a shaka uku fwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />“U mupulisiti kale ga ita momo mu nzila, mi aa bona jojo unkosi, kale ga mu kunduluka. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />No Mulivi nage, kale ga keza ao a cibaka no ku mu bona, no ku mu kunduluka.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />“Kono u Musamaliya, uju ka li mu lujendo, kale ga keza aa ka li jojo unkosi, mi aa mu bona, kale ga mu fwila inse. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Kale ga mu jila no ka zinga i bisila a bilabi byakwe, no ku sintilao a mafuta no waine. Mi kale ga mu tula a mbongolo jakwe, no ku mu twala ku njugo jo banyenda buti a ka mu unele. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Aa na bwaca, kale ga inda u tusheleñi to bile utu a gola uku belekela u muntu mu majuba go bile ku wa u mumameli go njugo jo banyenda no ku mu ta nage, ‘U mu unele, mi aa na ndi ka bogole, kuti na ndi ku life a masheleñi aga no jonekelwe.’<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Njwibo gwa babo a bantu bo tatwe uju u gaja buti ndege ka bambene no jojo u muntu uju sa gwila mu maganja go basa?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Uju ka zekelele u mulao kale ga taba nage, “Jojo na ga ba nonse akwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Jesu kale ga mu lugwila nage, “U ka je no ka tenda bulyao.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa potela ba Maleta no Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe aa ka ba li mu lujendo lwabo kale ga keza a munzi aa ka ku kala u mwanakazi ka kugigwa Maleta uju sa mu tambula a mubanda gwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Maleta ka kwesi mwancegwe ka kugigwa Maliya, uju ka kele afuwi no matende go Mfumu Jesu na tegeleze kwe bi ka gambagula. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Kono Maleta kame ka ungulukile ku kulibamba ko bintu byonse ibi ka bi botele uku tendigwa. Kale ga keza kwa Jesu no ku mu kumbila nage, “Mfumwangu, to kwesi intaba no mwance gwangu aa ndi lekelele na ndi tenda i misebezi ndenke? U mu lugwile a keze a ndi tuse!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />U Mfumu Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Maleta, Maleta, u li tongaukite no ku zielea ko bintu i bingi, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />kono mbintu i bice bi shakaala kampa mane ncintu conke bulyo. Maliya a la li shalili ici ci kele nenja, mi ta na ci indigwe kwakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ziga byo ntapelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ijuba limwinya, Jesu kame ka lapela mu cibaka cimwinya. Aa sa la mani, jumwinya go bazigigwa bakwe kale ga mu ta nage, “Mfumwetu, u tu zige uku lapela, sinagwe ndi Joani ubu sa zigila a bazigigwa bakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Aa mu lapela, mu te buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 11:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tata, izina lyako li be lyo kucena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">u mubuso gwako gu keze.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />U tu we shunu i bilyo byetu bya mwijuba-mwijuba.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />U tu kwatile i bitendantu i bimangoju byetu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">kakuli neswe tu la ku kwatilanga a bantu bonse aba ba tu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">tendanga i bitendantu i bimangoju. U leke uku tu twala mu mujeleko.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Mi Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Tu inde buti u li kwesi u musele, mi so la ja kwakwe akati ko masiku no ka mu ta buti, ‘Musele, ngo ndi kolotiseko a makomoki go tatwe go busu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />ndi musele gwangu a li mu lujendo a la kezi kwangu, mi ta ndi kwesi i bilyo byo ku mu wa.’<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />“Mi tu inde buti jojo a li mukati sa la taba buti, ‘U leke ku ndi tembeka. No cigalo ci la atigwa, no banangu neme se tu li lele. Ta ndi goli uku buka no ku ku wa cimwinya.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nda sa mi lugwila, no ku ta na ga buka no ku ku wa u busu kebaka lyo busele, kono kebaka lyo ku tongomana wawa ko bundume ka buka no ku ku wa ku ja ko bu u shakila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Cwale nda sa mi ta buti, mu kumbile, mi kuti na mu wegwe, mu shake mi kuti na mu gwane, mu kokote mi kuti na mu galwilwe i cigalo. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kakuli u muntu gense uju a kumbila ga sa tambula, uju a shaka ga sa gwana, mi no ku muntu uju a kokota, i cigalo kuti na ci galulwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Ndini kwenu mwe bazazi, uju ka wa mwane ijoka ati ige na la kumbili unswi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gamwinya a mabuka ga la nunga koko ku majwi buti, “kampa uju a kumbila i cinkwa, uju a gola uku mu wa ibwe?”</char></note>? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Kampa ndini a gola uku wa mwane inge, uku na la mu kumbili igi? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ati inwe nanga na mu li babi, mu li zi uku wa a mampo a malotu ku banenu, wawa Isenu gwa kwigulu kuti na mi ite mu ku wa u Moya go Kucena ku bantu aba ba mu kumbila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu no Bbeluzebule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Male 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Jesu kame ka tanda iyauma ku muntu uju ta ka gamba. Iyauma aa se li la zwi, unkosi uju ta ka gamba kale ga tatika uku gamba, mi u bungi bo bantu kale ba komokwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Kono bamwinya babo kale ba ta nabo, “Nka nguzu ja Bbeluzebule, u mfumu go mayauma a tanda a mayauma.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bamwinya kale ba mu jeleka ko ku kumbila i cijuliko ci zwa kwigulu.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Jesu kale ga ziba i migajalo jabo no ku ba ta nage, “U mubuso gonse gu li taite no ku li lwisa kuti na gu shwauke, mi no bantu bo luasi lonke aa ba li taa kuti na ba gwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ati Satani a li li taite no ku li lwisa gemwini, u mubuso gwakwe mbuti gu gola uku gongolela? Nda sa ta bulyao kakuli mwa sa ta buti kame ndi tanda a mayauma ko nguzu ja Bbeluzebule. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Cwale ati kame ndi tanda a mayauma ko nguzu ja Bbeluzebule, a baumpilili benu nka nguzu jani ba ga tanda? Cwale mbabo na ba be a baatuli benu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kono ati kame ndi tanda a mayauma ko nguzu ja Nyambe, cwale u mubuso gwa Nyambe na gwa sika kwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“U muntu u mugongo, uju a li bambite ko bilwiso, aa mamela injugo jakwe, u lubono lwakwe kuti lu kale nenja. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Kono u muntu jumwinya u mugongo ku mu ita aa keza ku mu lwisa no ku mu gola, ga sa inda i bilwiso ibi a sepete jojo unkosi no ku taa u lubono lwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“U muntu gense uju ta kumbi kwangu kame a ndi lwisa, mi u muntu gense uju ta gwaniki neme ga sa mwaga.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“U moya ta gu cenete aa gu zwa ku muntu, mu bibaka byo mpoza gu janga ka shaka a mawisikizo mi ta gu ga gwani. Mi se gu la li ta buti, ‘Kuti ndi bogole mu njugo na nda leka.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Aa gu sika, se gu la gwana injugo ji kulitwe bu cenesetwe no bintu bi tulitwe nenja. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Cwale se gu la kaja no ka inda i myoya jimwinya ja 7 i mimangoju lwini ku ita ubu gu kalile. Mi se ji la keza ku jojamo mi u mukalilo go mamaninino gwa jojo u muntu se gu la mangujuwa lwini ku ita etanzi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Jesu aa ka kwesi uku gambagula byebyo i bintu, u mwanakazi ka li mukati ko bantu a bangi kale ga kugiliza nage, “Imfwijaguzi nja mwanakazi uju na ga ku zala no ku ku nyonsa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Kono imfwijaguzi nja bantu aba ba shugwa ijwi lya Nyambe no ku li kutika.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cijuliko ca Jonasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />A bantu aa ka ba kwesi uku gwanana mu bungi wawa, Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Lolu nduasi lu mangujuwite. Ncijuliko lu kumbila, kono takuli ici sa ka lu wegwe mbwita i cijuliko ca Jonasi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kakuli sinagwe ndi Jonasi aa ka li cijuliko ku bantu ba Nenive, neme nde Mwana Muntu mbobo na ndi kalile kwa lo luno u luasi bulyao. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />U mfumu go mwanakazi gwa ku mbogela kuti na be umpaki mwijuba lyo nkatulo no bantu ba lo luno luasi no ku ba atula, kakuli sa ka zwa ku mamaninino gelonga keza ku tegeleza ku magano ga Solomoni, mi cwale u munene ku ita Solomoni juno kuno mi ndime. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />A bantu bo munzi gwa Nenive kuti na ba zimane a nkatulo no lo luno u luasi no ku lu atula, kakuli se ba siguluka kebaka lyo ntandazo ja Jonasi, cwale u munene ku ita Jonasi juno kuno mi ndime.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lambi go mubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Takuli u muntu a jakiza lambi no ku mu tula mu cibaka u mu a gola uku bikama kampa uku mu fulumikila mu kasuba. Kono mpa nzimano jakwe a tuligwa, buti aba ba ngina ba bone ituba. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />I linsho lyako nde lambi go mubili gwako. A mensho gako ati ta ga lwali, u mubili gwa ko gonse nago gu li vumbite ituba. Kono ati malwele, u mubili gwako nago gu li vumbite a kansindwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Mu bone buti ituba li li mwenu ta li bi a kansindwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Cwale, ati u mubili gwako gonse gu li vumbite ituba, mi takuli i cilama ca go ici ci li mu kansindwe, kuti gu vumbe ituba sinagwe ndi lambi a ku munikila ituba lyakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">U bumpai ku Bafalisi no bantu ba zekelele u mulao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Male 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku gambagula, u Mufalisi jumwinya kale ga mu kuga buti a ka lye nage, mi kale ga ka ja no ka kala ku ntafule. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Kono u Mufalisi kale ga komokwa aa nangula buti Jesu ta na ga shamba tanzi na sini uku lya.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kono u Mfumu Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Inwe cwale, mwe Bafalisi mwa sa cenesa inkomoki no kasuba kunze, kono mukati kenu ni nkole no bumangoju bi vumbitemo. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mwe bantu a bagelo! Uju na ga bumba anze ta li kame ndege na ga bumba no mukati bulyao? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Kono ko bintu bi li mukati kenu, mu be no cisemo ku bampale, mi i bintu byonse kuti na bi mi cenene.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“U bumpai mbwenu mwe Bafalisi kakuli mu la ku wanga Nyambe ce kumi ku bilimantu byonse byo ku koza sinagwe ni nyanisi jo makoto, i kabici mane no bisiu. Kono mwa sa kana uku lulikila no lushako lwa Nyambe. Ka mu botele uku li sholeza uku tenda co mamaninino uku ta mu leki ce tanzi uku ta ci la tendigwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“U bumpai mbwenu mwe Bafalisi, kakuli mu li bo ku shaka i bikalo byo butokwa mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda no manzuminizo gekute mu bibaka byo magulikizo.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“U bumpai mbwenu, kakuli mu li bo ku koza a mabita se ga bundaalite, aa se ba jenda-jenda a bantu ko ku sa ziba.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Jumwinya go bantu aba ka ba zekelele u mulao kale ga mu taba nage, “Muzigi, aa so gamba byebi i bintu, ndiswe so tukagula kame.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Nenwe mu zekelele u mulao, u bumpai mbwenu, kakuli mwa sa kolekisa a bantu i mizigo iji ba koleka mu bukababu, mi inwe na mu kangwa uku nanuna nanga munwe gonke ku ba tusa.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“U bumpai mbwenu, kakuli mwa sa jakila a baboni ba Nyambe a mabita, mi mbasukuzenu na ba ba yaga. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Cwale se mu la paka no ku zuminina i bintu na ba tenda basukuzenu. Na ba yaga a baboni ba Nyambe, mi inwe se mu la ba jakila a mabita. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kebaka leli, Nyambe mu magano gakwe sa ta buti, ‘Kuti na ndi ba tumine a baboni bangu no batumigwa, kono bamwinya babo kuti na ba ba yage mi bamwinya kuti na ba ba pengise.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ko mutendelo gogo lo luno u luasi kuti na lu wegwe u mulandu go malowa go baboni ba Nyambe bonse aga na ga sintika ku zwa ku matatikilo gelonga, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />ku tatikila ku malowa ga Abele ku twala ku malowa ga Zakaliya, uju sa yagilwa mukati ko lutala ne tempele. Ee, nda sa mi lugwila buti, lo luno u luasi kuti na lu wegwe u mulandu gwa byebyo byonse.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“U bumpai mbwenu inwe mu zekelele u mulao, kakuli na mwa inda i cigaluzo co nzibo. Inwe mwebeni ta na mwa ngina, mi na mwa kangwisa aba ka ba ngina.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Jesu aa sa la anini anze, a Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao kale ba tatika uku mu lwisa mu bunyegezi no ku mu buzagula a mabuzi, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />na ba shiamine uku mu shangeza mu cintu cimwinya ici ka botele uku gamba.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Byo nanguzo no ñongozo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mwa jejo inako, a bantu a bangi wawa kale ba gwanana, buti mane se ka ba li lyatagula, Jesu kale ga tatika tanzi uku gamba ku bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu li mamele ku mumela go Bafalisi, ugu gu li mantu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Takuli ici ci zinditwe, ici ta na ci bikululwe, kampa ici ci bikamite ici ta na ci zibaazwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ici na gwa gamba mu kansindwe kuti na ci shugwigwe mwituba, mi ici na gwa shobota mu kutwi mukati ko tumpetu twa mukati kuti na ci kugilizwe egulu lyo bituwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Nda sa mi lugwila mwe basele bangu, mu leke uku joga aba ba yaga u mubili mi ku zwao takuli ici ba gola uku tenda kame. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Kono kuti ndi mi sunde uju mu botele uku joga, mu joge Nyambe uju a kwesi inzuminino jo ku mi shonjela mwileba lyo mulilo uku i mibili jenu se ji la yagigwa. Ee, nda sa mi lugwila, mu mu joge. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ta li u tulumbu twa 5 tu la gulisigwa ko tusheleñi to bile to muwaya-waya? Kono takuli nanga konke kwato ka zibelwe kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Wawa, inshuki ja ku mitwi jenu na ja baligwa jonse. Mu leke uku joga, inwe mu li bo butokwa wawa ku ita u tulumbu u tungi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Nda sa mi lugwila, u muntu gense uju a ndi lugula ku bantu bamwinya, ime nde Mwana Muntu neme kuti na ndi mu lugule ku mañiloi ga Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Kono u muntu gense uju a ndi shampula ku bantu bamwinya kuti na ndi mu shampule ku mañiloi ga Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />U muntu gense uju a gamba ijwi ibi kwangu ime nde Mwana Muntu kuti na kwatilwe, kono u muntu gense uju a shwauza u Moya go Kucena ta na kwatilwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Aa mu twaligwa a majugo go malapelelo go Majuda, ku bajendesi no bo nguzu jo nzuminino, mu leke uku tongauka ubu sa ka mu li lamwinine mwebeni kampa ubu sa ka mu ka gambile, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />kakuli mwa jejo inako u Moya go Kucena kuti na gu mi zige ici mu botele uku gamba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo muntu go lubono u mugelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />U muntu jumwinya mukati ko bantu a bangi kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Muzigi, u lugwile mukulwangu buti a li taile u lubono lwa tata neme.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Musele, ndini na ga ndi shala uku ba u muatuli kampa u mutai mukati kenu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu mamele! Mu ligunge buti mu leke uku suna lwini u lubono mu mazila gonse, kakuli u bumi ta bu li zingite a lubono u lungi ulu a munite u muntu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Kale ga ba lugwila jeji inguli nage, “Igwa lyo nkosi jumwinya uju ka kwesi u lubono kale lya ba no muzimbu u munene. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Kale ga gaja nage, ‘Mbuti sa ka ndi tendele? Ta ndi kwesi i cibaka mo ku tula u lukau lwangu.’<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />“Cwale kale ga ta nage, ‘Ubu sa ka ndi tendele mbuti. Kuti ndi jakulule a mayongo gangu no ku jaka a manene, mi momo na ndi tule u bweke bwangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Mi kuti na ndi li te ndemwini buti, “U li kwesi u bweke u bungi ubu bu gola uku inda i myaka i mingi. U toleese u bumi, u lye, u nywe no ku tangalala.” ’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />“Kono Nyambe kale ga mu ta nage, ‘Igwe gwe cigelo, shunu ga gano a masiku so la fwa. Cwale ndini na inde ibi na gwa li bundikila gwemwini?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mbobo na ku kalile ku muntu gense uju a li bikila i bintu uku ta kwesi u lubono lo bintu bya Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkengejezi jo bumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Cwale nda sa mi lugwila, mu leke uku tongaukanga kebaka lyo bumi bwenu, ibi na mu lye kampa byo mibili jenu, ibi na mu zwate. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kakuli u bumi bu la ita i bilyo, no mubili gu la ita i bizwato.<verse eid="LUK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />“Nga mu gaje a mañwalala, ta ga byali no ku zimbula, ta ga kwesi a mayongo kampa a masumpila, kono Nyambe a la ga lela. Inwe mu li bo butokwa lwini ku ita i bijuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ndini kwenu uju a gola uku nunga inako jonke ku bumi bwakwe ko ku tongauka? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ko ku ta buti ta mu goli uku tenda ceci i cintu i cice wawa, ncinzi aa mu tongauka ko bintu bimwinya?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />“Mu gaje no mapalisa ga mu lugole ubu ga kulila. Ta ga sebezi kampa uku luka. Kono nda sa mi lugwila, nanga ndi Solomoni mu mpazimo jakwe jonse ta ga la zwata sinagwe ndimwinya lyo mapalisa gaga. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ati Nyambe mbobo a zwatikila u bwiju bwa mu lugole bulyao, ubu buliko aano shunu, mi ijona se bu la shonjigwa mu mulilo, mbuti ka kangwila uku mi zwatika, inwe bo nzumino inunu! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Mi mu leke uku twalikiza i myojo jenu kwe bi na mu lye kampa uku nywa, mu leke uku tongauka kabyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Bebyo i bintu byonse mbantu belonga aba ta ba zumine ba bi umpagiza, mi Isenu a li zekelele buti mbyebyo mu zunda. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Kono mu shake u mubuso gwakwe, mi kuti na mu wegwe byebi i bintu bulyao.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mwe mugona-gana, mu leke uku joga, kakuli Isenu a li shakite uku mi wa u mubuso. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Mu gulise u lubono lwenu mi mu we a bampale. Mu li tendele i bikwama ibi ta bi kulumpai, u lubono lwa mwigulu ulu ta na lu mane, uku takuli a basa aba ba senako no bampelenzi aba ba lu jona. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kakuli uku ku li u lubono lwenu no myojo jenu nkoko sa ka mu ji twalikize bulyao.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu litukise u keza ko Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Mu zwate mu litukiseze insebelezo mi mu leke a malambi genu ga jakile, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mu koze sinagwe mbaika aba ba lindile mfumwabo u ka bogola ka zwa ku mukiti go maseswa, buti aa sika no ku kokota, aobulyo se ba la mu galwila i cigalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Kuti na ku be no bulotu kwa babo a baika aba ka gwana mfumwabo na ba tonda aa sika. Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, kuti na zwate ku ba sebeleza no ku ba kalika a ntafule ku ba taila i bilyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Kuti na ku be u bulotu kwa babo a baika aba ka gwana mfumwabo na ba litukiseze, nanga ati na keza akati ko masiku kampa a maca-siku. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Kono mu shugwilise buti, ka li u mwini njugo na la zibi inako a keza u musa, ta na ga zuminina buti injugo jakwe ji tululigwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nenwe bulyao mu litukiseze, kakuli ime nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi keze mu nako ta mu ndi lindile.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Cwale Pitolosi kale ga buza nage, “Mfumwangu, iji inguli, ndiswe bulyo u ji lugwila kampa mbantu bonse?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />U Mfumu Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ndini elu u mubabaleli uju a sepaala no go magano, uju na ga wegwa kwa mfumwe uku babalela a baika bakwe ko ku ba olisanga i bilyo mu nako ji botete? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kuti na ku be u bulotu kwa jojo u muika mfumwe aa mu gwana a tenda bulyao aa ka bogola. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, jojo mfumwe kuti na mu tule a bujendesi bo bintu byonse ibya kwesi. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Kono bunga u muika na li ta gemwini nage, ‘Mfumwangu a li ka tagamite ta na wele keza,’ mi sa la tatika uku kaba a baika bo bankosi no banakazi, ige na lilila no ku li nywina ige ku dakwanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Mfumwe gwa jojo u muika kuti na keze mwijuba ili ta mu lindile no mu nako iji ta zekelele. Mi kuti na mu koshagule mu bituntula no ku mu shonjela mu cibaka co bantu aba ta ba zumine.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“U muika uju a zekelele ubu a shakila mfumwe kono ta litukisezi kampa uku tenda ubu a shakila mfumwe kuti na kabigwe ko mafaindi a mangi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Kono u muika uju ta zekelele ubu a shakila mfumwe mi sa la tenda i bintu bi botele uku bangisigwa kuti na kabigwe ko mafaindi a mace. Mi u muntu gense uju na ga wegwa i bintu i bingi, kuti na ku shakigwe i bintu i bingi kwakwe, mi uju na ga lekelwa uku babalela i bintu i bingi, kuti na ku buzaguligwe i bingi wawa kwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo ku sa shugwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Kame na nda keza ku shonjela u mulilo mwilonga, mi ta li ubu ndi shakila buti ka li na se gu jakila aano! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Kono ndi si botele uku ngina mu nkolobezo, mi ndi li li kalililwe ku twala aa na ji mane! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Kame mu gaja buti nku joja nenja na nda leta mwilonga? Inga, nda sa mi lugwila nku li taa na nda leta. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ku zwa aano a bantu ba 5 bo luasi lonke kuti na ba li tae mwalyabo, bo tatwe na ba li tae no bo bile, mi bo bile na ba li tae no bo tatwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Kuti na ba li tae, u muzazi go nkosi na li tae no mwane go muninzana, mi u mwana go muninzana na li tae nesi, u muzazi go mwanakazi na li tae no mwane go mukazana mi u mwana go mukazana na li tae no nyina, u mukwe go mwanakazi na li tae no mukwe gwakwe go mukazana mi u mukwe go mukazana na li tae no mukwe gwakwe go mwanakazi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku ziba byo ku zoka ko manako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Jesu kale ga lugwila a bantu a bangi nage, “Aa mu bona ijoba li juuluka ku bugwe-juba, aobulyo se mu la ta buti, ‘Umvula kuti a shoke,’ mi se ku la ba bulyao. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Mi inkuli ja ku mbogela aa ji unga, se mu la ta buti, ‘Kuti kuye’ mi se ku la ba bulyao. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Inwe bo mantu! Mu li zi uku tansulula u mubonaalilo gwelonga negulu. Ncinzi aa ta mwi zi bo ku tansulwila bya je jino inako?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Ncinzi aa ta mu li shalili mwebeni ici ci botete? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Igwe no ku ja no muntu uju a ku zimbite ku muatuli go nkuta, u jeleke wawa uku zumininana nage na mu si li mu nzila, kakuli aa ta ku tendaali bulyao bunga jojo a ku zimbite sa la ku kokela ku muatuli, mi u muatuli sa la ku tambika ku mupokola, mi u mupokola sa la ku shonjela mu ntolongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nda sa ku lugwila, to no zwemo mbwita aa no lifile isheleñi lyo mamaninino.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Insiguluko kampa u lufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Cwale momo mu nako a bantu bamwinya aba ka ba liko kale ba gambaguza Jesu byo Magalileya aba na ga yaga Pilato aa ka ba tentela Nyambe i bitagilo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mbuti mu gajila kwa baba a Magalileya nenwe ka ba li bo bitendantu i bimangoju lwini ku ita a Magalileya bamwinya bonse kakuli na ba penga bulyaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Nda sa mi lugwila, inga! Ati ta mu siguluki, nenwe bulyao kuti na mu fwe. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Kampa ba lya a bantu ba 18 aba na ba gwilwa ku tawala inde ja mwa Silowe, mbuti mu gajila nenwe ka ba li bantu ba fosaalite lwini ku ita a bantu bonse ba joja mwa Jelusalema? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nda sa mi lugwila, inga! Ati ta mu siguluki, nenwe bulyao kuti na mu fwe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo cishamu co mulya-nshwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Jesu kale ga ba lugwila jeji inguli nage, “Unkosi jumwinya sa zuga i cishamu co mulya-nshwi mwigwa lyakwe, kale ga jako buti a ka shake i biyango kwaco kono takuli ici na ga ka gwanako. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kale ga lugwila unkosi uju ka babalela igwa nage, ‘Ngolole se myaka jo tatwe na ndi keza ku shakanga i biyango kwa gogu u mulya-nshwi mi takuli ibi ndi gwanangako. U gu teme! Ncinzi gu jonena ivu?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Kono jojo unkosi kale ga taba nage, ‘Mfumwangu, u gu leke tanzi a mwaka gonke kuti na ndi gu sile mu mbali no ku gu tulila u mununo. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ati na gu aka u mwaka gu keza, mbobo! Ati ta gu aki, cwale no gu teme.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza u mwanakazi lyo Nsabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lyo Nsabata Jesu kame ka ziga mu njugo jimwinya jo malapelelo jo Majuda, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />mi momo mo ka li u mwanakazi uju se ka kwesi i myaka ja 18 na pengisigwa ku moya u mubi. Se ka vungamite no mushana ta ka si gola uku zimana bu golokete. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Jesu aa mu bona, kale ga mu kuga no ku mu ta nage, “Mwanakazi, u la lukululwi ku bulwele bwako.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Jesu kale ga mu tula a maganja, mi aobulyo kale ga goloka no ku lumba Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Kono u mujendesi go njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda kale ga nyegela kakuli Jesu na ga oza lyo Nsabata, mi kale ga lugwila a bantu nage, “Majuba ga 6 na twa zumininwa uku sebeza. Mu kezange na mu ozwa mwa gago a majuba, lyo Nsabata nyaa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />U Mfumu Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Inwe bo mantu! Izo u muntu gense gwenu ta sungululangi ipulu lyakwe kampa imbongolo no ku ji twala ku menzi lyo Nsabata? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Cwale joju u mwanakazi, mwana Abbulaama, uju ka shuminwe kwa Satani mu myaka ja 18, ta botele uku lukululwa mwijuba lyo Nsabata ku cintu ici ka ci mu shumine?”<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Jesu aa sa la gambi bulyao, bonse aba ka ba mu lwisa kale ba gena, kono a bantu kale ba jangala kebaka lyo bintu i bilotu ka tenda Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo lubuto u lununu no mumela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Male 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Cwale Jesu kale ga buza nage, “U mubuso gwa Nyambe ncinzi gu kozete? Ncinzi sa ka ndi gu kozanise? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ngwa ku koza sinagwe ndubuto u lununu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike mbuti ga co buti, “ndubuto lo masitete” mi ndununu lwini mi ka lu byaligwanga mu malonga go Majuda, ka lu menanga no ku kula ku ba i cishamu. </char></note> ulu na ga inda u muntu no ka lu byala mwiga lyakwe. Kale lwa kula no ku ba i cishamu, mi i bijuni kale bya jakilako i bijakilo muntabi jaco.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Kame Jesu kale ga buza nage, “Nku cinzi sa ka ndi kozanise u mubuso gwa Nyambe? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ngwa ku koza u mumela ugu a la indi u mwanakazi no ku gu gwanika no makomoki go tatwe go busu mi se gu la gwanana no mukandilo gonse.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cizi co ku sundana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Jesu kale ga ja bu ita mu minzi i minene no minunu na ja bu ziga bu tungulwize kwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />U muntu jumwinya kale ga mu buza nage, “Mfumwangu, mbantu a bace bulyo aba na ba jojeswe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Jesu kale ga ba lugwila nage, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Mu tende ubu mu golela bonse uku ngina mu cizi ci sundanite, kakuli nda sa mi lugwila, u bungi bo bantu kuti na ba jeleke uku ngina kono ta na ba gole. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />U mwini njugo aa sa ka na buke no ku gala ku cizi, inwe kuti na mu zimane kunze na mu kokota no ku kumbila buti, ‘Mfumwetu, u tu galwile.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">“Kono ige kuti na tabe buti, ‘Ta ndi mi zi mane no ku mu zwa.’<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />“Mi inwe kuti na mu te buti, ‘Se tu lya no ku nywa negwe, mi so ziga mu minzi jetu.’<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />“Kono kuti na tabe buti, ‘Ta ndi mi zi mane no ku mu zwa. Mu zwe kwangu inwe mwense mwe batendi bo bubi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Mi momo kuti na ku be no malilo, no ku kweka a meno, aa na mu bone Abbulaama no Isaka no Jakobo mane no baboni bonse ba Nyambe mu mubuso gwa Nyambe, kono inwe na mu shonjelwe kunze. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />A bantu kuti na ba zwe ku buzwe-juba no ku bugwe-juba no ku mutulo no ku mbogela, mi kuti na ba gwane i bibaka a mukiti mu mubuso gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Mbyaconse nko ba li a bantu bo mamaninino aba na ba be betanzi, no betanzi aba na ba be bo mamaninino.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa lilila u munzi gwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Momo mu nako, a Bafalisi bamwinya kale ba keza kwa Jesu no keza ku mu ta nabo, “U zwe mo muno mu cibaka mi u je kungi, kakuli Eloda ndigwe a shaka uku yaga.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mu jende mu ka lugwile jojo sibwe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sibwe, Jesu mukalilo gwa Eloda go bujonabi no buyagi ka toloka takali sibwe wawa, mi kame ta li nku senda ka mu senda.</char></note> ‘Kuti na ndi zundamine uku tanda a mayauma no ku oza a bantu shunu nejona, mi mwijuba lya tatu nko kuti na ndi mane u musebezi gwangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Nanganceciba bulyao, ndi li botele uku zundamina shunu nejona no mwijuba lya tatu, kakuli mbyaconse takuli u muboni gwa Nyambe uju a botele uku fwila kunze jo munzi gwa Jelusalema!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Jelusalema, Jelusalema! Igwe u yaga a baboni ba Nyambe no ku sobagula ko mabwe a bantu aba se ba tumigwa kwako, u bungi bo nako ka ndi shakite uku gwanika bano antu-onke, sinagwe nu nkuku a gwanika u tusyo twakwe mwinsi lyo mabando gakwe, kono na gwa kana. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Cwale ngo lole, injugo jako u mu ko kala se ndi tongo. Nda sa ku lugwila, to no ndi bone kame mbwita aa sa ka no te buti, ‘Ngwa mfwijaguzi uju a keza mwizina lyo Mfumu.’ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku vumbiliza ibi sa gamba u muboni gwa Nyambe mwibuka lyo Nimbo 118:26.</char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza u muntu lyo Nsabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lyo Nsabata limwinya, Jesu kale ga ja mu njugo ja jumwinya u mukulu go Bafalisi buti aka lye, mi Jesu ka mamelwe lwini. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Mi afuwi nage mpo ka li u muntu ka lwala u bulwele bo ku zimba u mubili. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Jesu kale ga buza a Bafalisi no bantu ba zekelele u mulao nage, “Ncintu ci zumininwa ko mulao uku oza lyo Nsabata indi ta ku zumininwa?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Kono kale ba ombelela. Cwale Jesu kale ga kwata jojo u muntu no ku mu oza mi kale ga mu ta buti a bogole.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Mi Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Ati jumwinya gwenu na kwesi u mwana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya ni mbongolo ba ñolete momu mu ntimana ja 5. </char></note> kampa ipulu mi se li la gwila mwikalo lyo Nsabata, ta li ka welangilako no ka li kokamo?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Mi kale ba bula co ku gamba.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">U bumangoju bo ku li bonisa u buntu-awa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Jesu aa sa la nanguli a banyenda ubu ka ba li shalila i bikalo ibi bi kutekea a ntafule, kale ga ba lugwila inguli nage, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“U muntu aa ku kugila ku mukiti go maseswa, u leke ka kala mu cibaka ici ci kutekea, kakuli bunga nkwali uju a la kugigwa uju a kutekea ku ku ita. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ati na ku kala bulyao, uju a la mi kugi mwense kuti a keze ku ku ta buti, ‘U we joju u muntu i cikalo cako.’ Cwale kuti u fwiswe inshoni, so ko ka kale mu cibaka i cishwauki.<verse eid="LUK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />“Kono aa u kugigwa, u ka kale mu cibaka ca ku mashule wawa, buti uju a la ku kugi aa keza, kuti a ku te buti, ‘Musele, senena ku cibaka i cilotu.’ Cwale kuti u kutikigwe a banyenda bonse na ba ku wene. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kakuli a bantu bonse aba ba li kulisa abo a beni kuti na ba gombaazwe mi aba ba li gombaaza abo a beni kuti na ba kulisigwe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Mi Jesu kale ga ta jojo u muntu na ga mu kuga nage, “Aa u tenda i bilyo byo kamwi kampa byo mulalilo, u leke ku kuga bulyo a basele bako, bancego kampa bancii jako, bakwako, kampa aba ba kwesi u lubono aba u bambene nabo, ati no ba kuga, bunga se ba la ku kuga negwe mi kuti no lifigwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Kono aa u tenda u mukiti, u kugileko a bampale, i bigangantu, byo matende aga ta ga kele nenja, no biofu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />mi kuti no gwane imfwijaguzi. Nanganceciba buti ta ba goli uku ku lifa, kuti no lifigwe a mbuko jo bantu ba lulikile.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo mukiti u munene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Jumwinya gwa babo ka ba kele a ntafule nage aa sa la shugwi bulyao, kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Imfwijaguzi nja muntu uju na ka lye a mukiti mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “U muntu jumwinya ka kwesi uku lukisa u mukiti u munene mi kale ga kuga a bantu a bangi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ko nako jo mukiti kale ga tuma u muika gwakwe buti a ka je no ka lugwila babo na ba kugigwa buti, ‘Mu keze, kakuli aano i bintu byonse bi la lulikili.’<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />“Kono bonse ko ku sa andana kale ba tatika uku li kumbilila. Gwe tanzi kale ga ta nage, ‘Ndigwa ndi zwa uku gula, mi ndi li botele u ka ja no ka li bona. U ndi kwatile.’<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />“Jumwinya kale ga ta nage, ‘Mapulu ge kumi ndi zwa uku gula, mi mu nzila ndi li buti ndi ka ga jeleke. U ndi kwatile.’<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />“Mi jumwinya kame kale ga mu ta nage, ‘Nko ku zwa ndi zwa uku sesa, mi ta ndi goli u keza.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“U muika kale ga bogola no ka lugula byebyo kwa mfumwe. Cwale u mwini njugo kale ga nyegela mi kale ga ta u muika gwakwe nage, ‘Welanga u je mu mazila no mu nkanza jo munzi mi u ka lete a bampale, i bigangantu, i biofu no bo matende aga ta ga kele nenja.’<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />“U muika kale ga ta nage, ‘Mfumwangu, ibi u la gambi bi la tendigwa, kono i cibaka nko ci si li.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />“Cwale mfumwe kale ga ta u muika gwakwe nage, ‘U jende mu mikwakwa no mu mazila gelonga u je bu indikiza a bantu buti ba keze, buti injugo jangu ji vumbe. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nda sa ku lugwila, takuli nanga genke gwa babo na ba kugigwa uju na lase ku bilyo byo mukiti gwangu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku ba u muzigigwa ku la tula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />A bantu a bangi ka ba jenda no Jesu, mi kale ga zokela kwabo no ku ta nage, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Ati u muntu gense na keza kwangu uku ta zimbi isi no nyina, mukazi gwakwe no bane, bakulwe no bancegwe bo bankosi no banakazi, ee, nanga mbumi bwakwe, u muntu gwa bulyao ta goli uku ba u muzigigwa gwangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Mi u muntu gense uju ta indi i cifapaano cakwe no ku ndi umpilila ta goli uku ba u muzigigwa gwangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Bunga u muntu jumwinya gwenu kame a shaka uku jaka i tawala inde. Ta li ka mana uku kala tanzila ansi no ku gaja byo ku jakisa no ku bona buti a li kwesi a masheleñi go ku ji mana? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Kakuli ati no sumpa insumpo mi so la kangwa uku tu mana, bonse aba ba gu bona kuti ba kunyungulule, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />ko ku ta buti, ‘Uju u muntu na ga tatika uku jaka mi na ga kangwa uku mana.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Kampa bunga u mfumu kame a shaka uku lwa no mfumu jumwinya. Ntali ka mana uku kala ansi tanzila no ku gaja buti a bankosi ba 10,000 ba la gola uku lwisa u mfumu uju a keza no ba 20,000? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Kakuli ati ta goli, kuti a tume a bantu jojo u mfumu jumwinya na si jenda u kule mi kuti a kumbile a majwi go ku joja nenja. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ko mutendelo gu li kozete, bamwinya benu aba ta ba buguki ku bintu ba kwesi ta ba goli uku ba a bazigigwa bangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izwai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Male 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Izwai ndilotu, kono ati na li sampuka, mbuti mu gola uku li tendela buti li shugwaale nenja kame? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ta li si kwesi intuso nanga nkwivu kampa kwibunda lyo mununo, se li la showigwa bulyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">“Uju a kwesi a matwi go ku shugwisa, a shugwe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Inguli jongu jo ku joba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Cwale a batentesi no bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju kale ba tatika uku gwanana buti ba tegeleze kwa Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Kono a Bafalisi no bazigi bo mulao kale ba tongauka nabo, “Uju unkosi ga sa tambula a bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju no ku lya nabo.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ba lugwila jeji inguli nage, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Tu inde buti ati jumwinya gwenu na kwesi ingu jo makumi ge kumi mi sa la jobelwao jonke. Ntali ka mana uku leka ja 99 a lukanda no ka ja bu shaka iji ji la jobi mane na ka ji gwana? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Mi aa ka ji gwana, ga sa ji tula a mashansha gakwe bu jangele <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />no ku bogwela ku munzi. Mi sa la kuga a basele bakwe na ba a bambene nabo antu-onke no ku ta nage, ‘Mu jangale neme, ndi la gwani ingu jangu iji ka ji jobete.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Nda sa mi lugwila ko ku sa andana buti kuti na ku be no ku jangala u kunene mwigulu kebaka lyo muntu genke go bitendantu i bimangoju uju a siguluka ku ita a bantu ba 99 aba ba lulikile aba ta ba zundi insiguluko.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli je sheleñi na lya joba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Kampa bunga u mwanakazi uju a kwesi a masheleñi ge kumi go muwaya-waya mi sa la jobelwa isheleñi lyonke. Ta li ka mana uku jakiza i lambi, no ku kula injugo jonse no ku shakisisa nenja mane na li gwana? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Mi aa sa la li gwani, ga sa kuga a basele bakwe na ba a bambene nabo antu-onke no ku ta nage, ‘Mu jangale neme, ndi la gwani isheleñi lyangu ili ka li jobete.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ko ku sa andana, nda sa mi lugwila buti, nkokuli uku jangala ku mañiloi ga Nyambe kebaka lyo muntu genke go bitendantu i bimangoju uju a siguluka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo mwana na ga joba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Jesu kale ga nungako nage, “Nko ka li unkosi uju ka kwesi a bana bo bile bo baninzana. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Uju ka li mutompo, kale ga ta isi nage, ‘Tata, u ndi we ku lubono ulu lu botele uku ba lwangu.’ Isabo kale ga ba taila u lubono lwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />“Aa na kwa mana a majuba a mace, u mutompo, kale ga gwanika byonse ibi ka kwesi, no ku ja kwilonga lya kule mi koko kale ga ka jonenako u lubono lwakwe mu bumi u bumangoju. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Aa sa la mani i bintu byonse, kale kwa ba ne njala inene momo mwilonga lyonse, mi kale ga tatika uku bula. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Cwale kale ga kaja no ka li nginika a musebezi gemwini ku muntu jumwinya gwa lelyo ilonga, uju na ga mu twala ku lugwa lwakwe buti a ka lele a banjili. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Se ka shakite uku lya i bikumbo ibi ka ba lya a banjili, kono takuli uju na ga mu wa i cintu conse.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />“Aa sa la gaji, kale ga ta nage, ‘Mboti ku babeleki ba tata aba ba kwesi i bilyo mane mbwita uku bi kangwa, kono ime na ndi li fwila bulyo ku njala ko kuno! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Kuti na ndi funduke no ku bogola kwa tata na ndi ka mu te buti, Tata, na nda tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju kwa Nyambe mane no kwako. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ta ndi si botele uku kugigwa buti ndi li mwano, u ndi tende sinagwe njumwinya go babeleki bako.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Mi kale ga funduka no ku bogola kwesi.<figure style="fig" alt="Father greets lost son" file="dn00485b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luk 15:17-24" copy="Dunham" ref="15:17-24">U mwana go ku joba aa ka bogola kwesi</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Mi aa ka si jendela u kule, isi kale ga mu bona mi kale ga mu fwila inse, kale ga mu tigilila no ka mu tula mu maboko gakwe no ku mu sonsona.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“U mwana kale ga ta nage, ‘Tata, na nda tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju kwa Nyambe mane no kwako. Ta ndi botele uku kugigwa mwano.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />“Kono isi kale ga lugwila a baika bakwe nage, ‘Mu welange! Muka inde u mukanjo u mulotu mu gu mu jabike. Mu mu jabike a kasekenyenge ku munwe gwakwe no nshangu ku matende gakwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Inwe mu ka inde i namani iji na ja nunisigwa mi mu ji yage. Tu tende u mukiti no ku jangala. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kakuli joju mwanangu ka fwite mi sa la joja kame, sa joba mi a la gwanigwa.’ Cwale kale ba tatika uku jangala.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Mwa jejo inako, u mwana u mukulu nkwigwa ka ka li. Aa se ka ja bu senena afuwi no munzi kale ga shugwa inimbo no ku bona a bantu ba nenga. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kale ga kuga jumwinya go baika ku mu buza ibi ka bi tendaala. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />U muika kale ga mu taba nage, ‘Mwancego a la kezi, mi isho a la yagi i namani iji na ja nunisigwa kakuli mwane a la ka mu bogweli bu liketete nenja.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Mukulwa-muntu kale ga nyegela mi kale ga kana uku ngina mukati. Cwale isi kale ga zwila anze no ka mu kumbila buti a ngine mukati. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Kono ige kale ga taba isi nage, ‘Ngolole! Jonse jeji i myaka ka ndi kwesi uku ku belekela sinagwe muika ta na nda shwauza i milao jako. Kono ta gwa la ndi wa nanga nkapuli-gana buti ndi jangale no basele bangu. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Kono jojo mwano uju na ga ka jona u lubono lwako no banakazi bo cise aa ka bogola ku munzi, gwa sa mu yagila i namani iji na ja nunisigwa!’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Isi kale ga ta nage, ‘Mwanangu, igwe neme u kele inako jonse, mi byonse i bintu ndi kwesi mbyako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kono ka tu botele uku tangalala no ku jangala, kakuli joju mwancego ka fwite mi se mumi kame, sa joba mi a la gwanigwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Inguli jo mubabaleli ta sepaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Jesu kale ga lugwila a bazigigwa bakwe inguli nage, “Nko ka li u muntu ka kwesi u lubono mi ka kwesi u mubabaleli uju sa shangezwa buti ndubono lwakwe ka jona. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ige kale ga kuga jojo u mubabaleli no ku mu buza nage, ‘Ibi ndi shugwile kako mbinzi? U ndi sundise ubu belekela, kakuli to si botele uku ba u mubabaleli kame.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />“U mubabaleli kale ga li gambila gemwini nage, ‘Mbuti sa ka ndi tendele? Mfumwangu sa la ndi zwisa a musebezi. Ta ndi gongwele mu ku lima, mi ndi li go nshoni uku kumbila, <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ndi li zi ubu sa ka ndi tendele, buti nanga na ndi zwa a musebezi gwangu aano, a bantu kuti na ba ndi tambule mu mibanda jabo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Cwale kale ga kuga u muntu gense uju ka kolotele mfumwe. Kale ga buza gwe tanzi nage, ‘Ndi bukai u kolotele mfumwangu?’<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />“Ige kale ga taba nage, ‘Mafuta ga olive ga vumba i mingomo jo makumi ge kumi.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">“Jojo u mubabaleli kale ga mu ta nage, ‘Inda aa u ñolete i cikoloti cako, kala ansi wangu, u ñole bulyo i mingomo jo makumi ga 5.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />“Cwale kale ga buza gwa bili nage, ‘Ingegwe ndi bukai u kolotite?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Ige kale ga taba nage, ‘Masaka go makumi ge kumi go buloto.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Kale ga mu ta nage, ‘Inda aa u ñolete i cikoloti cako mi u bonise bulyo a masaka go makumi ga 8.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Mfumwe kale ga lumba u mubabaleli uju ta sepaali kakuli na ga tenda ko magano. Kakuli a bantu ba le lino ilonga mba magano wawa ko bu ba tendela mu bintu byabo ku ita a bantu be tuba. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Nda sa mi lugwila mu litusise u lubono lwelonga buti mu gwanineo a basele, buti aa se lu la mani, na mu tambulwe mu munzi gu kalilile.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />“U muntu gense uju a sepaala ko bintu i bice a la gola uku sepaala no ko bintu i bingi, mi gense uju ta sepaali ko bintu i bice ta na sepaale kame no ko bintu i bingi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ati ta ka mu sepaala ubu ka mu babalelela u lubono lwa mwilonga, ndini na mi sepe ko lubono lwa conse? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Mi ati ta ka mu sepaala ku cintu a kwesi u muntu jumwinya, ndini na mi we i bintu byenu?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Takuli u muntu uju a gola uku sebeleza a bamfumu bo bile. Kakuli kuti a zimbe genke no ku shaka jumwinya, kampa kuti a sepaale kwa genke no ku shwauza jumwinya. Ta mu goli uku sebeleza Nyambe no masheleñi antu-onke.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />A Bafalisi, aba ka ba shaka lwini a masheleñi aa ba shugwa byonse byebyo kale ba nyungulula Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Inwe mu li bo ku li bonisanga uku lulikila mu mensho go bantu bamwinya, kono Nyambe a li zekelele i myojo jenu. I bintu ba inda u butokwa lwini a bantu, ta bi kwesi intuso mu mensho ga Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“U mulao gwa Mushe no baboni ba Nyambe ka bi gambigwa ku twala ku nako ja Joani u mukolobezi. Ku zwa jejo inako, a majwi a malotu go mubuso gwa Nyambe ga sa tandazigwa, mi u muntu gense ga sa tenda ubu a golela buti a gwane inzila jo ku sika kwago. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Mbutole igulu nelonga uku zwako ku ita buti intaku inunu jo mulao ji zweko.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Unkosi gense uju a tanda u mukazi gwakwe no ku sesa u mwanakazi u mungi kale ga tenda i cise, mi unkosi uju a sesa u mwanakazi uju na ga tandigwa kale ga tenda i cise.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unkosi ka kwesi u lubono no Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Nko ka li unkosi uju ka kwesi u lubono uju ka zwata i bizwato byo ku luka a buanda bo ku lelema bo mubala go nzilu mi ka joja u bumi u bulotu mwijuba-mwijuba. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Mi a cizi cakwe mpo ka ku lalanga unkumbizi gwezina lya Lazalo, ka kwesi i bilabi a mubili gonse <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />mi ka zilwizanga uku lya ibi ka bi gwa ku zwa a ntafule jo nkosi uju ka kwesi u lubono. Mane no bambwa ka ba keza na ba mu lasa a bilabi byakwe.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“I nako kale ja sika jo ku fwa ko nkumbizi mi a mañiloi kale ga mu inda no ku mu twala kumbali ja Abbulaama. Mi unkosi uju ka kwesi u lubono nage kale ga fwa mi kale ga zikigwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Aa ka li mu cibaka co bafu u mu na ga ka bangisigwa, kale ga lola kwigulu mi kale ga bona Abbulaama u kule, no Lazalo kumbali jakwe. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Kale ga mu kuga nage, ‘Tata Abbulaama, u ndi fwile inse mi u tume Lazalo buti a cumpwe i ncinko jo munwe gwakwe mu menzi no ku tontoza u lulimi lwangu, kakuli mu ku shishama ndi li mwa go guno u mulilo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Kono Abbulaama kale ga taba nage, ‘Mwanangu, u vuluke buti inako jo ku joja kwako na gwa tambula i bintu i bilotu byako, kono Lazalo ige na ga tambula i bintu i bimangoju, kono aano ige sa la likola ko kuno mi igwe so la penga. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Mi uku nunga kwa byebyo byonse, mukati ketu nenwe ncikisi co ku noka lwini na ca tuligwamo, buti aba ba shaka ku zwa ko kuno no keza koko ba kangwe, no babo ba li koko ba kangwe uku shatukila ko kuno kwetu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />“Uju ka kwesi u lubono kale ga taba nage, ‘Elu nda sa ku kumbila tata, u tume Lazalo ku luasi lwangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kakuli ndi li kwesi bance gwangu ba 5. A ka ba nanguze, buti nabo na ba leke u keza ko kuno ku cibaka co bangiso.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Abbulaama kale ga taba nage, ‘Ba li kwesi Mushe no baboni ba Nyambe, ba tegeleze kwabo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Uju ka ka kwesi u lubono kale ga ta nage, ‘Inga, tata Abbulaama, ati u muntu jumwinya ku bafu na ja kwabo, kuti na ba siguluke.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />“Kono Abbulaama kale ga mu ta nage, ‘Ati ta ba tegelezi kwa Mushe no baboni ba Nyambe, ta na ba logwe nanga muntu na buke ku zwa ku bafu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">I bitendantu i bimangoju, inzumino no musebezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Male 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “I bintu bi letela a bantu uku sitagala, bi li botele uku keza, kono u bumpai mbwa muntu gense uju na bi keze kakwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ka ku ba u bulotu kwake uku mu shonjela mwiwate na sungililwe ibwe inene mu nsingo ku ita uku letela jumwinya gwa baba a banuke-gana uku sitagala. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Cwale mu li mamele mwebeni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Ati u mukwako na ku tenda i citendantu i cimangoju, u mu jukukile, mi ati na siguluka, u mu kwatile. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nanga ati na ku tenda i citendantu i cimangoju mu manako ga 7 mwijuba lyonke, mi aa ka ku bogwela no keza ku ku ta buti, ‘Nda sa siguluka,’ u li botele uku mu kwatila.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />A batumigwa, kale ba ta u Mfumu nabo, “U neneese inzumino jetu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />U Mfumu Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Ati mu li kwesi inzumino inunu sinagwe mbununu bo lubuto, mu la gola uku ta ceci i cishamu co mulya-nshwi buti, ‘U nyukulwe no ka zugigwa mwiwate,’ mi ka ci mi kutika.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Tu inde buti jumwinya gwenu a li kwesi u mubeleki uju a kekela kampa uju a mamela ingu, buti a la gola uku ta jojo u mubeleki aa sika ka zwa kwigwa buti, ‘Keza kuno wangu mi u kale ansi u lye’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Buti ta na ga mu ta tanzi buti, ‘Ndi tendele u mulalilo, u litukiseze mi u ndi taile ndi lye no ku nywa, aa sa ka ndi mane nko kuti u lye no ku nywa’? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Buti ka litumela kwa jojo u mubeleki kebaka lyo ku tenda ibi a la lugwilwa uku tenda? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Cwale nenwe bulyao, aa se mu la tendi i bintu byonse ibi na mwa lugwilwa uku tenda, mu la gola uku ta buti, ‘Tu li babeleki ta ba botelele, mbulyo tula tendi u musebezi gwetu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza a bankosi be kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Jesu aa kaja kwa Jelusalema, ka itile mu maninja gelonga lya Samaliya no Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Aa ka ngina mu munzi gumwinya, a bankosi be kumi aba ka ba lwala i cisenda kale ba mu shangana. Kale ba zimanina u kule kanunu <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />mi kale ba kugiliza mwijwi inene nabo, “Jesu, gwe Mfumu, u tu fwile inse!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Aa ba bona, kale ga ta nage, “Mu jende, mu ka li bonise ku mapulisiti.” Mi aa ka ba kaja kale ba lwaluka.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Jumwinya gwabo, aa bona buti a la lwaluki, kale ga bogola, na lumba Nyambe keejwi lyo ku gongoza. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Kale ga li gwisikiza ku matende ga Jesu no ku litumela kwakwe, mi ka li Musamaliya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Jesu kale ga buza nage, “Ntali mbe kumi ba la lwaluki, inga bamwinya ba 9 kwibo? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Takuli uju a la ka bogoli keza ku litumela kwa Nyambe mbwita joju u muzwa-malonga?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Mi kale ga mu ta nage, “Nanuka mi u ka je, inzumino jako ji la ku ozi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku keza ko mubuso gwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Inako jimwinya, a Bafalisi bamwinya, kale ba buza Jesu nabo, “Ndusiku nzi na gu keze u mubuso gwa Nyambe?” Jesu kale ga taba nage, “U mubuso gwa Nyambe ta gu kezi mu nzila ji bonaala, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />buti mane a bantu na ba te buti, ‘Guno kuno,’ kampa, ‘Gulya ku lya,’ kakuli u mubuso gwa Nyambe mukati kenu gu li.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Cwale kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “I nako ji la keza aa na mu lumbile uku bona limwinya lyo majuba gangu ime nde Mwana Muntu, kono ta na mu li bone. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />A bantu kuti na ba mi te buti, ‘Julya ku lya!’ kampa ‘Juno kuno!’ Kono na mu leke ku ja bu tiga bu ba umpilile. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kakuli u Mwana Muntu mwijuba lyakwe kuti na koze sinagwe ndumuni lo mvula, ulu lu besa no ku munika mwigulu ku zwa ku mamaninino go lubazu lumwinya ku ja kwa lumwinya. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Kono tanzi a si botele uku penga i bintu i bingi no ku kanigwa kwa lo luno u luasi.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Sinagwe ubu ka ku kalile mu majuba ga Nuwe, mbobo na ku kalile kame mu majuba gangu ime nde Mwana Muntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />A bantu ka ba lya no ku nywa, ku sesa no ku wegwa mu maseswa ku twala kwijuba na ga ngina Nuwe mwa aleka. Mi u bulobe kale bwa keza no ku ba jona bonse.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />“Ka ku li kozete no mu majuba ga Lota. A bantu ka ba lya no ku nywa, na ba gula no ku gulisa, na ba byala no ku jaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Kono ijuba na ga zwa Lota mwa Sodoma, u mulilo no silufula kale bya shokela ansi ku zwa kwigulu no ku ba jona bonse.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Mbobo na ku tendaalile bulyaa mwijuba na ndi bonaazwe ime nde Mwana Muntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Momo mwijuba takuli u muntu na kale egulu lyo njugo, u lubono na lu li mukati uju na suke buti aka lu inde. Ko ku sa andana, takuli uju na gwanaale na li mwigwa uju na bogwele cimwinya. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mu vuluke u mukazi gwa Lota! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />U muntu gense uju a jeleka uku bika u bumi bwakwe kuti na bu jonekelwe, mi u muntu gense uju a jonekelwa u bumi bwakwe ndege na bu jojese. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nda sa mi lugwila buti mwa gago a masiku a bantu bo bile kuti na ba gwanaale a bulo bonke, genke kuti na indigwe mi jumwinya na sigigwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />A banakazi bo bile aba na ba gwanigwe na ba twa u bweke antu-onke, genke kuti na indigwe mi jumwinya na sigigwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Ku bankosi bo bile aba na ba gwanigwe na ba li mwigwa, genke kuti na indigwe, jumwinya na sigigwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 36.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu buza nabo, “Mfumu, kwibo na bi tendaalile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Ige kale ga ba taba nage, “Aa ku li i citupu, mpaa ku bunganina a makubi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Inguli jo mwanakazi go ciindikizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Cwale Jesu kale ga lugwila a bazigigwa bakwe inguli ku ba sunda buti ba li botele uku lapela mu nako jonse mi ba leke uku zwafa. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Kale ga ta nage, “Mu munzi gumwinya mo ka li u muatuli uju ta ka jogete Nyambe no ku sa twalikiza ingana ku bintu ba gaja a bantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Mi momo mu munzi, mo ka li u mwanakazi go mfwilwa, uju ka kezanga kwakwe keza ku mu kumbilanga nage, ‘U ndi atwile intaba jangu ku muntu uju a ndi zimbite.’<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />“Na kwa ita a manako a mangi jojo muatuli na kana. Kono ku mamaninino kale ga li ta gemwini nage, ‘No ku ta ndi jogete Nyambe kampa uku twalikiza ingana kwe bi ba gaja a bantu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />kono kakuli joju umfwilwa ga sa ndi tembeka inako jonse, kuti ndi bone buti ga sa atulelwa, buti a leke uku kezanga kwangu inako jonse na ndi tembeka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Mi u Mfumu Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Nga mu tegeleze kwe bi a gamba u muatuli ta kwesi initi. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Mi no Nyambe buti ta na letele inkatulo ku bantu bakwe aba na ga shala, aba ba lilila kwakwe a kamwi no masiku? Buti kuti aba kaninange? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nda sa mi lugwila, kuti na bone buti ba sa gwana inkatulo wangu. Nanganceciba, aa na keze u Mwana Muntu, buti kuti na gwane inzumino mwilonga?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo Mufalisi no Mutentesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Jesu kale ga lugwila jeji inguli ku bantu bamwinya aba ba li bonisa u bundume bo ku lulikila kwabo no ku shwauzanga a bantu bonse nage, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“A bankosi bo bile se ba ja ku tempele ka lapela. Jumwinya ka li Mufalisi, mi jumwinya ka li mutentesi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />U Mufalisi kale ga zimana genke no ku lapela nage, ‘Nyambe, nda sa litumela kwako buti ta ndi kozete a bantu bamwinya, a basa, no batendi bo bubi, bo cise kampa sinagwe njo joju u mutentesi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ndi la ku linyimanga i bilyo ko bile mu nsunda no ku wa ce kumi co bintu byonse ibi ndi gwana.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Kono u mutentesi kale ga ka zimanina u kule. Ta ka gola no ku ligamina kwigulu. Kono kale ga kaba a cizuba cakwe no ku ta nage, ‘Nyambe, u ndi fwile inse, nde muntu go bitendantu i bimangoju.’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />“Nda sa mi lugwila buti jojo unkosi, na ga bogwela ku munzi bu bulite u mulandu kwa Nyambe ku ita jojo u Mufalisi. Kakuli u muntu gense uju a li kulisa gemwini kuti na gombaazwe mi uju a li gombaaza gemwini, kuti na kulisigwe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa wa a banuke imfwijaguzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Male 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />A bantu ka ba leta kame no banuke-gana kwa Jesu buti aba we imfwijaguzi. A bazigigwa aa ba bona bulyaa, kale ba ba jukukila. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Kono Jesu kale ga kugila a banuke kwakwe no ku ta buti, “Mu leke a banuke-gana ba keze kwangu, mi mu leke uku ba binda, kakuli u mubuso gwa Nyambe ngwa bantu bo ku koza baba. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Mbyaconse wawa ndi mi lugwila buti, u muntu gense uju ta na tambule u mubuso gwa Nyambe sinagwe mwanuke-gana, ta na gu ngine.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu no nkosi ka kwesi u lubono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Male 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />U mujendesi jumwinya kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Gwe muzigi u mulotu, mbinzi ndi botele uku tenda buti ndi jobole u bumi ta bu mani?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ncinzi aa u ndi kuga buti ndi li mulotu? Takuli u mulotu mbwita Nyambe genke. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />U li zekelele i milao ji ta buti, ‘U leke uku tenda i cise, u leke uku yaga, u leke uku iba, u leke uku paka byo manya, u kutike isho no nyoko.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Lujendo 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Mulao 5:16-20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Ige nage, “Byonse byebyo ndi li bi kutikite ku zwililila ku bwanuke bwangu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Jesu aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga mu ta nage, “U si bulite i cintu conke, u gulise i bintu byonse ibi u kwesi mi u we ku bampale, mi kuti no be no lubono mwigulu. Cwale u keze u ndi umpilile.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga tompa lwini, kakuli ka kwesi u lubono lwini. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Jesu kale ga mu lola no ku ta nage, “Mbukababu bwa buti ku muntu a kwesi u lubono uku ngina mu mubuso gwa Nyambe! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Wawa, mbutole inkamele aa ji itila mu linsho lyo nsonga ku ita u muntu a kwesi u lubono uku ngina mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />A ba na ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba buza nabo, “Elu mbani na ba jojeswe?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “I bintu ta bi golaali ku bantu, kwa Nyambe bi la golaala.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Pitolosi kale ga mu ta nage, “Iswe na twa leka i bintu byonse no ku ku umpilila.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, takuli u muntu gense uju na ga leka u munzi kampa u mukazi, bancegwe no bakulwe bo bankosi no banakazi kampa a bazazi kampa a bana, kebaka lyo mubuso gwa Nyambe <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />uju na kangwe uku tambula mu manako a mangi i bintu ibi na ga leka mo muno mu nako, no ku tambula u bumi ta bu mani mu nako ji keza.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gamba byo lufu lwakwe lya tatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Male 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Jesu kale ga indila a bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile kumbali no ku ba lugwila nage, “Se tu la ja kwa Jelusalema, mi i bintu byonse ibi na bya ñolegwa ku baboni ba Nyambe byangu nde Mwana Muntu, se bi la ka vumbilizwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kuti na ndi wegwe ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. Kuti na ba ndi nyungulule, ku ndi tukagula, no ku ndi suwagila a mate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Kuti na ba ndi shape no ku ndi yaga kono mwijuba lya tatu kuti na ndi buke kame.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />A bazigigwa kale ba kangwa uku bi shugwilisa. I ntansululo jabyo ka ji bikitwe kwabo, mi ta ka ba zekelele ibi ka gambagula.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza i ciofu ca mwa Jeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Male 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Jesu aa se ka kokelele u munzi gwa Jeliko, unkosi u muofu ka kele ambali no nzila na kumbila. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Aa shugwa u muyubingi go bantu aba ka ba ita, kale ga buza ibi ka bi tendaala. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Kale ba mu lugwila nabo, “Ndi Jesu gwa Nanzaleta a ita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Kale ga kugiliza nage, “Jesu Mwana Deviti, u ndi fwile inse!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />A bantu aba ka ba tangilile, kale ba mu jukukila no ku mu lugwila buti a ombelele. Kono kale ga gongolekeza uku kugiliza nage, “Mwana Deviti, u ndi fwile inse!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Jesu kale ga zimana no ku ta jojo unkosi buti a letigwe kwakwe. Aa sa la kezi afuwi, Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Ncinzi u shaka buti ndi ku tendele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Kale ga taba nage, “Mfumu, kame ndi shaka uku bona.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U tambule imbono jako, inzumino jako ji la ku ozi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Aobulyo, kale ga tambula imbono jakwe no ku umpilila Jesu, na lumba Nyambe. A bantu bonse aa se ba la boni bulyao, kale ba lumba Nyambe nabo.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Jesu no Zakia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Jesu kale ga ngina mwa Jeliko, mi kame ka ita. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Momo mo ka li unkosi ka kwesi lwini u lubono gwezina lya Zakia, uju ka li mutentesi u mukulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Kame ka shakite uku bona Jesu buti kalini, kono kakuli ka li mufuwi ta ka gola uku bona egulu lyo bantu a bangi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Cwale kale ga tiga ku li tangiza no ka lija ku cishamu co bukuju<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Cigelike no mu mabuka gamwinya mbuti ku ñolelwe izo cishamu co cikomola.</char></note> buti a mu bone, ko ku ta buti Jesu mwa jejo inzila ka keza.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Jesu aa keza ku sika afuwi no ao, kale ga ligama no ku mu ta buti, “Zakia, suka wangu. Shunu mwilapa lyako ndi botele u ka kala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Aobulyo, kale ga suka no ku tambula Jesu bu jangele.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />A bantu bonse aa ba bona bulyao, kale ba tatika uku tongauka nabo, “A la ji no ka ba unyenda go muntu go bitendantu i bimangoju.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Kono Zakia kale ga zimana no ku ta u Mfumu nage, “Mfumu, ngo lole! Aano cwale se ndi la wa icika lyo bintu ndi munite ku bampale, mi ati se ndi omenena u muntu jumwinya a cintu cimwinya, kuti ndi mu life kone.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Shunu injojeso ji la kezi aano a mubanda, kakuli joju unkosi nage ndi mwana Abbulaama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kakuli ime, nde Mwana Muntu, kame na nda keza ku shaka no ku jojesa ici ka ci jobete.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo baika be kumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Aa ka ba si tegeleze kwa byebyo kale ga nungako ko ku ba lugwila inguli, kakuli se ka li afuwi no munzi gwa Jelusalema mi a bantu ka ba gaja buti u mubuso gwa Nyambe se gwe ku bonaala wangu.<verse eid="LUK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Kale ga ta nage, “U mwana uju na ga bonenwa mu luasi lo cimfumu kale ga ja kwilonga lya kule buti na ka jobozigwe u bumfumu mi na ka bogole. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Cwale kale ga kuga a baika bakwe be kumi no ku ba wa a masheleñi aga a botele uku gwana u muntu a myezi jo tatwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya ga sa ta buti masheleñi ga kugigwa “minas.” </char></note> Kale ga ta nage, ‘Musebelise gaga a masheleñi ku twala aa na ndi ka bogwele.’<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />“Kono a bantu aba ka busa ka ba mu zimbite, mi kale ba tumako a bantu ku mu umpiliza no ka mu ta buti, ‘Ta tu shaki jojo unkosi uku ba mfumwetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Nanganceciba, kale ga jobozwa u bumfumu, no ku bogola ku munzi. Mi kale ga kuga a baika aba na ga wa a masheleñi, buti a bone ibi na ba gwana a masheleñi.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />“Gwe tanzi kale ga keza no ku ta nage, ‘Mfumwangu, isheleñi lyako na lya gwana inkambikile jo masheleñi ge kumi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />“Mfumwe kale ga taba nage, ‘Na gwa tenda nenja, gwe muika gwangu u mulotu! Kakuli na gwa sepaala mu bintu i binunu, u buse i minzi je kumi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />“Gwa bili kale ga keza no ku ta nage, ‘Mfumwangu, isheleñi lyako na lya gwana inkambikile jo masheleñi ga 5.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />“Mfumwe kale ga taba nage, ‘Negwe u buse i minzi ja 5.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Cwale u muika jumwinya kale ga keza no ku ta nage, ‘Mfumwangu, ili nde sheleñi lyako. Mbulyo na nda li bika kungi na li lele mu kaempela ko kasila. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ka ndi ku jogete, kakuli u li nkosi u mukababu. U la ku inda i bintu ibi ta na gwa tulamo no ku zimbula ibi ta na gwa byala.’<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />“Mfumwe kale ga taba nage, ‘Kuti ndi ku atule ko majwi gako, gwe muika u mubi! Ko zekelele buti, ndi li nkosi u mukababu uju a inda i bintu ibi ta na nda tulamo, no ku zimbula ibi ta na nda byala indi mbuti? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Cwale ncinzi aa ta na gwa litusisa a masheleñi gangu mumpisinisi, buti aa ndi ka bogola ka ndi gwanika a masheleñi no nkambikile jago?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Cwale kale ga ta kwa ba ka ba zimeneo nage, ‘Mu mu tape lelyo isheleñi no ku li wa uju a kwesi a masheleñi ge kumi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />“Babo a baika, kale ba ta nabo, ‘Mfumwetu, sa li kwesi kale a masheleñi ge kumi!’<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Kale ga taba nage, ‘Nda sa mi lugwila buti, ku muntu gense uju a kwesi, kuti na ku wegwe i bingi, kono ku muntu uju ta kwesi cimwinya, nanga ncintu ici a kwesi kuti na ci indigwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Mi kwa babo a bantu aba ba ndi zimbite aba ta ka ba shaka buti ndi be u mfumu gwabo, mu ba lete kuno no ku ba yaga na ndi lolelele.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ngina mwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Male 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joa 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku gamba bulyao, kale ga tangilila ku kambamina kwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Aa se ka ba kokelele afuwi no minzi ja Bbetifage mane no Bbetaniya Elundu lya Olive, kale ga tuma bo bile ku bazigigwa bakwe, no ku ba ta nage, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Mu je mwa gogu u munzi ugu se mu kokelele, mi aa sa ka muka nginemo, kuti mu ka gwane a kambongolo-gana aka ka sungitwe momo, aka ka sini ku tendigwa impeleswa. Mu ka ka sungulule no ka ka leta ko kuno. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ati u muntu jumwinya na mi buza buti, ‘Ncinzi mu ka sungulwila?’ Mu te buti, ‘Nu Mfumu aka zunda.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />A ba na ba tumigwa kale ba ka ja no ka gwana ku ja ubu na ga ba tela. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Aa ka ba kwesi uku sungulula a kambongolo, a beni bako kale ba ba buza nabo, “Ncinzi mu sungulwila a kambongolo?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Kale ba taba nabo, “Nu Mfumu aka zunda.”<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Kale ba ka leta kwa Jesu, no ku shonjela i bizwato byabo a kambongolo no ku mu tulao. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Aa ka kaja bulyao, a bantu kale ba jala i bizwato byabo mu nzila.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus’ triumphal entry" file="lb00315b.jpg" size="span" loc="Luk 19:32-40" ref="19:32-40">Jesu aa ngina mwa Jelusalema ko bumfumu</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Aa senena afuwi no cibaka aa ka ji sezumukila inzila ku zwa Elundu lya Olive, u bungi bonse bo bazigigwa kale ba tatika uku lumba Nyambe bu jangele ko majwi a manene kebaka lyo mamakazo gonse aga na ba bona. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Kale ba lumba nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Imfwijaguzi nja mfumu uju a keza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">mwizina lyo Mfumu!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Nimbo 118:26</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Uku joja nenja mwigulu no mpazimo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">mwigulu lya kwigulu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />A Bafalisi bamwinya mukati ko bantu a bangi kale ba ta Jesu nabo, “Muzigi, jukukila a bazigigwa bako!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Nda sa mi lugwila ati na ba ombelela, a mabwe kuti ga kumbagane.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa lilila u munzi gwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Jesu aa se ka kokelele Jelusalema kale ga gu bona no ku gu lilila, kale ga ta nage, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />“Nanga ndigwe, ka li no la zibi bulyo mwa le lino ijuba ici ka ci botele uku ku letela uku joja nenja, kono aano ci li bikitwe mu mensho gako. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />A majuba kuti na ga keze ako aba ba ku zimbite aa na ba jake u lubaga ku ku lwisa no ku ku zimbuluka no ku ku galila mu mbazu jonse. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Kuti na ba ku sagile ansi, igwe no bano mukati ko mamota gako. Ta na ba leke ibwe li kambi egulu lya limwinya, kakuli ta na gwa nangula inako ja Nyambe jo keza ku ku jojesa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa tanda a bagulisi mu tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Male 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joa 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Jesu aa ngina mu tumpetu to tempele kale ga tatika uku tandila kunze aba ka ba gulisa. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Ku li ñoletwe buti, ‘Injugo jangu kuti na ji be injugo jo ntapelo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isaya 56:7</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 19:46">Kono inwe na mwa ji tenda ‘a malibiko go basa.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Jelemiya 7:11</ref>. </char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Mwijuba-mwijuba Jesu ka ziga mu tempele. Kono a mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao mane no manduna mukati ko bantu ka ba jeleka uku mu yaga. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Kono ta ka ba gwana u mutendelo go bu ka ba golela uku mu yagila, kakuli a bantu bonse nku majwi gakwe ka ba gunzilile.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Uku ka ji zwa inguzu ja Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Male 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ijuba limwinya, Jesu aa ka kwesi uku ziga a bantu mu tumpetu to tempele, na kwesi uku ba gambaguza byo majwi a malotu, a mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao, antu-onke no manduna, kale ba keza kwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Kale ba ta nabo, “U tu lugwile uku ji zwa inguzu iji ji ku tendisa byebyo i bintu. Ndini na ga ku wa jeji inzuminino?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Neme kuti ndi mi buze ibuzi. Mu ndi lugwile, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />inkolobezo ja Joani nkwigulu ka ji zwa kampa nku bantu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Kale ba li gambaguza mukati kabo no ku ta nabo, “Ati na tu ta buti ‘Nkwigulu ka ji zwa,’ kuti a buze buti, ‘Ncinzi aa ta na mwa mu zumina?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kono ati na tu ta buti, ‘Nku bantu ji zwa,’ a bantu bonse kuti ba tu sobagule no mabwe, kakuli ba li logwete buti Joani ka li muboni gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Cwale kale ba taba nabo, “Ta tu zekelele uku ka ji zwa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Neme ta ndi mi lugwile inguzu ndi litusisa mu ku tenda byebi i bintu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo balindi begwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Male 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Jesu kale ga nungako ko ku gambaguza a bantu jeji inguli nage, “Unkosi sa byala igwa lya veine, no ku li wa a balimi bamwinya buti ba li linde. Mi na ka li jila u kungi a nako inde.<verse eid="LUK 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />“A nako jo ku zimbula, kale ga tuma u muika ku balindi buti ba ka mu we kwa bimwinya byo biyango bya mwigwa. Kono a balindi kale ba mu kaba no ku mu bogoza bulyo uku takuli ici a kwatilile mu maganja. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Kale ga tuma u muika jumwinya, kono nage kale ba mu kaba no ku mu talula ko nshoni no ku mu bogoza bulyo uku takuli ici a kwatilile mu maganja. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Kame kale ga tuma u muika gwa tatu, mi nage kale ba mu kubaza no ku mu shonjela kunze.<figure style="fig" alt="Cluster of grapes" file="hk00111b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luk 20:9-12" copy="Knowles" ref="20:9-12">Biyango bya veine</figure><verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />“Cwale u mwini igwa lya veine kale ga ta nage, ‘Mbuti sa ka ndi tendele? Kuti na ndi tume mwanangu uju ndi shaka, bunga kuti na ba ka mu kutike.’<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />“Kono a balindi aa ba mu bona, kale ba gambagula a jejo intaba kame nabo, ‘Uju ndo mujoboli, ndokweni tu mu yage buti tu jobole igwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Cwale kale ba mu shonjela kunze jegwa no ka mu yaga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Cwale mbuti ka tendela u mwini gwa kwabo? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Kuti na keze no ku yaga babo a balindi no ku wa igwa kwa bangi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">A bantu aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba ta buti, “I bintu bya bulyaa na bi leke uku tendaala!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Jesu kale ga ba lolelela wawa no ku buza nage, “Ni ntoloko ja buti iji ji ñoletwe buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Ibwe na ba kana a bajaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ndebwe na lya ba lyo nsumpo.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibwe ndya ku koza sinagwe ncishamu co ku sumpisa injugo. Kakuli a majugo getu no bishamu tu ga sumpisanga ta li mabwe.</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nimbo 118:22</ref>.</char></note>?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />“Mi u muntu gense uju na gwile a lelyo ibwe, kuti na koshagulwe mu bituntula, mi u muntu gense uju na li gwile, kuti na sagigwe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />A bazigi bo mulao no mapulisiti a bakulu, kale ba shaka a kaito ko ku mu shumina wangu, kakuli na ba ziba buti na ga gamba jeji inguli iji ka ji ba lwisa. Kono ka ba jogete a bantu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Byo ku tenteka kwa Sesale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Male 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ko ku shaka inako indotu jo ku mu kwata, kale ba tuma a bajunji, aba ka ba li bonisa uku sepaala. Ka ba kwesi insepo jo ku kwata Jesu mu cintu cimwinya ici na ga gamba, buti ba mu tambike ku nguzu no bujendesi bo mubusisi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Cwale a bajunji kale ba mu buza nabo, “Muzigi, tu li zekelele wawa buti to kwesi u mushalo kakuli i bintu u kwesi uku gamba no ku ziga a bantu, bi li kele nenja, mi gwa sa ziga initi jo nzila ja Nyambe. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Cwale ngo tu lugwile, tu li botele uku tentekanga a masheleñi go mutenteko kwa Sesale u mfumu go Maloma, kampa ta tu botele?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Jesu kale ga nangula u tucawa twabo no ku ba ta nage, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Nga mu ndi sunde isheleñi lyo buwaya-waya. I cifateo ne zina ibi bi li aa, mbyani?” Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Mbya Sesale.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ee, mu we Sesale i bintu ibi bi botele Sesale, mi no kwa Nyambe i bintu ibi bi botele Nyambe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Kale ba kangwa uku mu kwata mu bintu na ga gamba akati ko bantu. Mi ko ku komokwa ko ntabo jakwe, kale ba ombelela.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa buzigwa a ntaba jo mbuko jo bafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Male 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />A Basaduki bamwinya, aba ba ta buti takuli imbuko jo bafu, kale ba keza kwa Jesu ne buzi. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Kale ba ta nabo, “Mushe sa tu ñolela buti, ‘Ati unkosi na fwa, ku leka mukazi gwakwe uku ta kwesi a bana, mwancegwe gwa jojo u mufu, a li botele uku sesa jojo umfwilwa no ku letela u mufu a bana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Cwale nko ka ba li a bana ba 7 bo luasi lonke. Nkulu jabo kale ga sesa u mwanakazi, kono kale ga fwa uku ta kwesi u mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Uju a mu umpa kale ga sesa jojo umfwilwa <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />mane no gwa tatu kale ga mu sesa, mi mu nzila jonke bonse ba 7 kale ba fwa, uku ta ba la gwaniko a bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ku mamaninino, u mwanakazi kale ga fwa nage. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Cwale a mbuko jo bafu kuti na ka be mukazi gwani, kakuli ba 7 bonse se ba mu sesa?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “A bantu ba le lino ilonga, ba la sesa no ku sesegwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Kono a bantu na ba botelelwe uku gwana u lubazu mu bumi bu keza no mu mbuko jo ku zwa ku bafu ta na ba sese no ku wegwa mu maseswa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Mi ta ba si fwi, kakuli se mba ku koza a mañiloi. Mbana Nyambe kakuli se mbana bo mbuko. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Kono mu ntaba jo civuna ka ci jakila u mulilo, nanga ndi Mushe na ga sunda buti a bafu ba sa buka, kakuli sa kuga u Mfumu Nyambe buti ndi ‘Nyambe gwa Abbulaama, no Nyambe gwa Isaka, no Nyambe gwa Jakobo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Lujendo 3:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Nyambe ta li ndi Nyambe go bantu ba fwite, kono ngwa bantu ba joja, kakuli kwakwe bonse ba la joja.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bamwinya bo bazigi bo mulao, kale ba taba nabo, “Muzigi u la gambi nenja!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Mi takuli u muntu na ga mu buza a mabuzi gamwinya ku nungako kame.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilesite ndi Mwanani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Male 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Mi Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ncinzi a ku tegwa buti u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe ndi mwana Deviti? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Kakuli Deviti ige wawa sa gamba mwibuka lyo Nimbo buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:42" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘U Mfumu, sa ta kwa mfumwangu, nage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">u kale kwiganja lyangu lyo mulyo<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />ku twala aa na ndi tende aba ba ku zimbite a malyatilo go matende gako.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nimbo 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Deviti sa mu kuga u ‘Mfumu.’ Mbuti ka golela kame uku ba mwane?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa nanguza a bazigi bo mulao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Male 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />A bantu bonse aa ka ba si tegeleze, Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mu nangule a bazigi bo mulao. Mba ku shaka uku jenda bu jabele i mikanjo i mile no ku shaka uku zuminizwa kekute mu bibaka byo magulikizo no ku kala mu bikalo byo butokwa lwini mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda no mu bibaka bi kutekea mu mikiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Na ba omenena a bamfwilwa mi ko ku li wa na ba lapela a matapelo a male. Baba a bankosi kuti na ba bangisigwe lwini wawa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Impo jo mwanakazi go mfwilwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Male 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Jesu aa lola, kale ga bona a bantu bo lubono ba tula a mampo gabo mu cibiko co tempele. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Kale ga bona kame no mwanakazi go mfwilwa umpale a tulamo u tusheleñi to bile u tununu to buwaya-waya. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Nda sa mi ta wawa buti, joju u mwanakazi go mfwilwa umpale a la tulimo i bingi ku ita a bantu bonse. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Bonse baba a bantu ba la wi a mampo gabo ku zwisa a lubono lwabo, kono joju u mwanakazi, mu bumpale bwakwe a la tuli byonse ibi ka botele uku joja a byo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Injoneko jo tempele no majuba go mamaninino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Male 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />A bazigigwa bakwe bamwinya kale ba gambagula byo bulotu bobu ka ji jakilwe i tempele ko mabwe a malotu no ko mampo ka ga wegwa kwa Nyambe. Kono Jesu kale ga ta nage, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Ka byebyo i bintu mu wene aano, inako kuti na ji keze aa ta na ku lekigwe ibwe nanga ndyonke na li kambi a limwinya. Gonse gaga kuti na ga showelwe ansi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">I nako jo mapenzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Male 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Abo kale ba buza nabo, “Muzigi, ni nakonzi na bi tendaale byebyo i bintu? Mi ncinzi na ci julike buti se bye ku tendaala?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mu mamele buti mu leke ku omigwa. Kakuli a bangi kuti na ba keze mwizina lyangu, na ba li gamba nabo, ‘Ndime Mushaligwa,’ mi, ‘I nako se ji li li a fuwi.’ Mu zwe ku ku ba umpilila. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Aa na mu shugwe byo nkondo no nsetuko jo bintu, na mu leke uku joga. Bebyo i bintu bi li botele uku tendaala tanzi, kono a mamaninino ta na ga keze aobulyo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Cwale kale ga ba ta nage, “A bantu belonga limwinya kuti na ba zimane ku lwisa belonga limwinya, mi u mubuso na gu lwise u mubuso gumwinya. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kuti na ku be no ku ukutanga kweevu u kunene, injala no malwele mu bibaka bi andene-andene, no bitendaalantu ibi bi jogisa no bijuliko i binene ku zwa kwigulu.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />“Kono byebyo na bi sini ku tendaala, kuti na ba mi kwate no ku mi pengisa. Kuti na ba mi we ku majugo go malapelelo go Majuda no ku mi tula mu ntolongo, mi kuti na mu letigwe ku bamfumu no babusisi, mi byonse nkebaka lyezina lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Mi kuti na mu ba we u bupaki bwangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mu litukiseze tanzila mu ngana jenu buti mu zwe ku ntongausi jo bu na mu li lamwinine mwebeni. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Kakuli kuti na ndi mi we a majwi no magano buti ku bule kwa ba ba mi zimbite aba na ba gole uku mi kananisa kampa uku mi lwisa.<verse eid="LUK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />“Kuti na mu legezigwe mane no ko bazazi, bakwenu no basele benu, mi kuti na ba yage bamwinya benu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />A bantu bonse kuti na ba mi zimbe kebaka lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Kono takuli u lushuki lo mutwi gwenu ulu na lu joneke. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Mu zimane bu gongwele, mi kuti na mu gwane u bumi.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Aa na mu bone u munzi gwa Jelusalema gu zimbulukitwe ku masole a mangi, na mu zibe buti injoneko jago se ji li li a fuwi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Cwale a bantu ba li mwilonga lya Judeya na ba andile ku malundu, mi aba na ba kale mu munzi na ba zwemo. Mi aba na ba gwanaale kunze jo munzi na ba leke ku ngina mu munzi. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kakuli jejo ne nako jo ku bangisa mu ku vumbiliza byonse ibi na bya ñoligwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />U bumpai u bunene kuti na bu be ku banakazi basumbele momo mu majuba no ku banakazi ba nyonsa! Kuti na ku be inkalilwa inene mwilonga no bushanshu ku lwisa baba a bantu. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Kuti na ba gwe ko kafulo a kanene mi kuti na ba indigwe sinagwe mbashuminwa ku ba twala mu malonga gonse. Jelusalema kuti na lyataguligwe ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda ku twala inako jo bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda aa na ji vumbilizwe.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kuti na ku be no bijuliko mwijuba, ku kwezi no ntungwezi. Ansi, a bantu bo malonga kuti na ba kale mu nkalilwa no bujoge kebaka lyo ku tutuma no ku shanshuwa ko makupezi gewate. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />A bantu kuti na ba zilikange kebaka lyo lyoga, ku li kalililwa ibi bi keza elonga, kakuli i bintu bya mwigulu kuti na bi ukuswe. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Momo mu nako kuti na ba ndi bone nde Mwana Muntu na ndi keza mwijoba ko nguzu no mpazimo inene. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Aa na bi tatike uku tendaala byebyo i bintu, na mu zimane bu nangukite i mitwi jenu, kakuli indamwino jenu se ji li li a fuwi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo cishamu co mulya-nshwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Male 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Jesu kale ga ba lugwila jeji inguli nage, “Mu lole ku cishamu co mulya-nshwi no bishamu byonse. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Bi si tumpila a mani, mu la gola uku bona mwebeni no ku ziba buti imvumbi se ji li li afuwi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Nanga na ku ba bulyao, mu si bona byebi i bintu bi tendaala, mu zibe buti u mubuso gwa Nyambe se gu li li afuwi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, lo luno luasi wawa ta na lu mane byonse byebi i bintu uku ta bi la tendaali. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Igulu nelonga kuti na bi mane, kono a majwi gangu ta na ga zweko.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mu mamele, buti i myojo jenu ji leke ku kokelwa ansi ko mikiti, u budakwa no nkengejezi jo bumi, buti lelyo ijuba na li mi kwate wangu-wangu sinagwe nkaswa. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kakuli kuti na li kezele a bantu bonse aba ba joja elonga lyonse. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mu kale na mu li bambite inako jonse, no ku lapela buti na mu gole uku anda ku bintu byonse ibi se bi shaka uku tendaala, buti mu ka gole uku zimana afuwi neme nde Mwana Muntu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mwijuba-mwijuba, Jesu ka ziga mu malapa go tempele, mi a matengu no matengu ka janga no ka kala a masiku gonse elundu li kugigwa Ilundu lya Olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Mi a bantu bonse ka ba menekelanga ku tempele a masiku-siku keza ku mu tegeleza.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Judasi aa zumina uku legeza Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Male 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joa 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Cwale u Mukiti go Binkwa Ta bi Umelwe ugu ka gu kugigwa i Mpaseka, se ka gu li afuwi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />A mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao ka ba shaka a kaito ka bo ku yagila Jesu, kakuli ka ba jogete a bantu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Cwale Satani kale ga ngina mwa Judasi, uju ka kugigwa Isikaliota, jumwinya go bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Mi Judasi kale ga ja ku mapulisiti a bakulu no babusisi aba ka ba mamela i tempele, no ka gambagula nabo ubu ka golela uku legezeza Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Kale ba jangala no ku zumina uku mu wa a masheleñi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Judasi kale ga zumina, mi kale ga tatika uku shaka a kaito ko ku ba wa Jesu uku takuli a bantu a bangi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mulalilo go mamaninino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Male 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joa 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Cwale ijuba lyo Mukiti go Binkwa Ta bi Umelwe kale lya sika ili ka ku tagilwanga ingu-gana jo Mpaseka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Jesu kale ga tuma Pitolosi no Joani nage, “Mu jende no ka tu lukiseza u mulalilo go Mpaseka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Kale ba buza nabo, “Kwibo u shaka buti tu ka gu lukisizeko?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Aa sa ka mu ngine mu munzi, kuti mu shangane unkosi a indite a kazunga ko menzi, mu mu umpilile ku njugo u mu sa ka ka ngine. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mi mu ka te u mwini njugo buti, ‘U muzigi ga sa buza buti, kwibo ka li a kampetu mu njugo jo banyenda, u mu ndi botele uku lila u mulalilo go Mpaseka no bazigigwa bangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Kuti a mi sunde a kampetu a kanene ka egulu, aka ka bambitwe nenja. Mu ka tendelemo a matukiso.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Pitolosi no Joani kale ba ja no ka gwana i bintu bi kele sinagwe ubu sa ba tela Jesu. Mi kale ba ka tendelamo u mulalilo go Mpaseka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mulalilo go Mfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Male 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Mak 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Inako aa se ji la siki, Jesu no batumigwa bakwe, kale ba kala ku zela intafule. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Ka ndi shakite wawa uku lya gogu u mulalilo go Mpaseka nenwe na ndi sini ku penga. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kakuli nda sa mi lugwila buti, ta ndi si gu li kame mbwita aa na gu ka vumbilizwe mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<figure style="fig" alt="Last Supper" file="wa03909b.jpg" size="span" loc="Luk 22:14-20" ref="22:14-20">U mulalilo go mamaninino</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Jesu aa sa la indi inkomoki, kale ga litumela no ku ta nage, “Mu ji inde mu shutagulemo mwense. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kakuli nda sa mi lugwila buti ta ndi si nywi kame i cinywantu ci zwa ku ciyango co cishamu ca veine, mbwita u mubuso gwa Nyambe aa na gu keze.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Mi kale ga inda i cinkwa, no ku wa u bulitumelo no ku ci komona, no ku ci ba wa, no ku ta nage,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 22:19">“Gogu mubili gwangu na gwa wegwa kebaka lyenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 22:19">mu tende ceci mu ku ndi gaja.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Mu mutendelo gu li kozete, aa se ba la mani uku lya u mulalilo kale ga inda inkomoki, no ku ta nage, “Jeji inkomoki ni nzumininano impya mu malowa gangu, aga ga sintigwa kebaka lyenu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Kono u muntu uju na ndi legeze neme a kele aano a ntafule. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ime nde Mwana Muntu, kuti na ndi fwe sinagwe ubu se ku lukisezwa. Kono mbumpai kwa jojo u muntu uju a ndi legeza!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Kale ba tatika uku li buzagula mwalyabo buti ndini gwabo uju ka botele uku tenda bulyao.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkani mukati ko bazigigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kale kwa buka inkani mukati ko bazigigwa buti u munene wawa kwabo ndini. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “A bamfumu bo bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda ba sa ba jendesa, mi aba ba kwesi inguzu egulu lyabo ba sa li kuga buti mbasele bo bantu. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Kono inwe ta li mbobo mu botele uku kalila bulyao. Ko ku andana, u munene wawa mukati kenu a li botele uku ba sinagwe ndo mwanuke wawa, mi uju a jendesa a koze sinagwe muika. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kakuli u munene njwibo, uju a kele a ntafule kampa uju a sebeza? Buti ta li ndi jojo a kele a ntafule? Kono ime ndi li kele mukati kenu sinagwe ndi li muika.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Ndinwe balya na mwa ndi zimana kumbali mu makababu gangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Mi nda sa wa u mubuso enu, sinagwe ubu na ga gu wela Tata angu, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />buti na mu lile no ku nywina a ntafule jangu mu mubuso gwangu no ku kala a bikalo byo bumfumu, ku atula a maasi ge kumi no go bile ga Isilaele.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ganuna byo nshampulo ja Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Male 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joa 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simoni, Simoni, Satani na ga kumbila buti a mi vulule sinagwe muntu a vulula u buloto.<verse eid="LUK 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />“Kono na nda ku lapelela, Simoni, buti inzumino jako ji leke uku kangwa. Mi aa so la ka bogoli, u gongoze bakwako a bazigigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Kono Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Mfumwangu, ndi li litukiseze uku ja negwe ku ntolongo no ku lufu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Pitolosi, nda sa ku lugwila buti, silukombwe na sini uku tungula shunu, kuti u ndi shampula ko tatwe buti to ndi zi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Alya se ndi mi tuma uku takuli i cikwama, u mukotana kampa inshangu, mbinzi na mwa ka bula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Abo kale ba taba nabo, “Takuli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Kono aano ati u li kwesi i cikwama, u ci inde, mi no mukotana bulyao. Ati to kwesi a kafulo a kanene, u gulise i cijabalo cako no ku ka li gulila. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ku li ñoletwe buti, ‘Mi na ga balilwa ku bijoni.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isaya 53:12</ref>.</char></note> Mi nda sa mi lugwila buti byebyo bi li botele uku vumbilizwa mwangu. Ee, i bintu ibi bi ñoletwe byangu se bi la sika a mvumbilizo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />A bazigigwa kale ba ta nabo, “Mfumwetu, ngo lole, utu nto tufulo to bile u tunene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ntungi toto.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa lapela Elundu lya Olive</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Male 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Jesu kale ga ja Kwilundu lya Olive sinagwe ubu ka tendelelanga. No bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu umpilila. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Aa se ba la ka sikiko, kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu lapele buti mu leke uku gwila mu mujeleko.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kale ga ba leka ku senena u kule kanunu kale ga tongama no ku lapela nage, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Tata ati u la shaka u inde jeji inkomoki kwangu, jebo ta li nka ku shaka kwangu, kono ku tendigwe ubu shakile.”<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Iñiloi ka li zwa kwigulu kale lya li bonaaza kwakwe no ku mu gongoza. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Mi ko ku kala mu nkalilwa, kale ga lapela lwini, mi i cituku-tuku cakwe kale ca ba sinagwe malowa ga tampaukila ansi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Aa sa la mani uku lapela no ku bogwela ku bazigigwa bakwe, kale ga ka ba gwana se ba lele, mu bukotelele bu zwa ku ku tompa. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Ncinzi aa mu lele? Mu buke no ku lapela buti mu leke uku gwila mu mujeleko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa shuminigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Male 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Joa 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Jesu aa ka si gambagula byebyo, kale kwa keza a bantu a bangi, no nkosi uju ka kugigwa Judasi, jumwinya go bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile, na ba tangilile. Kale ga keza kwa Jesu buti a mu sonsone.<verse eid="LUK 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Kono Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Judasi, kame u ndi legeza ime nde Mwana Muntu ko ku ndi sonsona?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />A baumpilili ba Jesu aa ba bona i bintu ibi ka bi tendaala, kale ba ta nabo, “Mfumwetu, neswe tu kajagule ko tufulo twetu u tunene?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Mi jumwinya gwabo kale ga kajula u muika go mupulisiti u mukulu, no ku koshola u kutwi kwakwe kwa ku mulyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Kono Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mu leke uku tenda bulyao kame.” Mi kale ga kwata u kutwi kwa jojo unkosi no ku mu oza.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Mi Jesu kale ga ta a mapulisiti a bakulu no babusisi aba ka ba mamela i tempele, no manduna aba na ba mu kezela nage, “Buti ndi li muzokeli aa mu la kezi no tufulo no bivuni? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mwijuba-mwijuba ka ndi kalanga nenwe mu tumpetu to tempele, mi ta na mwa ndi kwata. Kono je jino ne nako jenu a kansindwe aa ka busa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa shampula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Male 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Joa 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Kale ba kwata Jesu, mi kale ba mu twala no ka mu tula mu njugo jo mupulisiti u mukulu. Pitolosi kale ga umpilila na jendela u kule. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Mi bamwinya momo aa se ba la kolezi u mulilo akati ke lapa mi aa se ba la kali ansi bonse, Pitolosi kale ga kala ansi nabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />U muika go mukazana kale ga mu bona na keleo mwituba lyo mulilo. Kale ga mu lolisisa nenja no ku ta nage, “Joju unkosi, ka kalanga nage.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Kono Pitolosi kale ga shampula. Kale ga ta nage, “Mwanakazi, ta ndi mwizi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Mu nako imfuwi bulyo, jumwinya kale ga mu bona no ku ta nage, “U li jumwinya gwabo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Gwenkosi, ta li ndi li gwabo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Aa se ku la iti inako inde jumwinya kale ga indikila nage, “Wawa joju ka kalanga nage, kakuli nage Mugalileya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Gwenkosi, ta ndi zi i bintu u gambagula!” Aa ka si gamba, silukombwe kale ga tungula. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />U Mfumu kale ga temuna no ku lola kwa Pitolosi. Cwale Pitolosi kale ga gaja a majwi go Mfumu aga sa gamba kwakwe buti, “Silukombwe na sini uku tungula shunu, kuti u ndi shampule ko tatwe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Pitolosi kale ga anina anze no ka lila lwini.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aa ba nyungulula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Male 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />A bankosi aba ka ba mamela Jesu kale ba tatika uku mu nyungulula no ku mu kaba. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Kale ba mu shumina ku mensho no ku mu kumbila buti, “Tunga ko buboni! Ndini a la ku kabi?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Mi kale ba gamba i bintu i bingi kwakwe byo ku mu shwauza.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa twaligwa kwa Pilato no kwa Eloda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Male 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Joa 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />A masiku-siku, a kagugi ko bajendesi bo bantu, bonse a mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao, kale ba li gwana antu-onke, mi Jesu kale ga twaligwa kwabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />“Kale ba ta nabo, U tu lugwile, ati ndigwe Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ati na ndi mi lugwila, ta mu ndi zumine, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />mi ati na ndi la mi buzi, ta mu la ndi tabi. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Kono ku zwa aano, ime, nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi ka kale kwiganja lyo mulyo lya Nyambe go nguzu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bonse kale ba buza nabo, “Cwale ndigwe Mwana Nyambe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Kale ga taba nage, “Bulyao mu tela ndime.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Mi kale ba ta nabo, “Ncinzi aa tu zunda u bupaki kame? Tu la li shugwili ku zwililila mu kanwa kakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Pilato aa zekisa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Male 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joa 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Cwale a bantu bo nkuta bonse kale ba zimana no ku twala Jesu kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Mi kale ba tatika uku mu shangeza nabo, “Tula gwani joju unkosi na ungulula ilonga lyetu. Ga sa binda a bantu uku lifa i mitenteko kwa Sesale, ige kame na ta buti nde Mushaligwa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Mesiya” mu Ciebelu, “Kilesite” mu Cigelike.</char></note> u mfumu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Cwale Pilato kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Ndigwe mfumu go Majuda?” Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Bulyao u la teli!”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Cwale Pilato kale ga lugwila a mapulisiti a bakulu mane no bantu a bangi nage, “Takuli u mulandu ndi la gwani go ku atwila joju unkosi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Kono abo kale ba indikila nabo, “Ndege a leta inyungani ku bantu mwilonga lyonse lya Judeya ko nzigo jakwe. Ga li ka tatikila mwa Galileya mane ku ja no kwilonga lya Judeya konse, mane sa li li no ko kuno.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aa ba twala Jesu kwa Eloda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga ba buza ati Jesu ka li Mugalileya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Aa sa la zibi buti Jesu mwilonga lyo bujendesi bwa Eloda ka zwa, kale ga mu tumina kwa Eloda, uju ka li mwa Jelusalema mwa jejo inako.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Cwale Eloda aa bona Jesu, kale ga jangala lwini, kakuli ka lindile mu nako inde na shakite uku mu bona. Ku zwa ku bintu sa shugwa byakwe, ka kwesi insepo jo ku mu bona aa tenda i makazo jimwinya. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Eloda kale ga buzagula Jesu a mabuzi a mangi, kono Jesu ta na ga mu taba cimwinya. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />A mapulisiti a bakulu no bazigi bo mulao aba ka ba zimeneo, kale ba shangeza Jesu i bintu i bingi ko ku mu indikiza. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Cwale Eloda no masole bakwe kale ba mu sekelela no ku mu nyungulula. Kale ba mu jabika u mukanjo u mulotu, mi kale ba mu bogoza kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ku zwa lelyo ijuba Eloda no Pilato kale ba ba a basele, byebyo na bi sini uku tendaala ka ba li zimbite.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa atwilwa u lufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Male 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joa 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato kale ga kugila a mapulisiti a bakulu no bajendesi no bantu antu-onke, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />no ku ba ta nage, “Mu la ndi leteli joju unkosi ko ku ta buti ga sa letela a bantu buti ba li lwise. Ndi la mu buzaguli na mu shugwile mi ta ndi la gwani u mulandu mu bintu ibi mu mu shangeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Nanga ndi Eloda a la ka kangwi mpaa a la ka mu bogozi kwangu, sinagwe aa mu liwenene, takuli ibi na ga tenda ibi a botele uku fwila. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Cwale, kuti ndi mu bangise no ku mu lukulula.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />A nako jonse jo Mukiti go Mpaseka, Pilato ka botele uku ba lukululela u muntu genke mu ntolongo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 17.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Kono a bantu a bangi bonse kale ba kumbagana nabo, “U yage joju unkosi! U tu lukulwile Bbalabbasi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Kono Bbalabbasi kame sa tuligwa mu ntolongo kebaka lyo nkondo na ja tendaala mu munzi, no lufu lo muntu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Ko ku shaka uku lukulula Jesu, Pilato kale ga buza a bantu kame. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Kono kale ba zundamina uku kumbagana nabo, “U mu kankamine a cifapaano! U mu kankamine a cifapaano!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato kale ga ba buza lya tatu nage, “Ncinzi? Mulandunzi na ga tenda joju unkosi? Takuli u mulandu ndi la gwani ugu a botele uku fwila. Cwale kuti ndi mu bangise no ku mu lukulula.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kono kale ba kumbagana lwini buti a kankaminwe a cifapaano, mi u tukumbo twabo kale twa gola Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Cwale Pilato kale ga tenda ubu ka ba shakila. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kale ga lukulula unkosi uju sa tuligwa mu ntolongo kebaka lyo ku leta inkondo no buyagi, uju ka ba kumbila, no ku ba wa Jesu ko ku ja ko bu ka ba shakila.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aa ba kankamina Jesu a cifapaano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Male 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joa 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />A masole aa ka ba indite Jesu, kale ba kwata Simoni uju ka zwa mu munzi gwa Silene na ka zwila ku lugwa. Kale ba mu kolekisa i cifapaano na umpilile Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />A bantu a bangi kale ba umpilila Jesu, no banakazi aba ka ba lila no ku mu fwila inse. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Jesu kale ga zoka no ku ba ta nage, “Mwe banakazi ba Jelusalema, mu leke uku ndi lilila, mu li lile mwebeni no banenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kakuli inako ji la keza aa na mu te buti, ‘Imfwijaguzi nja banakazi a bagumba, aba ta ba la bona a bana no manshwe aga ta ga la nyonsa!’<figure style="fig" alt="Simon carried the cross for Jesus" file="wa03924b.jpg" size="span" loc="Luke 23:26-31" ref="23:26-31">Simoni aa koleka i cifapaano ca Jesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />‘A bantu kuti na ba te a malundu buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">“Mu tu gwile!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">mane no ku ta u tulundu-gana buti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">“Mu tu vwike!” ’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Oseya 10:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kakuli ati a bantu na ba tenda byebi i bintu i cishamu na ci si li citeke, mbuti na ku kalile aa na ci jume?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kakuli aa ku tendaala bulyao ku cishamu i citeke, ku cishamu co ku juma mbuti na ku kalile. Jesu ndege ka li ta aa ka bonisa a mapenzi gakwe jebo ka li Mwana Nyambe.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kale ba inda no bijoni byo bile mi kale ba bi twala nabyo ku ka bi kankamina. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Aa ba ka sika a cibaka ici ka ci kugigwa Katendele, kale ba kankamina Jesu koko, no byebyo i bijoni. Cimwinya ku mulyo gwa Jesu, cimwinya ku monsho gwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Tata, u ba kwatile, kakuli ta be zi ici ba tenda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya go kale ta ga kwesi gogu u mugambilo.</char></note> Kale ba li taila i bizwato byakwe ko ku tenda iñeela.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />A bantu mbulyo ka ba zimene na ba lolelele, mi a manduna na ba mu nyungulula nabo, “Ka jojesanga bamwinya, a li jojese gemwini nage ati nde Kilesite, Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mushaligwa ncitulo ca Jesu ci bonisa buti ndi Nyambe sa mu shala. Mu mushobo go Cigelike mbuti ka kugilwa buti ndi Kilesite, mi mu mushobo go Ciebelu mbuti ka kugilwa buti ndi Mesiya.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />A masole nabo kale ba keza ku mu nyungulula. Kale ba mu wa waine go ku lyelyeta. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Mi kale ba ta nabo, “Ati ndigwe mfumu go Majuda u li jojese gwemwini.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Egulu lyo mutwi gwakwe mpo ka ji li inzibiso iji ka ji ñoletwe buti, “<char style="sc">Joju nde Mfumu go Majuda</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Cimwinya co bijoni ibi ka bi anzi koko kale ca nyungulula Jesu na co, “Ta li ndigwe Mushaligwa? U li jojese gwemwini no ku tu jojesa neswe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Kono cimwinya kale ca mu jukukila na co, “Ncinzi aa to jogi Nyambe, no ku u li mu nkatulo jonke nage? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Uku bangisigwa kwetu ku li lulikile, kakuli twa sa gwana ibi bi botele i bitendantu byetu. Kono joju unkosi takuli i cimangoju ici na ga tenda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Cwale kale ca ta na co, “Jesu, no ndi gaje aa no keze mu mubuso gwako.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gamwinya a mabuka mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, “aa no keze ko nguzu jako jo bumfumu.”</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mbyaconse ndi ku lugwila, shunu kuti u kale neme mwa Paladaisi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">U lufu lwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Male 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joa 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Aa se ka ji li 12 jo kamwi, a kansindwe kale ka vwika ilonga lyonse ku twala ku nako jo ma 15. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Kakuli ijuba na lya zima. Mi isila lya mu tempele kale lya ñatuka akati. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Jesu kale ga kumba keejwi inene nage, “Tata, nda sa wa u moya gwangu mu maganja gako.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Nimbo 31:5</ref>.</char></note> Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga uja lyo mamaninino.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />U mujendesi go masole ko ku bona ibi na bya tendaala, kale ga lumba Nyambe no ku ta nage, “Ndiconse joju unkosi ka lulikile.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />A bantu bonse aba ka ba gwanene ku lolelela byebyo ka bi tendaala, kale ba bogola bu li kaba a bizuba byabo bu tompete. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Kono bonse babo aba ka ba mu zekelele, ku indilila no banakazi aba na ba mu umpilila ka zwa mwa Galileya, kale ba zimanina u kule kanunu, na ba lolelele byebi i bintu.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">I citupu ca Jesu aa ci tuligwa mwibita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Male 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joa 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Cwale nko ka li unkosi gwezina lya Josefa, uju ka li jumwinya go manduna bo nkuta jo Majuda, ka li nkosi ka kele nenja mi ka lulikile, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />ige ta na ga zumina ku migajalo jabo ne bi ka ba tenda. Mu munzi gwa Alimateya gwa mwilonga lya Judeya ka zwa, mi ige mubuso gwa Nyambe ka lindile. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Kale ga ja kwa Pilato, mi kale ga ka kumbila i citupu ca Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Cwale Josefa kale ga ka angula i citupu, no ku ci vungila mwisila ilotu no ku ci tula mwibita lyo ku conkomona mwibwe, u mu ta kwa la lalikigwa u muntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Se ka lili Ijuba lyo Bulitukiso, mi lyo Nsabata se ka li shaka uku tatika.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />A banakazi aba ka ba keza no Jesu na ba ka zwa kwa Galileya kale ba umpilila Josefa buti ba ka bone ebita no bu ka ci ka lalikilwa i citupu ca Jesu mwibita. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Cwale kale ba bogola ku munzi buti ba ka lukise a mafuta go minunko i milotu. Kono kale ba wisa lyo Nsabata ko ku kutika u mulao.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Imbuko ja Jesu ku bafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Male 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joa 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Mwijuba lyetanzi mu nsunda, a masiku-siku wawa, a banakazi kale ba inda a mafuta go minunko i milotu aga na ba lukisa no ku ja kwibita. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Kale ba ka gwana buti ibwe na lya galumunwa ku zwisigwa ebita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibita lya Jesu ka lili lyo ku conkomona mwibwe mi ta ka li li lyo ku laila nevu, ndibwe inene lyo ku koza sinagwe ndiwili na ba galumuna no ku sinka ku cizi ce lambo mi ka ku golaala uku li fwinkulao no ku nginamo sinagwe mu njugo.</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />kono aa se ba la nginimo, ta na ba ka gwana i citupu co Mfumu Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Aa ka ba si komoketwe byebyo, aobulyo a bankosi bo bile aba ka ba zwesi i bizwato byo ku pazima sinagwe ndumuni lo mvula kale ba keza ku zimana ambali nabo.<verse eid="LUK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Mu bujoge bwabo wawa a banakazi kale ba sungamina ansi, kono babo a bankosi kale ba ta nabo, “Ncinzi aa mu shakila u mumi mukati ko bafu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ta mu li mo muno, a la buki! Mu gaje ubu sa mi tela, na si kele nenwe mwilonga lya Galileya buti, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Ime nde Mwana Muntu kuti na ndi wegwe mu maganja go bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju, na ndi kankaminwe mi mwijuba lya tatu na ndi buke kame ku zwa ku bafu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Cwale kale ba vuluka a majwi gakwe.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Aa se ba la ka zwi kwibita, kale ba sukulula byebi i bintu byonse ku batumigwa be kumi no genke mane no bamwinya bonse. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Babo a banakazi, ka ba li ba Maliya Magadalena, no Joana, no Maliya nyina ba Jakobo, no bamwinya aba ka kele nabo kale ba gambaguza a batumigwa byebi i bintu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kono abo kale ba kana uku zumina i bintu ka ba sukulula babo a banakazi, kakuli a majwi gabo ka ga shugwaala sinagwe nga bugelo kwabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Kono nanganceciba bulyao Pitolosi, kale ga nanuka no ku tigilila kwibita. Aa sa la kotami, kale ga bona a masila a malotu ga li lalile gonke, mi kale ga bogola, na komoketwe kwe bi na bya tendaala.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bazigigwa bo bile aa ba ja kwa Imausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Male 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Cwale mwa lelyo ijuba a bazigigwa bamwinya bo bile babo ku munzi gu kugigwa Imausi ka ba ja, ugu ka gu li u kule kanunu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbule ka bu shaka uku sika a makilomita ga 11 kampa ga 12.</char></note> no Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Kame ka ba ja bu li gambaguza mwalyabo i bintu byonse ibi na bya tendaala. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Aa ka ba si kwesi uku li gambaguza no ku li buzagula byebi i bintu mwalyabo, Jesu kale ga keza no ku jendelela nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Kono kale ba kangwa uku mu ziba.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mbinzi mu ja bu gambagula na mu jenda?” Abo kale ba zimana, bu tompete.<verse eid="LUK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Jumwinya gwabo gwezina lya Kilopa, kale ga mu buza nage, “Ndigwe nyenda gwenke mu munzi gwa Jelusalema uju ta zekelele i bintu na bya tendaala mwa ga gano a majuba?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Jesu kale ga buza nage, “Mbintunzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Abo kale ba taba nabo, “Bya Jesu gwa Nanzaleta, uju ka li muboni gwa Nyambe, uju ka kwesi inguzu mu majwi no mu bitendantu kwa Nyambe no ku bantu bonse.<verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />“A mapulisiti a bakulu no bajendesi betu kale ba mu kwata no ku mu wa buti a atwilwe u lufu, mi kale ba mu kankamina a cifapaano. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Kono ka tu kwesi insepo buti ndege na lamwine a bantu bo luasi lwa Isilaele. Kono mbinzi kame, shunu se ndi juba lya tatu ku zwa aa na bya tendaalila byonse byebyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ko ku nungako, bamwinya bo banakazi betu ba la tu komokwisi. Ba la meneki ku ja kwibita shunu a masiku-siku <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />kono ta ba la ka gwani i citupu cakwe. Mi ba la kezi ku tu gambaguza buti ncibonwa co mañiloi ba la ka boni, aga ga la ka ba ti buti Jesu mumi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Cwale bamwinya bo bagenzetu mpa ba ja kwibita no ka gwana buti ubu kaba tela a banakazi mbobo ka ku kalile, kono ta ba la ka boni Jesu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Cwale Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu li bigelo bya buti, inwe ta mu zumini wangu ku bintu byonse ibi na ba gamba a baboni ba Nyambe! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ta li u Mushaligwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Ciebelu ndi “Mesiya”, mi mu Cigelike ndi “Kilesite”.</char></note> ka botele uku penga kwa byebi i bintu mi cwale nko ku ngina mu mpazimo jakwe?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Jesu kale ga tatikila kwa Mushe mane no byo baboni ba Nyambe bonse, no ku ba tansulwila ibi na bya gambigwa byakwe mu Mañolo gonse.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Aa se ka ba kokelele u munzi u mu ka ba ja, Jesu kale ga jenda bulyao sinagwe nkule ka ja. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Kono kale ba mu binda wawa nabo, “U kale neswe, kakuli se masiku, ijuba se lye ka gwa.” Mi kale ga jamo no ka kala nabo.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Aa se ka kele nabo a ntafule, kale ga inda i cinkwa, ku litumela no ku ci komagula mi kale ga ci ba wa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Cwale a mensho gabo kale ga togoka mi kale ba mu ziba, mi kale ga ba leguka buti ba leke uku mu bona. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Kale ba li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Ta li i myojo jetu nku bbuka ka ji bbuka-bbuka aa ka kwesi uku gambagula neswe mu nzila no ku tu vwikwila a Mañolo?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Kale ba nanuka aobulyo no ku bogola kwa Jelusalema. Kale ba ka gwana a batumigwa be kumi no genke no babo ka ba kele nabo, na ba gwanene antu-onke <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />mi kale ba ta nabo, “Mbyaconse! Mfumwetu a la buki ku bafu mi a la li bonaazi kwa Simoni.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Cwale babo bo bile kale ba gambagula ibi bi la tendaali mu nzila, no bu ba la zibili Jesu aa la komagula i cinkwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza ku bazigigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Male 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joa 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bit 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Aa ka ba si gambagula byebyo, Jesu kale ga keza ku zimana mukati kabo no ku ta nage, “Mu joje nenja.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Kale ba tilumuka no ku joga, na ba gaja nabo ncilumba ba la boni. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ncinzi aa mu zielea, mi ncinzi aa mu mamanya mu myojo jenu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Nga mu lole a maganja no matende gangu. Ndime wawa! Mu ndi kwate mi mu bone, i cilumba ta ci kwesi inyama no bifuwa, sinagwe aa mu wene buti ime ndi li bi kwesi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Aa sa la ti bulyao, kale ga ba sunda a maganja gakwe no matende. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Mi aa ka ba sini uku zumina bulyao kebaka lyo njangalo no ku komokwa, kale ga ba buza nage, “Ta mu kwesi i cintu conse co ku lya mo muno?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Kale ba mu wa u lubazu loonswi go ku ika, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />mi kale ga lu tambula no ku lu lya na ba mu lolelele.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “Bebi mbebyo se ndi mi gambaguza na ndi si kele nenwe buti, i bintu byonse bi li botele uku vumbilizwa ibi na bya ñoligwa byangu mu mulao gwa Mushe, a baboni ba Nyambe no mu Nimbo.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Kale ga ba wa i migajalo jo ku shugwilisa a Mañolo. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Kale ga ba ta nage, “I bintu bi ñoletwe mbi byebi, u Mushaligwa kuti na penge no ku buka ku zwa ku bafu mwijuba lya tatu, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />mi insiguluko jo nkwatilo jo bitendantu i bimangoju kuti na ji tandazigwe mwizina lyakwe ku malonga gonse, ku tatikila mwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Inwe mu li bampaki ba byebi i bintu. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Kuti na ndi mi tumine ici sa kuluwiza Tata, kono mu kale mwa Jelusalema ku twala aa na mu tambule inguzu ji zwa kwigulu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kambamina kwigulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Male 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bit 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Aa sa la ba twali afuwi no munzi gwa Bbetaniya, kale ga nanwina a maganja gakwe mwigulu no ku ba wa imfwijaguzi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Aa ka kwesi uku ba wa imfwijaguzi bulyao, kale ga ba leka mi kale ga twaligwa mwigulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Abo kale ba mu shogelela no ku bogola mwa Jelusalema ko njangalo inene. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Mi kale ba zundamina uku kalanga mu tempele, na ba lumba Nyambe.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>